<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id">- Mbula</book>
  <para style="h">Akas</para>
  <para style="toc3">Akas</para>
  <para style="toc2">Akas</para>
  <para style="toc1">Akasǝla</para>
  <para style="mt1">Akasǝla</para>
  <para style="imt">MƏNCAU</para>
  <para style="im">Malǝmce mala <char style="bk">Akasǝla</char> ka lumsǝ nǝ akǝɓicau mala a nza ɓara-ɓara mala do ɗwanyi nggurcau mala amǝ'Isǝrayila, a nre kutio malea a nzali Kan'ana andǝ kum murǝm malea. Aman yi akǝɓicau ka à nda amur ɓwaburaɓwa mala akanggǝrang aɓwana mala nzali mǝnana à tunǝki ama akasǝla ka; bangulea ka amǝgulo soje na, amǝ'ɓashi na kǝla mana aɓwana kǝ twali ka ɗàng. Mwashat atea mana à súrǝì kǝ̀rkǝ́r ka nda Samsǝn, mǝnana atúró male ka à gilǝia aɓa kùré lum-nong-tàrú aban ká lum-bwamdǝ-tongno-nong-mwashat (13-16) ka. Girkani mǝgule aɓa malǝmcenî ka nda mana ama, do-yilǝmu mala Isǝrayila ka do amúr nyesǝɓamuru malea aban Ɓakuli, sǝ ɗwanyi nyesǝɓamuru ka kǝ wanǝ ban a kiɗiki pwari-pwari. Sǝ gìr nakam mǝnana karmur mǝnia ka: ko ɓǝ̀ à na ama, nzalinì ɗwanyi oaki Ɓakuli, sǝ tanni yiu ka, Ɓakuli na amur kúndǝô koya pwari ɓǝ̀ amsǝ aɓwana male, yi mana ɓǝ̀ à pwanzali sǝ à nyar a baní ɗǝm ngga.</para>
  <para style="iot">Agir mǝnana a ɓālǝi ka</para>
  <para style="io1">Tsaɗi mala agir mǝnana à kumban ba lú mala Jesǝwa ka <char style="ior"><ref loc="JDG 1:1">1:1</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 2:10">2:10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Akasǝla mala Isǝrayila <char style="ior"><ref loc="JDG 2:11">2:11</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 16:31">16:31</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Agir ɗàngɗáng mǝnana à kumban ngga <char style="ior"><ref loc="JDG 17:1">17:1</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 21:25">21:25</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JDG 1" />
  <para style="s">Tàu mala Yahuda akdǝmba ká nǝ munǝo arǝ amǝ'Kan'ana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 1:1" />Anzǝm lú mala Jesǝwa ka, amǝ Isǝrayila ɗì Yahweh ama, &lt;&lt;Ya tàu nani nǝ̀ tita kánǝ munǝo arǝ amǝ'Kan'ana?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 1:2" />Yahweh earia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Tàu mala Yahuda na nǝ̀ tita ká ka. Wu sǝni, Ən pàna nzalinì a ɓabuia.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 1:3" />Amǝ'tàu mala Yahuda ne amǝ'eambia, amǝ'tàu mala Shimiyon ama, &lt;&lt;Wu yiu atà sǝm, wu bwala sǝm munǝo arǝ amǝ'Kan'ana ace ak nzali mǝnana à kasǝa sǝm ngga. Sǝ sǝm gbal ka, sǝm nǝ̀ ká atà wun ace ak nzali mǝnana à kasǝa wun ngga.&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa amǝ'tàu mala Shimiyon wari ateà. <verse eid="JDG 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 1:4" />Amǝ'tàu mala Yahuda warinǝ munǝo, sǝ Yahweh túr amǝ'Kan'ana andǝ amǝ'Periz a ɓabù amǝ'tàu mala Yahuda; sǝ à gandǝ aburana malea á-lum a Bezek. <verse eid="JDG 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 1:5" />À yi kum Adoni-bezek a Bezek, sǝ à warinǝ munǝo arǝì. À gandǝ amǝ'Kan'ana andǝ amǝ'Periz. <verse eid="JDG 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 1:6" />Adoni-bezek ɓangŋa, à pǝrte sǝ à kya bwali. À kasǝki amunabuì-mǝbure andǝ amunakusǝi-mǝbure. <verse eid="JDG 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 1:7" />Pǝlǝa Adoni-bezek bang ama, &lt;&lt;Amurǝma lumi-tongno-nong-ɓari nakam mǝnana à kasǝki amunabuia-mǝbure andǝ amunakusǝia-mǝbure ka, à kǝ tarki ɓwangina girlina aɓata kpamgbang-lǐ mem; Ɓakuli mbwenam a kúnì gìr mǝnana ǝn pakkia wia ka.&gt;&gt; À yinǝi a Urǝshalima, sǝ kya wú abanì.<verse eid="JDG 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 1:8" />Amǝ'tàu mala Yahuda soa munǝo arǝ amǝ Urǝshalima, sǝ à ak nggea-lê. À gandǝia nǝ kún nggeabyau, sǝ à soaki nggea-lê bǝsa.<verse eid="JDG 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 1:9" />Anzǝm mǝno ka, amǝ'tàu mala Yahuda wario à kya soa munǝo arǝ amǝ'Kan'ana mǝnana à ndanǝdo aɓa nzali múr-ankono, andǝ Negev, andǝ nzali kusǝ-ankono ka. <verse eid="JDG 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 1:10" />Amǝ'tàu mala Yahuda warinǝ lwa arǝ amǝ'Kan'ana mana nǝdo a Hebǝron ngga (lullǝ Hebǝron ɗiɗyal ka nda Kiriat-Arba.) À gandǝ <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 13:22">Ɓal 13:22</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 15:14">Jes 15:14</ref></char>.</note>Sheshai andǝ Ahiman andǝ Talmai.<verse eid="JDG 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 1:11" />Anzǝm mǝno ka, à warinǝ lwa arǝ aɓwana mǝnana nǝdo a Debir ka (lullǝ Debir ɗiɗyal ka nda Kiriat-Sefer.) <verse eid="JDG 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 1:12" />Pǝlǝa Kalip bang ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwa mǝnana kat lì Kiriat-Sefer nǝ lwa ka, mǝ nǝ pè wi ɓoarnsarilem Aksa ɓǝ̀ duk māmí.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 1:13" />Nda Otǝniyel, muna-ɓwabura mala Kenaz, mǝ'kyauwa Kalip lì ka, sǝ Kalip pè wi ɓoarnsarile Aksa duk māmí. <verse eid="JDG 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 1:14" />Lang Aksa yina ka, nacau nǝ Otǝniyel ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ zǝmbi wi tárrí Kalip, ɓǝ̀ pè wi nzali a liro. Pǝlǝa Aksa sulǝî nzǝm mǝdambǝriso male, sǝ Kalip ɗì ama, &lt;&lt;Mana a earkice?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 1:15" />Pǝlǝa eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ida, ɓwamuram. Nzali mǝnana a pam ngga, nda a Negev,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Negev </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ka pǝɗanban na.</char></note> ado ka pam ban mǝnana ndanǝ amgbeaɗe mùr ka gbal.&gt;&gt; Nda Kalip pè wi amgbeaɗe mùr mana a mgbang-ban andǝ amgbeaɗe mùr mana a tūliban ngga. <verse eid="JDG 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 1:16" />Amǝ'kà nkil Musa mǝɓwabure, ɓwa Ken, puro andǝ amǝ'tàu mala Yahuda, a nggea-là mala anggun nkangga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nggea-là mala anggun nkangga </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ka nda Jeriko. </char></note> sǝ à oa Arat aɓa pǝɗanban mala Yahuda, mǝnana nda a Negev ka. À wario à kya do andǝ amǝ'Amalek.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">andǝ amǝ'Amalek. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aɓea mbu-malǝmce mana à gilǝia ɗiɗyal nǝ bù ka à gilǝa ama, &lt;&lt;andǝ amǝ'tàu mala Yahuda.&gt;&gt;</char></note> <verse eid="JDG 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 1:17" />Amǝ'tàu mala Yahuda wari andǝ amǝ'eambia amǝ'tàu mala Shimiyon, sǝ à gandǝ amǝ'Kan'ana mǝnana à ndanǝdo a Zefat ka, sǝ à kiɗikì nggea-lê kat-kat. Adyan ngga aɓwana kǝ tunǝ nggea-lê ama Horma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Horma </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ka ɓālǝi nda kiɗikì kat-kat. </char></note> <verse eid="JDG 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 1:18" />Ɗǝm ngga, amǝ'tàu mala Yahuda ak Gaza andǝ Ashkelon andǝ Ekǝron, andǝ alá mǝnana à kària ka. <verse eid="JDG 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 1:19" />Yahweh ka nda atà amǝ'tàu mala Yahuda, sǝ à ak nzali múr-ankono duk malea, sǝama à gandǝ pǝr aɓwana mǝnana à ndanǝdo a ɓawanban ngga ɗàng, acemǝnana à ndanǝ awaru-pǝr mala bolo-candǝa. <verse eid="JDG 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 1:20" />À pè Kalip Hebǝron, kǝla mǝnana Musa bang ngga. Pǝlǝa Kalip pǝr amǝ'kà Anak mǝno tàrú ka à purî banì. <verse eid="JDG 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 1:21" />Sǝama amǝ'tàu mala Benjami pǝr amǝ'Jebus mǝnana à ndanǝdo a Urǝshalima ka ɗàng, acemani ka amǝ'Jebus do andǝ amǝ'tàu mala Benjami a Urǝshalima bà yalung.<verse eid="JDG 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anggurkwar mala Ifǝrem andǝ Manasa ak Betel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 1:22" />Nggurkwar mala Yisǝfu warinǝ munǝo arǝ Betel, sǝ Yahweh ka nda ateà. <verse eid="JDG 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 1:23" />Nggurkwar mala Yisǝfu túr amǝ'shenzǝ-nzali a Betel (lullǝ nggea-lê ɗiɗyal ka nda Luz). <verse eid="JDG 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 1:24" />Lang amǝ'shenzǝ-nzalinì sǝn ɓè ɓwabura aban purì ɓá nggea-lê ka, à banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Lǝmdǝa sǝm bankutio aɓa nggea-lê pě, sǝ sǝm nǝ̀ pàkkô mǝɓoarne.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 1:25" />Pǝlǝa ɓwabure lǝmdǝia wia bankutio aɓa nggea-lê, sǝ à wal-lú koya ɓwa aɓa nggea-lê nǝ kún nggeabyau, sǝ ɓwabure andǝ amǝ'ɓala male ka, à nyia ɓǝà o. <verse eid="JDG 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 1:26" />Sǝ ɓwabure wari a nzali mala amǝ'Hitti kya ɓak nggea-là kàm, sǝ tunǝi ama Luz. Anggo sǝ à kǝ tunǝ nggea-lê bà yalung.<verse eid="JDG 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Acili abân mǝnana amǝ'Isǝrayila lia raka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 1:27" />Nggurkwar mala Manasa pǝr aɓwana mana nǝdo a Bet-shan andǝ amuna-là male ka ɗàng, sǝ à pǝr aɓwana mana nǝdo a Ta'anak, andǝ Dor, andǝ Ibǝlem, andǝ Megido, andǝ amuna-là malea mana à kària ka ɗàng, acemǝnana amǝ'Kan'ana dàrrì arǝ do aɓa nzali mǝno. <verse eid="JDG 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 1:28" />Lang amǝ Isǝrayila yi kumǝna rǝcandǝa kpǝm ngga, à tsǝk amǝ'Kan'ana púp aɓa túró mǝcandǝe, sǝama à pǝria kat-kat ɗàng. <verse eid="JDG 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 1:29" />Nggurkwar mala Ifǝrem pǝr amǝ'Kan'ana mana nǝdo a Geza ka ɗàng, nda amǝ'Kan'ana lidǝmba nǝ do aɓalǝia a Geza ka.<verse eid="JDG 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 1:30" />Amǝ'tàu mala Zebulu pǝr aɓwana mana nǝdo a Kitǝron, ko aɓwana mana nǝdo a Nahalol ka ɗàng. Nda amǝ'Kan'ana do aɓalǝia ka, sǝama à tsǝk amǝ'Kan'ana púp aɓa túró mǝcandǝe. <verse eid="JDG 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 1:31" />Amǝ'tàu mala Asha pǝr aɓwana mǝnana nǝdo a Akko, ko aɓwana mana nǝdo a Sidon, ko mala Alap, ko mala Akzip, ko mala Helba, ko mala Afek, ko mala Rehop ka ɗàng. <verse eid="JDG 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 1:32" />Nda amǝ'tàu mala Asha do aɓalǝ amǝ'Kan'ana, aɓwana mala nzalinì, acemǝnana à pǝr amǝ'Kan'ana ɗàng.<verse eid="JDG 1:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 1:33" />Amǝ'tàu mala Naftali pǝr aɓwana mǝnana nǝdo a Bet-Shemesh, ko aɓwana mǝnana nǝdo a Bet-Anat ka ɗàng. Nda à do aɓalǝ amǝ'Kan'ana, aɓwana mala nzalinì. Kat andǝ mǝno ka, amǝ'tàu mala Naftali par aɓwana mala Bet-Shemesh andǝ Bet-Anat aɓa túró mǝcandǝe.<verse eid="JDG 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 1:34" />Amǝ'Amor nggiki amǝ'tàu mala Dan, nda à nyar a nzali múr-ankono ka. À earî amǝ'tàu mala Dan ɓǝà sulǝ a dulum ɗàng.<verse eid="JDG 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 1:35" />Amǝ'Amor ka, à dàrrì arǝ do amúr Nkono Heres, a Aijalon, sǝ aɓa Sha'albin. Sǝama lang nggurkwar mala Yisǝfu yì kumǝna rǝcandǝa kpǝm ngga, à tsǝk amǝ'Amor púp aɓa túró mǝcandǝe. <verse eid="JDG 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 1:36" />Nzong-nzali mala amǝ'Amor tite a Eauwe Akǝrabim, kya pur a Sela sǝ sárǝ́ aban ká dǝmba.<verse eid="JDG 1:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JDG 2" />
  <para style="s">Mgbikiru mala amǝ Isǝrayila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 2:1" />Mǝturonjar mala Yahweh lo a Gilgal, sǝ wari a Bokim a ɓekǝ pwari. Sǝ nacau ama, &lt;&lt;Ən pusǝ wun wu purî ɓá Masar, sǝ ǝn yinǝ wun a nzali mǝnana ǝn kángìr nǝma mǝ nǝ pè aká-wun ngga. Ən bang nǝma, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 17:7">Tite 17:7</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 6:4">Pur 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 31:16">Nggur 31:16</ref></char>.</note>&lt;Pà mǝ nǝ nggaɗi kunam arǝ kùrcau mem sǝnǝa wun ɗàng, <verse eid="JDG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 2:2" />sǝ wun gbal ka, wu kǝa kútí aɓa ɓekǝ kùrcau wunǝ aɓwana mǝnana nǝdo aɓa nzali man ngga ɗàng; dumǝna púp wun nǝ̀ arki agyangŋan malea.&gt; Sǝama wu okam ɗàng. Mana mǝnia wu pak ka? <verse eid="JDG 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 2:3" />Sǝ ado ka, mǝ ndarǝ na nǝma, pà mǝ nǝ pǝria ɓǝà upi ban wun ɗàng, a kún mani ka, à nǝ̀ dupa wun azwe arǝ ankanggari wun, sǝ aɓakuli malea nǝ̀ dupa wun gbǝli.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 2:4" />Lang mǝturonjar mala Yahweh bangŋǝna amǝnia yì acau aban amǝ Isǝrayila kat ka, aɓwe loasǝ già à ɓua. <verse eid="JDG 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 2:5" />Sǝ à tunǝ lullǝ banì ama Bokim.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bokim </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ngga ɓālǝi nda &lt;&lt;amǝ'ɓua.&gt;&gt;</char></note> Sǝ à pà gìr'nkila aban Yahweh abanì.<verse eid="JDG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lú mala Jesǝwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 2:6" />Lang Jesǝwa mesǝna ɓwabundǝa ka, koyan atà amǝ Isǝrayila ka nyar a nzali liɓala male, ace ak nzalî ɓǝ̀ duk girkuma malea. <verse eid="JDG 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 2:7" />Sǝ amǝ Isǝrayila kpata Yahweh aɓa do-yilǝmu mala Jesǝwa kat, sǝ aɓa do-yilǝmu kat mala aɓwana-mǝgule mǝnana à ueo nǝyilǝmu anzǝm lú mala Jesǝwa, yià mǝnana à sǝlǝnace túró mǝgule mǝnana kat Yahweh pè ace Isǝrayila ka.<verse eid="JDG 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 2:8" />Sǝ Jesǝwa muna-ɓwabura mala Nun, guro mala Yahweh wǔ, ndanǝ apǝlǝa gbǝman-mwashat nǝ lum (110). <verse eid="JDG 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 2:9" />Sǝ à tsǝì a nzali liɓala male a Timnat-heres, mǝnana nda a nzali múr-ankono mala Ifǝrem ngga, nǝ njar-nza mala Nkono Gash. <verse eid="JDG 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 2:10" />Sǝ anzǝm mǝnana aɓwana mana a nza mǝno ka à umǝna atà akeâ ka, ɓè nza lo mǝnana à súrǝ̀ Yahweh, ko túró mǝnana pàkkî Isǝrayila raka.<verse eid="JDG 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amǝ Isǝrayila ɗeki kpata Yahweh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 2:11" />Amǝ Isǝrayila pàk gìr mǝɓane aɓadǝm Yahweh, sǝ à kpata aBa'al. <verse eid="JDG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 2:12" />Sǝ à ɗekibuia arǝ Yahweh, Ɓakuli mala akeâ mǝnana pusǝia à purî ɓá nzali Masar ka. À o atà aɓea aɓakuli, aɓea aɓakuli mala aɓwana mǝnana à kària ka, sǝ à peri abania. Pǝlǝa à tsǝa bum Yahweh lúllô. <verse eid="JDG 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 2:13" />À nyingbuia arǝ Yahweh, sǝ à kpata aBa'al andǝ Ashtarot. <verse eid="JDG 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 2:14" />Nda bumlulla mala Yahweh earke arǝ amǝ Isǝrayila, sǝ tasǝia a ɓabu amǝ'tǝllìban mǝnana à pwan agirkuma malea kǝla pwan gǝna-lwa ka. Sǝ ɗǝm ngga, mea a ɓabu aɓia-mǝbura mǝnana à kària a koya buì, sǝ à gandǝ came a kúnià raka. <verse eid="JDG 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 2:15" />Koya ban sǝ à wari a lwa ka, bù Yahweh na mgbasho nǝia ace pàkkia wia mǝɓane, kǝla mǝnana Yahweh akdǝmba banggia wia, sǝ kánbia wia ka. Sǝ anggo ka, à kum ɓamúrià aɓa gir'murmwana mǝɓike.<verse eid="JDG 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yahweh loasǝ akasǝla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 2:16" />Pǝlǝa Yahweh loasǝ akasǝla, mǝnana à amsǝia a ɓabu aɓwana mǝnana à kǝ ɓǝmbǝria ka. <verse eid="JDG 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 2:17" />Kat andǝ mani ka, à okî akasǝla malea ɗàng; à gyatàrǝia aban ká kpata aɓea aɓakuli, sǝ à ɓun aɓadǝmbia. À kaurǝ pǝlǝ nzǝmia arǝ njar mǝnana akeâ ging kam ngga. Akeâ kpata anzongcau mala Yahweh, sǝ yià ka, à pàk anggo ɗàng. <verse eid="JDG 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 2:18" />A koya bàkú sǝ Yahweh loasǝì amǝ Isǝrayila akasǝla ka, Yahweh na atà mǝno yì kasǝla ka, sǝ kǝ amsǝia a ɓabu aɓia-mǝbura aɓa do-yilǝmu kat mala mǝno yì kasǝla ka. Mǝnia ka nda acemǝnana Yahweh sǝn mǝsǝswatǝr malea atàcau mala imge malea a ɓabu aɓwana mǝnana à kǝ pea wia tanni, sǝ à kǝ paria ka. <verse eid="JDG 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 2:19" />Sǝama a bàkú mǝnana mǝno yì kasǝla wuna ka, amǝ Isǝrayila nǝ̀ pǝlǝ nzǝmia, sǝ ɓealia nǝ̀ ɓike nǝ̀ kútì mala akeâ; à nǝ̀ kùtí a kpata aɓea aɓakuli, andǝ peri abania, andǝ ɓunno aɓadǝmbia. À pà nǝ̀ vwakibuia arǝ pakkiagir malea ko kpata anjar mgbikiru malea ɗàng. <verse eid="JDG 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 2:20" />Pǝlǝa bumlulla mala Yahweh earke arǝ amǝ Isǝrayila, sǝ bang ama, &lt;&lt;Acemǝnana aɓwana mǝnia pak kpakpak arǝ kùrcau mem mǝnana ǝn tsǝki akeâ nzongcau arǝì, sǝ à ginǝna ok giem ngga, <verse eid="JDG 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 2:21" />anzali mala aɓwapǝndǝa mǝnana Jesǝwa ɗekia, liǎ ɗàng lang wù ka, pà mǝ nǝ pǝria ɗǝm a ɓadǝmbia ɗàng. <verse eid="JDG 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 2:22" />Mǝ nǝ pàktúró nǝia ace mwam Isǝrayila, ko à nǝ̀ tsǝkiria arǝ gya aɓa njar mem, Mim Yahweh, kǝla mana akeâ pàk ka, ko à pà nǝ̀ pàk ɗàng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 2:23" />Nda Yahweh ɗeki aɓwapǝndǝa mǝno ɓǝà ueo, pǝria ɓǝà purî bania tù ɗang, sǝ tsǝa anzali mala aɓwapǝndǝa mǝno kpa a ɓabu Jesǝwa, ace mǝnana nǝ̀ liǎ ka ɗàng.<verse eid="JDG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JDG 3" />
  <para style="s">Aɓwapǝndǝa mǝnana à nyia ɓǝà ueo a nzali Kan'ana ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 3:1" />Amǝnia ka, à nda ka aɓwapǝndǝa mala anzali mǝnana Yahweh nyia ɓǝà ueo ace mwam Isǝrayila nǝia ka, yia amǝ Isǝrayila mana à lwa kǝ lwa aɓalǝ a'lwa kat mala nzali Kan'ana raka. <verse eid="JDG 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 3:2" />(Kǝ nda ace kanî anza mala amǝ Isǝrayila mǝnana à súrǝ̀ lwa ɗiɗyal raka, ɓǝà súrǝì.) <verse eid="JDG 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 3:3" />Amǝnia ka à nda ka aɓwapǝndǝa mala nzalinì: amǝ'yálmurû tongno mala amǝ'Filisti, andǝ amǝ'Kan'ana kat, andǝ amǝ'Sidon, andǝ amǝ'Hivi mana à ndanǝdo amur Nkono Lebano, twal a Nkono Ba'al-Hamon, kya bwal Lebo-Hamat ka. <verse eid="JDG 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 3:4" />À nying amǝnia yì aɓwana ka, ace mwam Isǝrayila, ace sǝlǝa ko Isǝrayila nǝ̀ kpata anzongcau mala Yahweh, mǝnana pè akeâ nǝ bu Musa ka.<verse eid="JDG 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 3:5" />Nda amǝ Isǝrayila do aɓalǝ amǝ'Kan'ana, andǝ amǝ'Hitti, andǝ amǝ'Amor, andǝ amǝ'Periz, andǝ amǝ'Hivi, andǝ amǝ'Jebus ka. <verse eid="JDG 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 3:6" />Sǝ à alki amuna-mamǝna mala amǝ'Kan'ana, sǝ à pà amuna-mamǝna malea aban amǝ'Kan'ana, à alia, sǝ à peri aban aɓakuli malea.<verse eid="JDG 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otǝniyel amsǝ amǝ Isǝrayila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 3:7" />Amǝ Isǝrayila pàk gìr mǝɓike aɓadǝm Yahweh. Ɓālǝia lorǝ Yahweh, yì Ɓakuli malea, sǝ à kùtí a peri aban aBa'al andǝ Ashera. <verse eid="JDG 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 3:8" />Pǝlǝa bumlulla mala Yahweh, lo earki-bǝsa amur amǝ Isǝrayila, sǝ earî Kushan-Rishatayim,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kushan-Rishatayim </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko Kushan mǝ'ɓealɓikea kusǝ ɓari </char></note> murǝm mala Aram-Naharayim,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Aram-Naharayim </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ngga ɓālǝi nda &lt;&lt;Aram mala anggeasala ɓari&gt;&gt; aɓa nzali Mesopotamiya.</char></note> ɓǝ̀ gandǝ amǝ Isǝrayila sǝ paria aɓate, ba apǝlǝa tongno-nong-tàrú. <verse eid="JDG 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 3:9" />Sǝama, lang amǝ Isǝrayila ɓua aban Yahweh ka, Yahweh loasǝia wia ɓwa mǝnana nǝ̀ amsǝia ka. Lùllǝì ama Otǝniyel, muna-ɓwabura mala Kenaz, mǝ'kyauwa Kalip.<verse eid="JDG 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 3:10" />Bangŋo mala Yahweh yi sulǝ amurí, sǝ yi duk kasǝla mala Isǝrayila. Lang pur lwa ka, Yahweh tasǝ Kushan-Rishatayim, murǝm mala Aram, a ɓabuì, sǝ Otǝniyel limurǝm nǝ lwa amurí. <verse eid="JDG 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 3:11" />Nda nzalinì yi kum usǝlǝo mala apǝlǝa lumi-ine ka. Pǝlǝa Otǝniyel, muna-ɓwabura mala Kenaz yi paklú.<verse eid="JDG 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ehud amsǝ amǝ Isǝrayila a bù amǝ'Mowap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 3:12" />Amǝ Isǝrayila pàk gìr mǝɓike ɗǝm a mǝsǝ Yahweh. Pǝlǝa Yahweh pè Egǝlon, murǝm mala Mowap, rǝcandǝa amur Isǝrayila, acemǝnana Isǝrayila pàngŋǝ̀nà gìr mǝnana mǝɓike na a mǝsǝ Yahweh ka. <verse eid="JDG 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 3:13" />Egǝlon ramba amǝ'Amon andǝ amǝ'Amalek ɓǝà camatè, à kya gandǝ Isǝrayila a munǝo, sǝ à ak Nggea-là mala Anggun-Nkangga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nggea-là mala Anggun-Nkangga </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ka nda Jeriko.</char></note> <verse eid="JDG 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 3:14" />Sǝ amǝ Isǝrayila do aɓata Egǝlon, murǝm Mowap apǝlǝa lum-bwamdǝ-tongno-nong-tàrú (18).<verse eid="JDG 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 3:15" />Nyar ɗǝm ngga, amǝ Isǝrayila yinǝ ɓua malea aban Yahweh, pǝlǝa loasǝia wia ɓwa mǝnana nǝ̀ akmúria ka. Lullǝì nda Ehud, nggaro, muna-ɓwabura mala Gera, a tàu mala Benjami. Amǝ Isǝrayila tasǝì nǝ agir-cemi malea ɓǝ̀ kya mbwe aban Egǝlon, murǝm mala Mowap. <verse eid="JDG 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 3:16" />Ehud nǝ nggearǝì pàk nggeabyau mana kúni ɓari, sǝ sauwa male ka ɓakusǝu mwashat nǝ tsùrú na ka. Pǝlǝa kùrì a ɓunni nǝ tabuì mǝlì, aɓa nggea-daura male.<verse eid="JDG 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 3:17" />Yi pà agir-ceminî aban Egǝlon, murǝm Mowap, mǝnana nggea ɓwa mǝ'nyane na ka. <verse eid="JDG 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 3:18" />Anzǝm mana Ehud pana agir-ceminî ka, pǝlǝa tasǝ aɓwana mana à twal agir-ceminî ka ɓǝà o. <verse eid="JDG 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 3:19" />Sǝ yì ka, lang bingŋǝ́nà ban aɓǝ́nzál-tali mǝnana a Gilgal ka, wulio nyar aban Egǝlon, sǝ na ama, &lt;&lt;Murǝm, mǝ ndanǝ càu ɓa-sǝmbǝrǝa aceo.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 3:19">Pǝlǝa murǝm banggi amǝtè ama, &lt;&lt;Wu nying sǝm!&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa yia kat ka, à puro, à nyì.<verse eid="JDG 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 3:20" />Ehud pǝlǝa kutio abani, lang ndaban do nǝmurǝì, a kurǝm-kuli male mǝpwale ka. Sǝ Ehud banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mim ngga, mǝ ndanǝ cau mana Ɓakuli pam aceo ka.&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa murǝm loapi buno male.<verse eid="JDG 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 3:21" />Sǝ Ehud warinǝ bui mǝnggare, kwetǝ nggeabyau mǝnana a ɓunni nǝ tabuì mǝlì ka, sǝ zuɓina murǝm nǝi a bumi. <verse eid="JDG 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 3:22" />Byau kutio sǝ kò andǝ garè, sǝ sak anzǝmi. Sǝ Ehud ka, pusǝ nggeabyaunì ɗàng, kara mùrú yi ta amur nggeabyau; sǝ ciu yi ar a nza. <verse eid="JDG 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 3:23" />Pǝlǝa Ehud, purî ɓá ndà, girki akún kurǝm-kuli, sǝ kumlǝkia. Pǝlǝa kutio o.<verse eid="JDG 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 3:24" />Anzǝm mana Ehud umǝna ka, amǝtúró mala murǝm yiu, sǝ à kum akún kurǝm-kuli agire. Sǝ à bang ama, &lt;&lt;Murǝm ngga ndarǝ usǝlǝo aɓa kurǝm ɓaɓalǝu mǝpwale aɓa palta.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 3:25" />Pǝlǝa à kúndǝô, ganda kya pakkia wia, sǝ lang à sǝni mǝn kún kurǝm-kuli raka, à twal kyî, sǝ à mǝngi akún-akurǝm. Kara à sǝni ka, murǝm kpana a nzali a ɓakurǝm, wuna.<verse eid="JDG 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 3:26" />Lang à dǝndi ka, Ehud auna umǝna. Yi kútì aɓǝ́nzál-tali, sǝ auwa o a Seyira. <verse eid="JDG 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 3:27" />Lang yi bingŋǝ́nà Seyira ka, twang njawe aɓa nzali múr-ankono mala Ifǝrem. Amǝ Isǝrayila sulǝî nzali múr-ankono andǝi, sǝ yì Ehud ka dupia wia a dǝmba. <verse eid="JDG 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 3:28" />Banggia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Wu yiu atam, acemǝnana Yahweh pana aɓiwun amǝbura, yì amǝ'Mowap, a ɓabu wun!&gt;&gt; Nda à sulǝ atè sǝ à kya ak abân yálì nkaring mùr mala Jodan, mana nda a nkāɓe nzali Mowap ka, sǝ à eare ɓǝ̀ kǝɓwa yàl aban ká a nkaring ɗàng. <verse eid="JDG 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 3:29" />A pwari mǝno ka à wal atà amǝ'Mowap kǝla ɓwa á-lum (10,000), yià kat ka aburana amǝ'rǝcandǝe andǝ amǝ ɓabumcandǝa na; ko ɓwa mwashat ateà au ɗàng.<verse eid="JDG 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 3:30" />A pwari mǝno ka, Isǝrayila ɓùn Mowap aɓatea, sǝ nzalinì kum usǝlǝo apǝlǝa lumi-tongno-nong-tàrú (80).<verse eid="JDG 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shamgar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 3:31" />Anzǝm Ehud ka, Shamgar muna-ɓwabura mala Anat, wal-lú ka amǝ'Filisti gbǝman-tongno-nong-mwashat (600) nǝ gara-pǝrta andá-rya. Yì gbal ka, amsǝ Isǝrayila.<verse eid="JDG 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JDG 4" />
  <para style="s">Debora andǝ Barak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 4:1" />Amǝ Isǝrayila ka à nyar ɗǝm à pàk gìr mǝnana mǝɓike na a mǝsǝ Yahweh ka, anzǝm lú mala Ehud.<verse eid="JDG 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 4:2" />Nda Yahweh túrmuria a ɓabu Jabin murǝm mala Kan'ana mana yálkiyi aɓwana a Hazo ka. Mǝ'sàrǝ̀ban mala amǝ'lwa male ka nda Sǝsera, mana ndanǝdo a Haroshet-Hagoyim ngga. <verse eid="JDG 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 4:3" />Acemǝnana Sǝsera ndanǝ awaru-pǝr gbǝman-tongno-nong-ine (900), mana à peǎ nǝ bolo-candǝa ka, par amǝ Isǝrayila, parban ɓana, arǝ apǝlǝa lumi-ɓari. Osso amǝ Isǝrayila ɓua aban Yahweh ɓǝ̀ bwalia-wia-kam.<verse eid="JDG 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 4:4" />A bàkú mǝno ka, Debora, māɓangnǝa, mālá Lapidot, nda mǝɓashi amúr Isǝrayila. <verse eid="JDG 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 4:5" />Pàk-ka nǝ̀ do a tǝ́r nggun-nkangga mala Debora anre Rama andǝ Betel a nzali múr-ankono mala Ifǝrem, sǝ amǝ Isǝrayila nǝ̀ yiu a baní ace ɓashi. <verse eid="JDG 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 4:6" />Ɓè fara ka, túrban atà Barak muna-ɓwabura mala Abinowam a Kedesh, aɓa bù-nzali Naftali, ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Yahweh, Ɓakuli mala amǝ Isǝrayila, kǝ tsǝko mǝnia yì nzongcau ka ama: &lt;Pwan amǝ'lwa á-lum (10,000) a tàu mala Naftali andǝ tàu mala Zebulu, sǝ wu kyan nǝia a Nkono Tabo. <verse eid="JDG 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 4:7" />Mǝ nǝ nun Sǝsera, mǝ'sàrǝ̀ban amúr amǝ'lwa mala Jabin, andǝ awaru-pǝr male, andǝ amǝ'lwa male, ɓǝà yiu ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ wu je-munǝo wunǝia a Nggeasala Kishon ngga, sǝ mǝ nǝ pò limurǝm amurí.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 4:8" />Sǝ Barak ka nyesǝi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ awu nǝ ká atàm ngga, mǝ nǝ ká, sǝ ɓǝ̀ a pa wu nǝ ká atàm raka, pà mǝ nǝ ká ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 4:9" />Sǝ Debora eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mbak-kàngkàng, mǝ nǝ ká atò, sǝama njargula mǝnia a earce ká kàm ngga, pà nǝ̀ kánǝ we aɓa kum gusǝlǝban ɗang, acemǝnana Yahweh nǝ̀ túrmúr Sǝsera a ɓabu ɓwama.&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa Debora lo sǝ à wari andǝ Barak a Kedesh. <verse eid="JDG 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 4:10" />Barak tunǝ tàu mala Zebulu andǝ tàu mala Naftali a Kedesh. Sǝ aburana á-lum (10,000) o atè, sǝ Debora o atè gbal.<verse eid="JDG 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 4:11" />(Adyan ngga Heba ɓwa'Ken, mǝ'kà Hobap, nkil Musa ka angŋa-dǝmba tùrna nyingŋǝna acili amǝ'Ken, sǝ tsǝ̀ngŋǝ̀nà gumli male zak, a ban nggun-mǝgule mǝnana a Zaananim, tù aban Kedesh ka.)<verse eid="JDG 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 4:12" />Lang à banggi Sǝsera ama Barak muna-ɓwabura mala Abinowam eauna amur Nkono Tabo ka, <verse eid="JDG 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 4:13" />kara ram awaru-pǝr male gbǝman-tongno-nong-ine (900) kat, mana à peǎ nǝ bolo-candǝa ka, andǝ aburana mǝnana kat à nda atè ka abanɓwáná, sǝ à lo a Haroshet-Hagoyim aban ká a Nggeasala Kishon.<verse eid="JDG 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 4:14" />Osso Debora ne Barak ama, &lt;&lt;Kyane! Pwari mǝnia yalung ngga, nda pwari mana Yahweh pana Sǝsera nǝi a ɓabuo ka. Yale Yahweh na aka wun dǝmba kǝ ká ka.&gt;&gt; Barak pǝlǝa sulǝî múr Nkono Tabo nǝ amǝ'lwa á-lum (10,000) male aban o atè. <verse eid="JDG 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 4:15" />Lang Barak andǝ amǝ'lwa male soa-munǝo nǝ kún nggeabyau ka, Yahweh túr Sǝsera andǝ awaru-pǝr male kat, andǝ amǝ'lwa male kat aɓa zurǝki, aɓadǝm Barak. Sǝsera sulǝî waru-pǝr male sǝ twal-mire nǝ kusǝi ace auwa. <verse eid="JDG 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 4:16" />Sǝ Barak pǝrta awaru-pǝr andǝ amǝ'lwa mala Sǝsera aban ká Haroshet-Hagoyim. À twalta amǝ'lwa mala Sǝsera kàng nǝ kún nggeabyau; kǝ ɓwa mwashat ue ɗang.<verse eid="JDG 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 4:17" />Sǝsera ɓang nǝ kusǝi wari a gumli mala Jayel, mālá Heba ɓwa'Ken, acemǝnana dotarǝu nakam anre Murǝm Jabin mala Hazo andǝ ɓala mala Heba ɓwa'Ken. <verse eid="JDG 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 4:18" />Jayel puro nǝ̀ kúllí Sǝsera, sǝ ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Kàra yiu, ɓwamǝgule mem, kútiô aɓa gumli mem. Cè ɓangciu bwalo ɗang.&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa kútí aɓa gumli mala Jayel, sǝ Jayel kumsǝi wi kungtung amurí. <verse eid="JDG 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 4:19" />Osso Sǝsera ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ida pam mur bǝtikulyak acemǝnana mǝsamur-kǝ-walam.&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa Jayel mǝn du kiura, pe wi sǝ nu, pǝlǝa kumsǝi wi gìr amurí. <verse eid="JDG 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 4:20" />Sǝ banggi Jayel ama, &lt;&lt;Cam a kún gumli, ɓǝ̀ kǝɓwa yiu sǝ ɗio ama, &lt;Kǝ ɓwa kani le ka?&gt; Ne wi ama, &lt;Awo.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 4:21" />Sǝsera ka aulǝ kǝ̀rkǝ́r, nda kò a ntulo mǝlime ka. Pǝlǝa Jayel, mālá Heba twal nkpako gumli andǝ ndolo a buì, sǝ eamdǝki wari amurí sǝ gballî wi nkpakonî a ɓamuri, kya tǝm nzali. Nda wù ka. <verse eid="JDG 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 4:22" />Zuku ka, Barak yi tusǝo, ndarǝ pyangnǝ atà Sǝsera, sǝ Jayel pur atè kya kumi sǝ ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Yiu! Mǝ nǝ lǝmdǝo ɓwa mǝnana a alkiyite ka.&gt;&gt; Nda kútí atè aɓa gumli, sǝ sǝni ka Sǝsera na nong ngga, lú na, nǝ nkpako a ɓamuri.<verse eid="JDG 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 4:23" />A pwari mǝno ka, Ɓakuli ɓungi Jabin murǝm Kan'ana aɓadǝm amǝ Isǝrayila. <verse eid="JDG 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 4:24" />Sǝ bù amǝ Isǝrayila lidǝmba nǝ candǝe amur Jabin murǝm mala Kan'ana, sǝ rǝcandǝa malea ɓākì, she lang à kiɗikini ka.<verse eid="JDG 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JDG 5" />
  <para style="s">Nggyal mala Debora andǝ Barak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 5:1" />A pwari mǝno ka, Debora andǝ Barak, muna-ɓwabura mala Abinowam, à tù nggyal mǝnia ka:<verse eid="JDG 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 5:2" />Lang amǝgulo mala Isǝrayila akì aɓwana dǝmba aban ká ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:2">aɓwe eare à pà ɓamuria.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:2">Wu ɓwangsǝ Yahweh!<verse eid="JDG 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 5:3" />Wu ǒ, wun amurǝma!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:3">Wu kwakikir wun, wun amǝgulo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:3">Mǝ nǝ tùkî Yahweh nggyal.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:3">Mǝ nǝ tù nggyal ɓwangsǝban aban Yahweh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:3">Ɓakuli mala Isǝrayila.<verse eid="JDG 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 5:4" />Yahweh, lang a nying ɓá Seyir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:4">lang a purì ɓá bù-nzali Edom ngga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:4">nzali gǝggǝli, sǝ bumkuli nya mbulo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:4">E, apǝrɓang rakki mǝsǝ mbulo.<verse eid="JDG 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 5:5" />Ankono gǝggǝli aɓadǝm Yahweh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:5">nggearǝ Saina aɓadǝm Yahweh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:5">Ɓakuli mala Isǝrayila.<verse eid="JDG 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 5:6" />Aɓalǝ apwari mala Shamgar, muna-ɓwabura mala Anat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:6">sǝ ndya ɗǝm aɓalǝ apwari mala Jayel ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:6">aɓwana ɗeki kutio arǝ anjar-mǝgule,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:6">sǝ amǝgya kàr arǝ anjar-mǝkarke a nzǝm-la.<verse eid="JDG 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 5:7" />Aɓwana mala amuna-là mala Isǝrayila yi malâ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:7">À yi malâ she lang mim, Debora, ǝn lo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:7">she lang ǝn lo kǝla nggeau a Isǝrayila ka.<verse eid="JDG 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 5:8" />Lang Isǝrayila twal kpata bǝsa aɓakuli ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:8">munǝo kutio a kún nggea-là.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:8">À sǝn ntwangŋo ko nkongŋo kàm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:8">a bù aburana á-lumi-ine mala Isǝrayila le?<verse eid="JDG 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 5:9" />Ɓabumam o arǝ amǝ'sàrǝ̀ban mala Isǝrayila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:9">mǝnana à pà ɓamúrià nǝ eare malea aɓalǝ aɓwana ka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:9">Ɓǝà ɓwangsǝ Yahweh.<verse eid="JDG 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 5:10" />Wu bangce, wun mǝnana wu kǝ eau a nzǝm amǝdambǝriso-pwasǝa ka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:10">wun mǝnana wu kǝ do amur agir-do nzǝm pǝr amǝɓǝlke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:10">sǝ wu kǝ gya amur njargula ka.<verse eid="JDG 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 5:11" />Wu kwakikir wun arǝ gi ka amǝ'nggyal arǝ abân to mùr;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:11">akano ka à kǝ zǝkice alimurǝm mala Yahweh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:11">alimurǝm mala amǝ'lwa male a Isǝrayila.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:11">Pǝlǝa aɓwana mala Yahweh sulǝ aban ká arǝ akún nggea-là.<verse eid="JDG 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 5:12" />Loapi-ntulo, Debora, loapi-ntulo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:12">Loapi-ntulo, loapi-ntulo, loasǝ nggyal!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:12">Lo-came, Barak!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:12">Bwalki aguro-lwa mô,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:12">we muna-ɓwabura mala Abinowam!<verse eid="JDG 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 5:13" />Pǝlǝa cili aɓwana-mǝgule mǝnana à ue ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:13">à sulǝo à yiu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:13">aɓwana mala Yahweh sulǝo à yiu aceì,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:13">arǝ akanggǝrang amǝ'lwa.<verse eid="JDG 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 5:14" />Aɓea aɓwana mala Ifǝrem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:14">mana tǝrtea pur a Amalek ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:14">à yiu atò, we Benjami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:14">wunǝ amǝ'lwa mô.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:14">Amǝ'sàrǝ̀ban mǝnana à pur a Makir ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:14">à sulǝo à yiu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:14">sǝ amǝnana à kǝ ging nǝ gara mala mǝ'sàrǝ̀ban a buia ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:14">à pur a Zebulu sǝ à yiu.<verse eid="JDG 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 5:15" />Amǝgulo mala Isaka ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:15">à nda atà Debora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:15">kǝla mana Isaka pàk ka, anggo sǝ Barak pa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:15">à giɓi aban ká aɓa ɓangŋaban a npurota kusǝi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:15">Aɓalǝ anggǝsan mala Ruben ngga, ɓalkiɓabum na kam.<verse eid="JDG 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 5:16" />Palang sǝ wu akrǝ wun atà adomwan mala anzur ma'wun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:16">ace ok twanggi akarinka ace adomwan le?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:16">Aɓalǝ anggǝsan mala Ruben ngga, ɓalkiɓabum na kam.<verse eid="JDG 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 5:17" />Aɓwana mala Gilǝyat ka à ueo a nkaring Jodan a takuli;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:17">sǝ tàu mala Dan ngga, palang sǝ akrǝi atà awaru-bǝsa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:17">Tàu mala Asha ka, duk kano ɗǝong a kún nggeamùr,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:17">akrǝi a ban-kpasha mala awaru.<verse eid="JDG 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 5:18" />Tàu mala Zebulu ka, à nda mǝnana à twal lú a kún buia ka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:18">anggo gbal sǝ tàu mala Naftali pǎ a kun-munǝo.<verse eid="JDG 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 5:19" />Amurǝma yiu sǝ à munǝo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:19">pǝlǝa amurǝma mala amǝ'Kan'ana munǝ a Ta'anak, a kún myalmúr Megido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:19">sǝ ko à twal kǝ gǝna-lwa mala bolo-azǝrfa ɗang.<verse eid="JDG 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 5:20" />Anlero munǝ nǝ kuli.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:20">Aɓalǝ anjar-gya malea ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:20">à munǝ arǝ Sǝsera.<verse eid="JDG 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 5:21" />Mùrɓangŋa mala Kishon yi pwania,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:21">mǝno yì mùrɓangŋa mala anza ɓara-ɓara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:21">yì mùrɓangŋa mala Nggeasala Kishon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:21">Yilǝmem, fa, kya aɓa rǝcandǝa!<verse eid="JDG 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 5:22" />Pǝlǝa apǝr [mala Sǝsera] yiu nǝ tswaki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:22">nkaulakusǝia kǝ tǝmgi nzali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:22">nǝ tswaki mala apǝr-lwa male.<verse eid="JDG 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 5:23" />Mǝturonjar mala Yahweh bang ama, &lt;&lt;Sú [Là] Meroz.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:23">&lt;&lt;Suban, suban amur aɓwana mǝnana à ndanǝdo kam ngga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:23">acemǝnana à ginǝ puro ace yiua bwali Yahweh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:23">ace yiua bwali wi munǝo arǝ akanggǝrang amǝ'lwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 5:24" />Atà amamǝna ka, Jayel mālá Heba ɓwa Ken,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:24">ɓǝ̀ kum tsǝkbu mǝnana kutibani ka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:24">Atà amamǝna amǝ'do aɓalǝ agumli ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:24">ɓǝ̀ kum tsǝkbu mǝnana kutibani ka.<verse eid="JDG 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 5:25" />Sǝsera zǝmbi wi mùr, sǝ pe wi kiura;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:25">yinǝi wi nǝ kiura mǝbwale aɓa kwar mala amǝgulo.<verse eid="JDG 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 5:26" />Pǝlǝa lǝmdǝ buì, twal nkpako gumli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:26">sǝ buì-mǝlì bwal ndolo mala amǝ'túrô.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:26">Pǝlǝa gballì Sǝsera, ar mú ɓamuri;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:26">zuɓi, tusǝ nshekiri.<verse eid="JDG 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 5:27" />Sǝsera yauwi; kpa a nzali, nong piu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:27">solǝo kpa a nzali a kusǝi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:27">a ban mǝnana kpa kam ngga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:27">akàm sǝ nongŋo, wuna.<verse eid="JDG 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 5:28" />Nggea Sǝsera soa mǝsǝi aban sǝnban a mǝsǝkurǝm;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:28">cam a nzǝm aferang sǝ keban ama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:28">&lt;&lt;Palang sǝ waru-pǝr male dǝndi arǝ nyare?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:28">Palang sǝ gǝshi akusǝ apǝr mala waru-pǝr male dǝndi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 5:29" />Pǝlǝa amā-gulo male amǝkware pe wi eare;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:29">sǝ yale yì nǝ nggearǝì ka earî ɓamúrì ama,<verse eid="JDG 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 5:30" />&lt;&lt;À malaká kum gǝna-lwa sǝ à mal gake re?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:30">Ɓwama mwashat ko ɓari ace koya mǝ'lwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:30">anggubyau mǝɓoarsǝne atà agǝna-lwa ace Sǝsera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:30">anggubyau mǝɓoarsǝne mǝnana à teanǝta ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:30">nggubyau-koarǝu mwashat ko ɓari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:30">amǝɓoarsǝne mǝnana à teanǝta ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:30">aɓalǝ agǝna-lwa, acem mǝ kô a myalam?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 5:31" />Acemani ka, aɓio-mǝbura ɓǝà ueɓà, Yahweh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:31">sǝ aɓwana mana à earceo ka, ɓǝà tǎ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:31">kǝla pwari mana kǝ eauwe aɓa rǝcandǝa male ka.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JDG 5:31">Anggo sǝ à kum usǝlǝo aɓa nzalinì apǝlǝa lumi-ine.<verse eid="JDG 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JDG 6" />
  <para style="s">Amǝ'Midiyan pè amǝ'Isǝrayila tanni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 6:1" />Ɗǝm ngga amǝ Isǝrayila pàk gìr mǝnana mǝɓike na a mǝsǝ Yahweh ka, sǝ Yahweh tasǝia a ɓabu amǝ'Midiyan ba apǝlǝa tongno-nong-ɓari. <verse eid="JDG 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 6:2" />Rǝcandǝa mala amǝ'Midiyan ɓākì mala amǝ'Isǝrayila, sǝ atàcau mala amǝ'Midiyan ngga, amǝ'Isǝrayila alita ɓamuria abân sǝmbǝrǝa aɓalǝ ampu amur ankono, andǝ agumi-ɓa-tali andǝ akanggǝrang-ban. <verse eid="JDG 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 6:3" />A koya bàkú mana amǝ Isǝrayila ɓealkina agirɓaban malea ka, amǝ'Midiyan, andǝ amǝ'Amalek, andǝ aɓwana mala takuli nǝ̀ yiu arǝia. <verse eid="JDG 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 6:4" />À nǝ̀ tsǝki akattì malea ace ká arǝia, sǝ à nǝ̀ kiɗiki agirɓaban aban ká ɗār a Gaza. À pà nǝ̀ nyinggi amǝ Isǝrayila kǝ gìr mǝnana à nǝ̀ lì ka ɗàng; à nying kǝ nzur ko mbul, ko ndǎ, ko mǝdambǝriso ɗàng. <verse eid="JDG 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 6:5" />Pàk ka à nǝ̀ yiu nǝ agirkusǝu malea andǝ agumli malea. À kǝ yiu kǝla làkkì mala doshi. Yià andǝ akalakadambi malea ka, à pà nǝ̀ gandǝ ɓallia ɗàng. À nǝ̀ yiu aɓa nzalinì ace kiɗikè. <verse eid="JDG 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 6:6" />Amǝ'Midiyan pàk amǝ Isǝrayila ɓàɓá, sǝ amǝ Isǝrayila ɓua aban Yahweh.<verse eid="JDG 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 6:7" />Lang amǝ Isǝrayila ɓua aban Yahweh atàcau mala parban mala amǝ'Midiyan ngga, <verse eid="JDG 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 6:8" />Yahweh túr mǝɓangnǝa aban amǝ Isǝrayila. Sǝ banggia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝnia ka nda cau mǝnana Yahweh, Ɓakuli mala amǝ Isǝrayila bang ngga: Ən pusǝ wun, wu pùrî ɓá nzali Masar, sǝ ǝn pusǝ wun, wu pùrî ɓá ɓala guro. <verse eid="JDG 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 6:9" />Sǝ ǝn amsǝ wun a ɓabu amǝ'Masar, sǝ a ɓabu aɓwana mǝnana à par wun ngga. Ən pǝria à pùrî ɓadǝm wun, sǝ ǝn pa wun nzali malea. <verse eid="JDG 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 6:10" />Ən na wun nǝma, &lt;Mǝ nda Yahweh, Ɓakuli ma'wun; wu kǝa ɓanggi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ɓanggi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko kpata</char></note> aɓakuli mala amǝ'Amor, mǝnana wu do a nzali malea ka ɗàng.&gt; Sǝ wun ngga, wu kwakikir wun arǝàm ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓakuli tunǝ Gidiyon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 6:11" />Mǝturonjar mala Yahweh yiu sǝ do a tǝrtà nggea-nggun mala Johash, ɓwa nggurkwar mala Abiyeza, mǝnana a Ofǝra ka. Muna-ɓwabura male Gidiyon ngga nda aban nya mǝssa a ban mǝnana à kǝ kamggi mùr-anap kàm ngga, ace sǝmbǝrǝì amǝ'Midiyan. <verse eid="JDG 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 6:12" />Mǝturonjar mala Yahweh pusǝrǝi a baní sǝ banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Yahweh na atò, we kanggǝrang mǝ'lwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 6:13" />Sǝ Gidiyon banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ida, ɓwamǝgule, ɓǝ̀ Yahweh na atà sǝm ngga, mana tsǝa sǝ amǝnia yì agir ka à kǝ kum sǝm? Agir-ndǝlǝki mǝnana kat aká sǝm na sǝm ceǎ ka, à ndake? À bang ama, &lt;Nggeari ka, Yahweh pusǝ sǝm, sǝm pùrî ɓá nzali Masar re?&gt; Sǝ ado ka, Yahweh vwakinabuì arǝ sǝm, sǝ pànà sǝm a ɓabu amǝ'Midiyan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 6:14" />Sǝ Yahweh pǝlǝ a baní sǝ banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Kyane aɓa rǝcandǝa mò mǝnia ka, sǝ wu amsǝ Isǝrayila a bù amǝ'Midiyan. Ən túrǒ re?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 6:15" />Sǝ Gidiyon banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ida ɓwamǝgule, lang sǝ mǝ nǝ amsǝ Isǝrayila? Sǝni, nggurkwar mem nda mǝtankwang a tàu mala Manasa, sǝ mǝ nda rítǎu a ɓala mala tárrám.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 6:16" />Sǝ Yahweh banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mbak-kàngkàng mǝ nǝ pà atò, sǝ awu nǝ gandǝ amǝ'Midiyan kǝla ɓwa mwashat na.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 6:17" />Sǝ Gidiyon eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ ǝn kumǝna earmúrú a mǝsǝo ado ka, lǝmdǝam gir'lǝmdǝa mǝnana nǝ̀ lǝmdǝam ama a nda mǝnana a nakiyiam cau ka. <verse eid="JDG 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 6:18" />Ida, cè a nying ban mǝnia ka ɗàng she ɓǝn nyarǝna a bano, sǝ ǝn yinǝno nǝ ɓoro mem, ǝn yi nongsǝno wi a ɓadǝmbǝo ka.&gt;&gt; Sǝ Yahweh banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ nǝ kúndǝô sheɓǝ̀ a nyarǝna ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 6:19" />Nda Gidiyon wario sǝ kya lam muna mbul, sǝ pàk agbatali bǝredi mǝnana burè pà arǝì raka nǝ muku lita lumi-ɓari nǝ mǝsǝi ɓari. Tsǝk nyame aɓa zace, sǝ mutui ka soe aɓa nkwaring, sǝ yinǝì wi nǝi a tǝrta nggea-nggun, sǝ pe wi. <verse eid="JDG 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 6:20" />Mǝturonjar mala Ɓakuli banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Twal nyame andǝ bǝredi mana burè pà arǝì raka, nongsǝia amur tali mǝnia ka, sǝ wu solǝ mutui amúrià.&gt;&gt; Sǝ Gidiyon pè anggo. <verse eid="JDG 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 6:21" />Pǝlǝa mǝturonjar mala Yahweh lǝmdǝ kún gara mǝnana a bui ka, sǝ je nyame andǝ bǝredi mǝnana burè pà arǝì raka. Kara bǝsa pur nǝ ɓá tali, sǝ pisǝ nyame andǝ bǝredi mǝnana burè pà arǝì raka. Pǝlǝa mǝturonjar mala Yahweh ndǝrmi.<verse eid="JDG 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 6:22" />Lang yi kpani Gidiyon ama mǝturonjar mala Yahweh na ka, Gidiyon bang ama, &lt;&lt;Oi, we Yahweh Ɓakuli! Ado ka ǝn sǝnǝna mǝturonjar mala Yahweh ɓamǝsǝu andǝ ɓamǝsǝu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 6:23" />Sǝama Yahweh banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ rǝo pwalo! Cè ɓangciu pakko ɗàng. A pà wu nǝ wù ɗàng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 6:24" />Pǝlǝa Gidiyon ɓakkî Yahweh gyangŋan abanì, sǝ pe wi lullǝu ama, Yahweh ka dorǝpwala na. Ba yalung, gyangŋanì nakam piu a Ofǝra mala amǝ'kà Abiyeza.<verse eid="JDG 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gidiyon arki gyangŋan mala Ba'al</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 6:25" />Aɓa du mǝno ka, Yahweh banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Twal jamnda mǝnana a domwan mala tárró ka, nggearǝ ɓaria jamnda, mǝnana mbule tongno-nong-ɓari ka. Sǝ wu arki gyangŋan mala Ba'al mǝnana mala tárró na ka, sǝ wu kasǝki tondong mala Ashera<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">tondong mala Ashera </char><char style="ft">Mǝno ka, ɓǝ̀nzál na, gir'lǝmdǝa mala Ashera, ɓakuli mǝɓwame; ɓalli gbal a mǝsǝi 26, 28, 30</char>. </note> mǝnana a nkanggari ka. <verse eid="JDG 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 6:26" />Pǝlǝa wu ɓakkì Yahweh Ɓakuli mô gyangŋan amur mǝnia yì kanggǝrang-ban ngga, a kǝkarì. Twal ɓaria jamnda mǝno sǝ wu pa gir'nkila mala pisǝe kǝring nǝi, nǝ tondong mala Ashera mǝnana awu nǝ kasǝki ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 6:27" />Nda Gidiyon pwan aɓwana lum atà amǝtúró male sǝ kya pak gìr mǝnana Yahweh banggi wi ama ɓǝ̀ pè ka. Sǝ acemǝnana kǝ ɓanggi amǝɓala mala tárrí andǝ aburana mala là ka, pè nǝ pwari ɗang, nǝ du sǝ kya pê.<verse eid="JDG 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 6:28" />Lang aburana mala là lo nǝ bari ɗiɗyal ka, kara à sǝn gyangŋan mala Ba'al ka à arkini, sǝ tondong mala Ashera mǝnana a nkanggari ka, à kasǝkini, sǝ ɓaria jamnda ka, à pana gir'nkila nǝi amur bǝsa gyangŋan mǝnana à ɓè ka. <verse eid="JDG 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 6:29" />À ɗì rǝia ama, &lt;&lt;Yana pàk mǝnia yì gìr ka?&gt;&gt; Sǝ lang à altaban sǝ à ɗikiban ngga, à banggia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Gidiyon muna-ɓwabura mala Johash na pàk mǝnia yì gìr ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 6:30" />Pǝlǝa aburana mala lě ne Johash ama, &lt;&lt;Yinǝ muna-ɓwabura mô a nza ace mana ɓǝ̀ wǔ, acemǝnana arkina gyangŋan mala Ba'al sǝ kasǝkina tondong mala Ashera mǝnana a nkanggari ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 6:31" />Sǝ Johash ne aɓwana mana kat à lo arǝì ka ama, &lt;&lt;Wun nǝ̀ munǝo ace Ba'al le? Ko ana raka wun nǝ̀ amsǝi le? Ɓwa mǝnana kat nǝ̀ munǝo aceì ka, kaniama ban nǝ̀ kwar ka, à nǝ̀ wal-lui! Ɓǝ̀ yì ka, ɓakuli na ka, ɓǝ̀ munǝo ace ɓamurì, acemǝnana ɓeɓwa arkina gyangŋan male ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 6:32" />Acemani, a pwari mǝno ka, à tunǝ Gidiyon ama &lt;&lt;Jerub-ba'al,&gt;&gt; ɓālǝi nda, &lt;&lt;Wu nying Ba'al ɓǝ̀ munǝo ace ɓamurì,&gt;&gt; acemǝnana Gidiyon arki wi gyangŋan male ka.<verse eid="JDG 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gidiyon ɗice gir'lǝmdǝa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 6:33" />Amǝ'Midiyan kat, andǝ amǝ'Amalek andǝ aɓwana mana a takuli ka, à ram rǝia abanɓwáná; sǝ à yàl a nkaring Nggeasala Jodan, sǝ à yi bwal kàttì a dulum mala Jezǝril. <verse eid="JDG 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 6:34" />Sǝ bangŋo mala Yahweh sulǝ amur Gidiyon, sǝ twang njawe, tunǝ amǝ'Abiyeza ɓǝà kpate. <verse eid="JDG 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 6:35" />Tasǝ amǝ'na-túrbân a bù-nzali Manasa, tunǝia ɓǝà yiu atè gbal. Sǝ tasǝ amǝ'na-túrbân arǝ abu-nzali Asha, andǝ Zebulu, andǝ Naftali, sǝ à yiu à yi kumia.<verse eid="JDG 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 6:36" />Gidiyon ne Ɓakuli ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ awu nǝ amsǝ Isǝrayila nǝ buam, kǝla mǝnana a bang ngga, <verse eid="JDG 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 6:37" />sǝni mǝ ndo mǝ nǝ tsǝk nggū-nzur a katǝra. Ɓǝ̀ ncimna nǝ̀ kpa amur nggū-nzur nǝmurǝi, sǝ nzali kat nǝ̀ ìm ngga, mǝ nǝ sǝlǝ ama awu nǝ amsǝ Isǝrayila nǝ buam, kǝla mǝnana a bang ngga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 6:38" />Anggo sǝ pǎ. Lang lo ɗiɗyal nǝ dǝmbari ka, yi par nggū-nzur, sǝ pūrǝí; ncimna mana pur arǝì ka lùmsǝ kwar-numur. <verse eid="JDG 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 6:39" />Gidiyon ne Ɓakuli ama, &lt;&lt;Cè bumlulla mò earke amuram ɗàng. Mǝ nǝ zǝmbô kusǝ mwashat ɗǝm; ida, nyem ɓǝn mwam cê kusǝ mwashat ɗǝm nǝ nggū-nzur. Ado ka ɓǝ̀ nggū-nzur ime, sǝ ncimna ɓǝ̀ aki nzali kat.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 6:40" />A mǝno yì du ka, Ɓakuli pê anggo; nggū-nzurni na ìm nǝmurǝi ka, sǝ ncimna aki nzali kat.<verse eid="JDG 6:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JDG 7" />
  <para style="s">Gidiyon gandǝ amǝ'Midiyan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 7:1" />Nǝ ban'mbul-mbul ka, Jerub-ba'al (yì Gidiyon) andǝ aɓwana mǝnana atè ka, à lo sǝ à yi tsǝk kàttì a nkanggari mgbeaɗe-mùr Harot. Sǝ kàttì mala amǝ'Midiyan ngga, nda a njar-nza nǝ banià aɓa ɓangŋaban, tù a ban Nkono More.<verse eid="JDG 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 7:2" />Yahweh banggi Gidiyon ama, &lt;&lt;Aɓwana mǝnana atò ka, à ɓiki lakkì mǝnana mǝ nǝ pà amǝ'Midiyan a ɓabuia ka, cè Isǝrayila nggoriam ama, &lt;Rǝcandǝa mem nǝ̀ amsǝam.&gt; <verse eid="JDG 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 7:3" />Ado ka hambî aɓwana ama, &lt;Ɓwa mǝnana kat rǝì kǝ ɓǝl nǝ ɓangciu ka, ɓǝ̀ wulio ɓǝ̀ nying Nkono Gilǝyat.&gt; &gt;&gt; Nda aɓwana á-lumi-ɓari-nong-ɓari (22,000) nyare à o a là, sǝ aɓwana á-lum (10,000) ue ka.<verse eid="JDG 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 7:4" />Yahweh banggi Gidiyon ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwapǝndǝa ɓiki lakkì piu. Kyan nǝia a kún mur, sǝ mǝ nǝ mwambo wia kàm. Ɓǝ̀ ǝn nô nǝma, &lt;Ɓwa man, nǝ̀ ká atò ka,&gt; nǝ̀ ká atò; sǝ ɓǝ̀ ǝn nô nǝma, &lt;Mǝnia ka pà nǝ̀ ká atò raka,&gt; pà nǝ̀ ká ɗàng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 7:5" />Pǝlǝa Gidiyon warinǝ aɓwe a kún mur. Sǝ Yahweh banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Koyan mǝnana tàkki mur nǝ bui a lasǝi kǝla nvwa ka, tàrrì a buì man; anggo gbal ɓwa mǝnana kūndǝ nǝ nkūnǝi sǝ nu mùr ka, tàrrì a ɓè buì.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 7:6" />Aɓwana gbǝman-tàrú (300) na mǝnana à tàkki mur nǝ buia a kunia ka; acilia kat ka à kūndǝo amur ankūnǝia sǝ à nu mùr. <verse eid="JDG 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 7:7" />Yahweh banggi Gidiyon ama, &lt;&lt;Nǝ aɓwana mǝnia gbǝman-tàrú (300) mǝnana à tàkki mur nǝ buia ka sǝ mǝ nǝ amsǝo, sǝ mǝ nǝ pà amǝ'Midiyan aɓa buo. Nying acili aɓwana ɓǝà o, koyan ngga a là male.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 7:8" />Nda Gidiyon ak agirlina andǝ anjawe gam arǝ acili amǝ'lwa mǝnia sǝ tasǝia ɓǝà o, koyan ngga a gumli male. Sǝ aburana man gbǝman-tàrú (300) ka, banggia wia ɓǝà ueo atè.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 7:8">Kàttì mala amǝ'Midiyan ngga nda a ɓangŋaban ɓǝ̀ ɓwa sulǝì ban kàttì mala Gidiyon ngga. <verse eid="JDG 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 7:9" />Aɓa du mǝno ka, Yahweh banggi Gidiyon ama, &lt;&lt;Lo, sulǝo kyan nǝ munǝo arǝ kàttì mala amǝ'Midiyan acemǝnana ǝn pano wi aɓa buo. <verse eid="JDG 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 7:10" />Sǝama ɓǝ̀ ɓangciu kǝ pakko arǝ sulǝ aban ká ka, wu sulǝ wunǝ muna-ɓala mò Pura. <verse eid="JDG 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 7:11" />Kwakikiro arǝ cau mǝnana à banggiyi ka, sǝ awu nǝ kum mǝsǝkang-kangŋa mala sulǝo aban ká arǝ kàttì malea.&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa yì andǝ Pura muna-ɓala male ka, à sulǝ a ban agumli mala aburana mǝnana à tamsǝia a kúnban ace yál amǝ'lwa mana à nda aɓa kùrrǝu aɓa kàttì ka. <verse eid="JDG 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 7:12" />Amǝ'Midiyan andǝ amǝ'Amalek andǝ aɓwana mala takuli sulǝna a ɓangŋaban mbǝl-mbǝl kǝla adoshi. Akalakadambi malea làkkì kǝla mǝsǝsala a kun-nggeamur, ɓwa pà nǝ̀ gandǝ ɓallia ɗàng. <verse eid="JDG 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 7:13" />Lang Gidiyon yi bingŋǝna ka, kara ok ɓeɓwa na aban ne ɓì lorǝo ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝni! Ən lorǝ ama ɗurǝo bǝredi mǝnana à pe nǝ muku mǝssa-bálì ka, ɗǝnggǝliki aɓa kàttì mala amǝ'Midiyan. Yiu aban ɓè gumli sǝ tùllì nǝ rǝcandǝa, ndǝlì nǝtakwari, sǝ gumlinì kpa a nzali mgbángtâng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 7:14" />Sǝ ɓi earî wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝnia ka kǝgir na ɗang, nggeabyau mala Gidiyon muna-ɓwabura mala Johash, ɓwa Isǝrayila na. Ɓakuli pani wi amǝ'Midiyan andǝ kàttì aɓa buì kat.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 7:15" />Lang Gidiyon ok lorǝê andǝ mǝngi ɓālǝi ka, peri aban Ɓakuli. Pǝlǝa nyar a kàttì mala amǝ Isǝrayila sǝ sa'arǝia ama, &lt;&lt;Wu lo! Yahweh pana kàttì mala amǝ'Midiyan aɓa bù wun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 7:16" />Gau aburana mǝno gbǝman-tàrú ka arǝ anggǝsan tàrú, sǝ pè koyan ngga njawe-gam andǝ muna-bàng mana kùmsǝ ɓukan-bǝsa ka. <verse eid="JDG 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 7:17" />Nea wia ama, &lt;&lt;Wu tsǝk mǝsǝ wun arǝàm, sǝ wu pa kǝla mǝnana ǝn pak ka. Lang ǝn warina a kún kàttì malea ka, kǝ gìr mǝnana ǝn pak ka, nda wun nǝ̀ pè ka. <verse eid="JDG 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 7:18" />Lang mim sǝnǝ aɓwana mǝnana kat atàm sǝm twangŋǝna anjawe-gam ma'sǝm ngga, pǝlǝa wun a koya buì mala kàttì ka, wun nǝ̀ twang anjawe-gam ma'wun gbal. Sǝ wun nǝ̀ na nǝ gi wun a kuli ama, &lt;Ace Yahweh sǝ ace Gidiyon!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 7:19" />Nda Gidiyon andǝ aburana gbǝman mana atè ka, à yiu a nkanggariban kàttì mala amǝ'Midiyan tù nǝ ɓadu, anzǝm mana à nggaɗina amǝ'yalban ngga. Pǝlǝa à twang anjawe-gam malea, sǝ à arki amuna-bàng mǝnana a buia ka. <verse eid="JDG 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 7:20" />Pǝlǝa anggǝsan mǝno tàrú ka, à twang anjawe-gam malea, sǝ à arki amuna-bàng malea. À bwal aɓukan a buia mǝnggare sǝ anjawe-gam mana à twang ngga a buia mǝlì, sǝ à na bangbang ama, &lt;&lt;Nggeabyau ace Yahweh, sǝ ace Gidiyon!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 7:21" />Pǝlǝa koyan ngga cam a bancame male, à gumbǝli kàttì; sǝ amǝ'lwa mala amǝ'Midiyan puppup lo nǝ mire. À ɓangŋa nǝ zwalo a kunia. <verse eid="JDG 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 7:22" />Lang aburana mala Gidiyon twang anjawe-gam gbǝman-tàrú ka, Yahweh tsǝk aburana aɓa kàttì à pǝlǝ arǝarǝia nǝ anggeabyau malea. Amǝ'lwa ɓang aban ká ɗār a Bet-Shita; à dǝshi Zerera aban ká ɗār a nzong-nzali mala Abel-Mehola, tù a ban Tabbat. <verse eid="JDG 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 7:23" />Aburana mala amǝ Isǝrayila a tàu mala Naftali, andǝ Asha, andǝ Manasa kat ka, à tunǝia sǝ à pyangnǝata amǝ'Midiyan. <verse eid="JDG 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 7:24" />Pǝlǝa Gidiyon tasǝ amǝ'na-túrbân arǝ abân aɓa nzali múr-ankono mala Ifǝrem nǝ cau ama, &lt;&lt;Wu sulǝ arǝ amǝ'Midiyan, sǝ wu tsǝk amǝ'yálban a koya mgbeaɗe-mùr, andǝ myalmúr, andǝ tūli-mùr, aban ká ɗār a Bet-Bara. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">wu yál Nggeasala Jodan </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko &lt;&lt;wu yál abân yálì nkaring mùr mala Jodan.&gt;&gt; </char></note>Sǝ wu yál Nggeasala Jodan.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 7:24">Anggo sǝ à tunǝ aburana mala tàu mala Ifǝrem kat, sǝ à yi ak amgbeaɗe-mùr, andǝ amyalmúr, andǝ atūli-mùr, aban ká ɗār a Bet-Bara. Sǝ à yál Nggeasala Jodan. <verse eid="JDG 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 7:25" />À bwalki ayálu ɓari mala amǝ'Midiyan, Orep andǝ Zip. À wal-lú Orep amur tali mala Orep, sǝ Zip ka à wal-luí a ban kam mùr-anap mala Zip. À pǝrta amǝ'Midiyan sǝ à yinǝ aɓamur Orep andǝ Zip aban Gidiyon, a nkaring Jodan.<verse eid="JDG 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JDG 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 8:1" />Pǝlǝa aburana mala tàu mala Ifǝrem ɗì Gidiyon ama, &lt;&lt;Palang sǝ a pakka sǝm anggo? Ace mana sǝ awu nǝ o a munǝo arǝ amǝ'Midiyan ngga a ginǝ tunǝ sǝm?&gt;&gt; À munǝki arǝì kǝ̀rkǝ́r. <verse eid="JDG 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 8:2" />Sǝ yì ka banggia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Mana ǝn pa ado mǝnana à nǝ̀ kārǝi arǝ wun ngga? Ɓakurikuri mala aɓǝla-anap mala Ifǝrem kútì pwan-gìrɓaban mala Abiyeza re? <verse eid="JDG 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 8:3" />Ɓakuli pana ayálu mala amǝ'Midiyan, yià Orep andǝ Zip a ɓabu wun; sǝ mana ǝn gandǝ pa mǝnana à nǝ̀ kārǝi arǝ wun ngga?&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa bumlulla malea arǝì sulǝo lang bang cau mǝnia ka.<verse eid="JDG 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gidiyon masǝlǝ limurǝm amur amǝ'Midiyan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 8:4" />Pǝlǝa Gidiyon andǝ aburana male mǝno gbǝman-tàrú ka, à yiu a Nggeasala Jodan sǝ à yàl a nkaring; sǝ kat andǝ aulǝa malea ka, à lidǝmba nǝ pǝrtau. <verse eid="JDG 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 8:5" />Lang à yiu a Sukkot ka, Gidiyon banggi amǝ Sukkot ama, &lt;&lt;Ida, wu pè amǝ'lwa mem girlina; à gandǝna, sǝ mim ngga mǝ ndarǝ pǝrta Zeba andǝ Zalmuna, amurǝma mala amǝ'Midiyan piu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 8:6" />Sǝ aɓwana-mǝgule mala Sukkot bang ama, &lt;&lt;A gbamina Zeba andǝ Zalmuna a ɓabuo sǝ sǝm nǝ̀ pè amǝ'lwa mô girlina le?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 8:7" />Gidiyon bang ama, &lt;&lt;Anzǝm mana Yahweh pana Zeba andǝ Zalmuna a ɓabuam ngga, mǝ nǝ yia koàkì wun nǝ zwe ɓabondo andǝ galamba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 8:8" />Gidiyon lo kano ka wari a Penǝwel sǝ zǝmbia wia kǝla mǝno ka; sǝ aburana mala Penǝwel nyesǝi wi kǝ cau mala amǝ Sukkot. <verse eid="JDG 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 8:9" />Sǝ ne amǝ Penǝwel ama, &lt;&lt;Lang ǝn linamurǝm sǝ ǝn nyarna ka, mǝ nǝ yia arki mǝnia yì nda-mǝ'dāhre ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 8:10" />Anggo ka, Zeba andǝ Zalmuna na a Karkor nǝ amǝ'lwa malea, aburana kǝla á-lum-bwamdǝ-tongno (15,000). À nda kǝ aburana mǝnana à ueo aɓalǝ amǝ'lwa mala aɓwana mana à yiu nǝ takuli ka; aɓwana á-gbǝman-mwashat nǝ á-lumi-ɓari (120,000) mala amǝ'lwa malea mǝnana à bwal nggeabyau ka, à walna-luia. <verse eid="JDG 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 8:11" />Gidiyon eau nǝ njargula mala amǝ'do aɓalǝ agumli, nǝ takuli mala Noba andǝ Jogbeha, sǝ yasǝlǝ amǝ'Midiyan a kàttì malea nǝ munǝo lang à nda aɓa do ɗwanyi-tsǝk'mǝsǝu ka. <verse eid="JDG 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 8:12" />Amurǝma mala amǝ'Midiyan ɓari, Zeba andǝ Zalmuna, tǝlli nǝ mire, sǝ yì ka pǝrtea yi bwalia, sǝ zurìmúr amǝ'lwa malea kat. <verse eid="JDG 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 8:13" />Anzǝm mǝno ka, Gidiyon muna-ɓwabura mala Johash nyarî kun-munǝo nǝ njar eauwe mala Heres. <verse eid="JDG 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 8:14" />Yi bwal ɓè mǝlagga a Sukkot sǝ ɗìkí, sǝ mǝlaggè gilǝî wi alullǝ amǝbuno andǝ aɓwana-mǝgule mala Sukkot, aburana lumi-tongno-nong-ɓari nǝ mǝsǝi tongno-nong-ɓari (77). <verse eid="JDG 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 8:15" />Pǝlǝa Gidiyon yiu aban aburana mala Sukkot sǝ banggia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Wu sǝni, Zeba andǝ Zalmuna nya ka; yià mǝnana wu <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nam nggaro cau </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko &lt;&lt;kyauwikiam&gt;&gt;</char></note>nam nggaro cau amúrià ama, &lt;A gbamina Zeba andǝ Zalmuna a ɓabuo, sǝ sǝm nǝ̀ pè amǝ'lwa mô girlina le ka?&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 8:16" />Pǝlǝa Gidiyon bwalki aɓwana-mǝgule mala lê, sǝ kasǝ zwe ɓabondo andǝ galamba sǝ koàkia nǝi, ace kania amǝ Sukkot gìrkànì. <verse eid="JDG 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 8:17" />Sǝ yi arki nda-mǝ'dāhre mala Penǝwel sǝ wal-lú aburana mala lê.<verse eid="JDG 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 8:18" />Sǝ pǝlǝa ɗì Zeba andǝ Zalmuna ama, &lt;&lt;Aburana mǝnana wu wal-luia a Tabo ka, aya ulang aburana na?&gt;&gt; Sǝ à pa eare ama, &lt;&lt;Aburana na kǝla we, à pur amuna murǝm.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 8:19" />Gidiyon pǝlǝia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Amǝ'eambam, amuna mala nggem na. Mbak-kàngkàng Yahweh nakam ngga, ɓǝ̀ wu nyingŋǝnia nǝyilǝmu ka, ɓǝ́ pà mǝ nǝ wal-lú wun ɗàng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 8:20" />Sǝ pǝlǝa aban muna-dǝmba male, yì Jeta, sǝ ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Lo wal-luia!&gt;&gt; Sǝama mǝlagge ka, kwetǝ nggeabyau male ɗàng, acemǝnana yì ka muna na piu, ɓangciu kǝ pakkì wi.<verse eid="JDG 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 8:21" />Pǝlǝa Zeba andǝ Zalmuna banggi Gidiyon ama, &lt;&lt;Lo wàl sǝm nǝ nggearǝo; kǝla mǝnana ɓwabura pak ka, anggo sǝ rǝcandǝa male pǎ.&gt;&gt; Nda Gidiyon lo wal-lú Zeba andǝ Zalmuna, sǝ pusǝki anjengǝlan mǝnana a myal akalakadambi malea ka.<verse eid="JDG 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gidiyon pak ɓǝ̀nzál mala efot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 8:22" />Anzǝm mǝno ka, amǝ Isǝrayila banggi Gidiyon ama, &lt;&lt;Duk murǝm amur sǝm, we wunǝ munio, andǝ mǝkeo gbal, acemǝnana a amsǝna sǝm a ɓabu amǝ'Midiyan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 8:23" />Sǝ Gidiyon banggia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Pà mǝ nǝ duk murǝm amur wun ɗàng, sǝ munem pà nǝ̀ duk murǝm amur wun ɗàng. Yahweh na nǝ̀ duk murǝm amur wun ngga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 8:24" />Sǝama banggia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ ndanǝ zǝmba aban wun; nǝma koya ɓwa atà wun ngga, ɓǝ̀ pam gìrkiru aɓalǝ agǝna-lwa mǝnana wu ea arǝ aɓiwun amǝbura ka.&gt;&gt; (Aɓia-mǝbura ka amǝ'Ishmayel na, sǝ à kǝ oasǝ agirkiru mala bolo-njengǝlan.)<verse eid="JDG 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 8:25" />À pa eare ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝm nǝ po wia nǝ banɓoarnado.&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa à sárǝ́ lagir, sǝ koya ɓwanani ka, túr agirkiru mala gǝna-lwa male aɓalǝi. <verse eid="JDG 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 8:26" />Sǝ dǝmbǝrya mala agirkiru bolo-njengǝlan mǝnana zǝm ngga nda, shekel á-mwashat nǝ gbǝman-tongno-nong-ɓari (1,700), tsǝa-amur anjengǝlan andǝ agirɓamyalu andǝ alagir mala amurǝma mǝnana amurǝma mala amǝ'Midiyan oasǝ arǝia ka, andǝ anlang-bolo mǝnana a myal akalakadambi malea ka. <verse eid="JDG 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 8:27" />Gidiyon pàk efot nǝi sǝ tsǝì aɓa Ofǝra nggea-là male. Sǝ Isǝrayila kat ka, à kùtí a gyatàrǝia nǝ ká peri a baní kǝla nkúl, sǝ yi dupi Gidiyon andǝ amǝɓala male gbǝli.<verse eid="JDG 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 8:28" />Anggo sǝ amǝ Isǝrayila ɓùn amǝ'Midiyan aɓatea sǝ à loasǝ múrià ɗǝm ɗang. Sǝ nzali dum nǝ rǝpwala ba pǝlǝa lumi-ine a do-yilǝmu mala Gidiyon.<verse eid="JDG 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isǝrayila purî-njar a nzǝm lú mala Gidiyon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 8:29" />Jerub-ba'al muna-ɓwabura mala Johash nyar a là male kya dukam. <verse eid="JDG 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 8:30" />Gidiyon ngga, ndanǝ amuna-burana lumi-tongno-nong-ɓari (70) mǝnana à ɓǝlî wi ka, acemǝnana ndanǝ amamǝna pas. <verse eid="JDG 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 8:31" />Mā-twala male mǝnana nda a Shekem ngga ɓǝlî wi muna-ɓwabura gbal, mǝnana pe wi lullǝu ama, Abimelek ka. <verse eid="JDG 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 8:32" />Sǝ Gidiyon muna-ɓwabura mala Johash ka, è kutsuk sǝ pàk-lú, sǝ à tsǝì a ɓembe-ɓa-tali mala tárrí Johash a Ofǝra, là mala nggurkwar mala Abiyeza.<verse eid="JDG 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 8:33" />Lú mala Gidiyon nda mǝkwane, amǝ Isǝrayila pǝlǝ ɗǝm à kùtí a gyatarǝu atà aBa'al. À tsǝk Ba'al-berit duk ɓakuli malea. <verse eid="JDG 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 8:34" />À ɗenyinǝ Yahweh Ɓakuli malea, mǝnana amsǝia a bù ka aɓia-mǝbura a koya buì ka ɗàng. <verse eid="JDG 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 8:35" />Sǝ à lǝmdǝì ɓala mala Jerub-ba'al (yì Gidiyon) pěmǝɓoarne ace agir mǝɓoarne mǝnana pakkî Isǝrayila ka ɗàng.<verse eid="JDG 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JDG 9" />
  <para style="s">Abimelek wal-lú amǝ'eambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 9:1" />Abimelek muna-ɓwabura mala <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jerub-ba'al </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ka nda Gidiyon.</char></note>Jerub-ba'al wari a Shekem a ɓè pwari ace sǝn akíne, sǝ nacau nǝia andǝ ɓala-kau mala nggè puppup, ama, <verse eid="JDG 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 9:2" />&lt;&lt;Ida, wu banggi aɓwana-mǝgule mala Shekem kat mǝnia yì cau ka ama, &lt;Mǝye nani na ɓoara wun: amuna-burana lumi-tongno-nong-ɓari mala Jerub-ba'al kat ɓǝà yálmúr wun le, ko ɓwa mwashat ɓǝ̀ yálmúr wun?&gt; Wu ɗenyi ama, mǝ nda nkila wun andǝ nyam wun.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 9:3" />Akína Abimelek banggi aɓwana-mǝgule mala Shekem kat acau mǝnana kat Abimelek nea wia ka. Ɓabum aɓwana-mǝgule man o arǝ Abimelek; acemǝnana à bang ama, &lt;&lt;Yì ka ɓǝla ma'sǝm na ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 9:4" />À pe wi agbatali bolo-azǝrfa shekel lumi-tongno-nong-ɓari mǝnana à twal aɓa ndà mala Ba'al-berit ka. Pǝlǝa Abimelek pàktúró nǝ boale, sǝ kya kúrna aɓwana-mǝɓane andǝ amǝ'yàl-nzongcau nǝi, ɓǝà duk amǝkpate. <verse eid="JDG 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 9:5" />Wari a ɓala mala tárrí a Ofǝra, sǝ wal-lú amǝ'eambi, yià amuna-burana lumi-tongno-nong-ɓari mala Jerub-ba'al, amúr tali mwashat. Kǝ Jotam, muna-ɓwabura mǝtankwang mala Jerub-ba'al, nda mǝnana ueo nǝmurǝi à wal-lui raka, acemǝnana ɓangŋa sǝmbǝrǝa. <verse eid="JDG 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 9:6" />Aɓwana-mǝgule mala Shekem kat andǝ Bet-Millo kat ramba abanɓwáná, sǝ à pè Abimelek murǝm, tù aban nggun-mǝgule mǝnana cam a Shekem ngga.<verse eid="JDG 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanicau mala Jotam</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 9:7" />Lang Jotam ok man yì cau ka, wario kya cam a ɓong <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 11:29">Nggur 11:29</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:12">27:12</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 8:33">Jes 8:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:20">Yoh 4:20</ref></char>.</note>Nkono Gerizim, sǝ loasǝ gi kpǝm nea wia ama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 9:7">Wu kwakikir wun arǝàm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 9:7">wun aɓwana-mǝgule mala Shekem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 9:7">ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ Ɓakuli kwakikiri arǝ wun ngga.<verse eid="JDG 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 9:8" />Ɓè pwari nakam mǝnana anggun ram rǝia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 9:8">à nǝ̀ twalî ɓamúrià murǝm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 9:8">À banggi nggun-olif ama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 9:8">&lt;&lt;Duk murǝm ma'sǝm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 9:9" />Sǝama nggun-olif nyesǝia wia cau ama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 9:9">&lt;&lt;Mǝ nying pusǝ mùrú mem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 9:9">mǝnana à kǝ pángŋǝ̀nà-túró nǝi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 9:9">ace gusǝlǝ Ɓakuli andǝ aɓwapǝndǝa ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 9:9">ace wuliki amúr anggun le?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 9:10" />Pǝlǝa anggun banggi nggun-vwari ama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 9:10">&lt;&lt;Yiu duk murǝm ma'sǝm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 9:11" />Sǝ nggun-vwari nyesǝia wia cau ama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 9:11">&lt;&lt;Mǝ nying pusǝ ɓǝlanggun mem mǝ'pǝlpǝlni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 9:11">andǝ ɓǝlanggun mem mǝɓoarne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 9:11">ace wuliki amúr anggun le?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 9:12" />Pǝlǝa anggun banggi nggun-anap ama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 9:12">&lt;&lt;Yiu duk murǝm ma'sǝm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 9:13" />Sǝ nggun-anap nyesǝia wia cau ama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 9:13">&lt;&lt;Mǝ nying pusǝ mùr-anap mem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 9:13">mǝnana kǝ pwasǝbum Ɓakuli andǝ aɓwapǝndǝa ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 9:13">ace wuliki amúr anggun le?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 9:14" />Nda anggun kat banggi zwe ama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 9:14">&lt;&lt;Yiu duk murǝm ma'sǝm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 9:15" />Zwe eari anggun ama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 9:15">&lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ wu kǝ earce ama wun nǝ̀ twalam nǝ mǝsǝcau,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 9:15">mǝ duk murǝm ma'wun ngga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 9:15">she wun nǝ̀ yiu aɓata yilǝm mem ace kum-àwá!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 9:15">Sǝ ɓǝ̀ pà anggo raka, ɓǝ̀ bǝsa pur aɓa zwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 9:15">sǝ ɓǝ̀ pisǝ <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 4:33">1Amur 4:33</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 14:9">2Amur 14:9</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 19:23">19:23</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:16">Ang 104:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 2:13">Isha 2:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 37:24">37:24</ref></char>.</note>anggun-seda mala Lebano.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 9:16" />&lt;&lt;Ado ka, wun nǝ̀ gandǝ na mbak-kàngkàng ama wu lǝmdǝna domǝsǝcau andǝ ɗwanyicau-arǝǔ nǝ pe Abimelek murǝm le? Wu pàngŋǝ́nì Jerub-ba'al andǝ ɓala male gìr mǝnana nda pepè ka le? Sǝ wu mbwenì kǝla mǝnana karǝa arǝ atúró male ka le? <verse eid="JDG 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 9:17" />Wu ɗenyi ama tárrám twal yilǝmi a kún bui ace amsǝ wun a ɓabù amǝ'Midiyan. <verse eid="JDG 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 9:18" />Sǝ yalung ngga, ndya wu longŋǝ́nà arǝ ɓala mala tárrám. Wu walna-lú amuna-burana male lumi-tongno-nong-ɓari amúr tali mwashat, sǝ wu tsǝ̀ngŋǝ̀nà Abimelek muna-ɓwabura mala mā-twala male, ɓǝ̀ duk murǝm amúr aɓwana-mǝgule mala Shekem, acemǝnana yì ka ɓǝla ma'wun na ka. <verse eid="JDG 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 9:19" />Adyan ngga, ɓǝ̀ gìr mǝnana wu pàkkî Jerub-ba'al andǝ ɓala male yalung ngga, gìr mǝɓoarne na, sǝ mǝ'mǝsǝcaunì na ka, ɓǝ̀ bum wun pwasǝ arǝ Abimelek, sǝ yì gbal ka ɓǝ̀ bumi pwasǝ arǝ wun. <verse eid="JDG 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 9:20" />Sǝ ɓǝ̀ pà anggo raka, ɓǝ̀ bǝsa pùr nǝban Abimelek ɓǝ̀ pisǝ aɓwana-mǝgule mala Shekem andǝ Bet-Millo! Sǝ ɓǝ̀ bǝsa pùr gbal nǝban aɓwana-mǝgule mala Shekem andǝ Bet-Millo ɓǝ̀ pisǝ Abimelek.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 9:21" />Pǝlǝa Jotam ɓangŋa o a Biya, sǝ kya do abanì <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">atàcau mala </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko &lt;&lt;ace upì ɓadǝm&gt;&gt;</char></note>atàcau mala mǝ'eambi Abimelek.<verse eid="JDG 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓakuli lumsǝ suban mala Jotam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 9:22" />Abimelek yálmúr amǝ Isǝrayila apǝlǝa tàrú. <verse eid="JDG 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 9:23" />Pǝlǝa Ɓakuli tasǝ ɓè bangŋo mǝɓike ɓǝ̀ loasǝ ɓibura anre Abimelek andǝ aɓwana-mǝgule mala Shekem; sǝ aɓwana-mǝgule mala Shekem lǝmdǝ ɗwanyi-domǝsǝcau arǝ Abimelek. <verse eid="JDG 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 9:24" />Ɓakuli pàk mǝnia ka ace mǝnana caukpaka mala ɓealɓikea mǝnana à pàkkî amuna-burana lumi-tongno-nong-ɓari mala Jerub-ba'al, andǝ bafe mala nkilia mana à sukkì ka, ɓǝ̀ sulǝ amur Abimelek mǝ'eambia, sǝ amur aɓwana-mǝgule mala Shekem mǝnana à bwali wi wal-lú amǝ'eambi ka. <verse eid="JDG 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 9:25" />Aɓwana-mǝgule mala Shekem mgbicau arǝ Abimelek, sǝ à tasǝ aburana ɓǝà kya kùmsǝî wi amúr ankono, sǝ à ɓǝmbǝri koyan kat mǝnana gya pǝlǝ nǝbania amur njargula mǝno ka. Pǝlǝa cê yi kpa a kir Abimelek.<verse eid="JDG 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 9:26" />Pǝlǝa Ga'al muna-ɓwabura mala Ebet, yiu andǝ amǝ'eambi sǝ à yi do a Shekem. Aɓwana-mǝgule mala Shekem tsǝkɓalǝia arǝ Ga'al. <verse eid="JDG 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 9:27" />Amǝ Shekem wari arǝ aɓaban-anap malea. À ram ɓǝla-anap sǝ à kàmgi mùrì ace pàkkiɗire. Pǝlǝa à kùtí a ndà mala ɓakuli malea sǝ à lìli, à nu, sǝ à sú Abimelek. <verse eid="JDG 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 9:28" />Sǝ Ga'al muna-ɓwabura mala Ebet nacau ama, &lt;&lt;Yana nda Abimelek, sǝ palang sǝ sǝm amǝ Shekem ngga, sǝm nǝ̀ nyesǝ ɓamur rǝ sǝm aɓate? Yì ka nda muna-ɓwabura mala Jerub-ba'al re? Sǝ Zebul ka nda mǝkwaɗitè mǝnana twal ka re? Wu kpata amǝɓala mala <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 34:2">Tite 34:2</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 34:6">6</ref></char>.</note>Hamo, tár Shekem! Palang sǝ sǝm nǝ̀ kpata Abimelek? <verse eid="JDG 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 9:29" />Ɓǝ̀ duk mǝni'ama, aɓwana man ngga, à nda aɓata rǝcandǝa mem ngga, ɓǝ́ mǝ nǝ pusǝ Abimelek!&gt;&gt; Mǝ nǝ ne Abimelek ama, &lt;&lt;Kyane kya hatǝki amǝ'lwa mô sǝ wu pur atàm ɓǝ̀ sǝm munǝo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 9:30" />Lang Zebul mǝ'yálmúr nggea-lê ok acau mala Ga'al muna-ɓwabura mala Ebet ka, bumi lul kǝ̀rkǝ́r. <verse eid="JDG 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 9:31" />Pǝlǝa Zebul tasǝ amǝ'na-túrbân aban Abimelek a Aruma,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Aruma </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko &lt;&lt;aɓa sǝmbǝrǝa&gt;&gt;</char></note> nǝ cau ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝni, Ga'al muna-ɓwabura mala Ebet andǝ amǝ'eambi yina a Shekem, sǝ à ndaban soakita aɓwana mala nggea-là ɓǝà mgbicau arǝò. <verse eid="JDG 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 9:32" />Ado ka, lo wunǝa aburana mǝnana atò ka nǝ du, wu yi kumsǝ a ɓabondo anzǝm nggea-là. <verse eid="JDG 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 9:33" />Nǝ dǝmbari, a eauwe mala pwari ka, wu ndashi amur nggea-là nǝ munǝo. Sǝ lang Ga'al nǝ̀ pur andǝ aburana mǝnana atè ace yiu a munǝo arǝò ka, pàkkia wia gìr mǝnana buo kumi nǝ̀ pàk ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 9:34" />Nda Abimelek andǝ aburana mǝnana atè kat ka, à lo nǝ du sǝ à kya kumsǝ anzǝm Shekem; à gau rǝia arǝ abanì ine. <verse eid="JDG 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 9:35" />Lang Ga'al muna-ɓwabura mala Ebet puro yi cam a bankutio mala kún nggea-là ka, Abimelek andǝ aburana mǝnana atè ka à loapi ban mǝnana à kùmsǝ kam ngga. <verse eid="JDG 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 9:36" />Sǝ lang Ga'al sǝn aburane ka, ne Zebul ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝni, aburana naban sulǝì múr ankono aban yiu.&gt;&gt; Sǝ Zebul ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Yilǝmi ankono na a kǝ̀ sǝnia kǝla aɓwapǝndǝa na ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 9:37" />Ga'al nacau ɗǝm ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝni! Aɓwana no à kǝ sulǝî tsùrú mala nzali man ngga. Sǝ ɓè nggǝsan no kǝ yiu nǝban njar mala Nggun-mǝgule mala Mǝ'nggár ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 9:38" />Pǝlǝa Zebul ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Acau gusǝlǝ-múrû mô na ke? We mǝnana a bang ama, &lt;Yana nda Abimelek mana sǝm nǝ̀ kpate ka?&gt; Aburana mǝnia na a ɓǝsǝkia ka re? Pur ado kya munǝ arǝia!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 9:39" />Nda Ga'al puro sǝ dupi aɓwana-mǝgule mala Shekem a dǝmba, sǝ à munǝ arǝ Abimelek. <verse eid="JDG 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 9:40" />Abimelek pǝrta Ga'al sǝ ɓang a ɓadǝmbi. Amǝ Shekem pas kpakia, à kum penye a bankutio mala kún nggea-lê. <verse eid="JDG 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 9:41" />Abimelek nyar a Aruma, sǝ Zebul pǝr Ga'al andǝ amǝ'eambi à purî ɓá Shekem.<verse eid="JDG 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 9:42" />Lang bankwarna ka, amǝ Shekem puro, à o a njenza. Lang Abimelek ok cê ka, <verse eid="JDG 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 9:43" />twal aburana male sǝ gauwia arǝ abanì tàrú, sǝ à kumsǝ a ɓabondo. Lang sǝn aɓwana kǝ purì ɓá nggea-là aban yiu ka, lo sǝ soa-munǝo arǝia, wal-luia. <verse eid="JDG 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 9:44" />Pǝlǝa Abimelek andǝ nggǝsan aɓwana mana atè ka à ɓangŋa à kya cam a bankutio mala kún nggea-là. Sǝ anggǝsan ɓari mala aɓwana mala Abimelek ka à soa-munǝo sǝ wal-lú aɓwana mǝnana kat a njenza ka. <verse eid="JDG 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 9:45" />A pwari mǝno kat ka, Abimelek munǝ-munǝo arǝ nggea-là. Ak nggea-lê sǝ wal-lú aɓwana mǝnana kat aɓa nggea-lê ka. Pǝlǝa bǝbbǝriki nggea-lê sǝ mesǝki tuɓamur amurí.<verse eid="JDG 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 9:46" />Lang aɓwana-mǝgule mala ndà-kulí mǝ'dāhre mala Shekem ok cê ka, à kùtí aɓa kanggǝrang-ban mala ndà mala El-berit.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:46 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">El-berit </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ɓè lullǝu mala Ba'al-berit</char></note> <verse eid="JDG 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 9:47" />Cau yi bik ban Abimelek ama, aɓwana-mǝgule mala ndà-kulí mǝ'dāhre mala Shekem ramǝna abanɓwáná. <verse eid="JDG 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 9:48" />Nda Abimelek andǝ aburana mǝnana kat atè ka à eau amúr Nkono <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:48 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zalmon </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 68:14">Ang 68:14</ref></char>.</note>Zalmon. Sǝ Abimelek twal bero a bui sǝ kasǝ bu-nggun, loasǝi tsǝì a kwàrì. Sǝ banggi aburana mǝnana atè ka ama, &lt;&lt;Gìr mǝnana wu sǝni ǝn pê ka, wu fà rǝ wun, wu pè kǝla mǝnana ǝn pàk ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JDG 9:49" />Nda koyan ateà ka kasǝ bu-nggun gbal, sǝ à kpata Abimelek. À tsǝk abu-nggunì arǝ kanggǝrang-ban mala ndà mala El-berit, sǝ à soaki wi bǝsa. Aɓwana mǝnana kat aɓa ndà-kulí mǝ'dāhre mala Shekem ngga à wù kat, aɓwana kǝla á-mwashat (1,000), aburana andǝ amamǝna.<verse eid="JDG 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JDG 9:50" />Pǝlǝa Abimelek wari a Tebez, tsǝk kàttì kàm, soa-munǝo arǝì sǝ é. <verse eid="JDG 9:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JDG 9:51" />Kanggǝrang ndà-kulí mǝ'dāhre nakam a tsùrú mala nggea-lê, nda aburana andǝ amamǝna andǝ aɓwana-mǝgule mala nggea-lê ɓangŋa, à kutiki aɓalǝi sǝ à gìrkún ɓamuria aɓalǝi. Pǝlǝa à eauwe à bik múr-kurǝm. <verse eid="JDG 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JDG 9:52" />Abimelek yiu sǝ soa-munǝo arǝ ndà-kulí mǝ'dāhrenì. Sǝama lang gbashì kún ndà-kulí mǝ'dāhrenì nǝ̀ soaki wi bǝsa ka, <verse eid="JDG 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JDG 9:53" />kara ɓè ɓwama a múr-kurǝm, túr muna-taligo amur Abimelek, ar nkpoula-ɓamuri. <verse eid="JDG 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JDG 9:54" />Pǝlǝa Abimelek tunǝ lagga mǝ-bwali-wi agirmunǝo male akaurǝa, sǝ banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Kwetǝ nggeabyau mô, wal-luem, ace mǝnana ɓǝà kǝa na amuram ama, &lt;Ɓwama na mǝnana wal-luí ka&gt; ɗàng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JDG 9:55" />Lang amǝ Isǝrayila sǝni Abimelek wuna ka, koyanale ka nyar a là male.<verse eid="JDG 9:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JDG 9:56" />Ɓakuli nyesǝì Abimelek mǝɓike mǝnana pàkkî tárrí, nǝ wal-lú amǝ'eambi lumi-tongno-nong-ɓari ka. <verse eid="JDG 9:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JDG 9:57" />Ɗǝm ngga Ɓakuli tsǝk mǝɓike mǝnana aburana mala Shekem pè ka ɓǝ̀ nyar amúrià, sǝ suban mǝnana Jotam muna-ɓwabura mala Jerub-ba'al ne ka, yi sulǝ amúrià.<verse eid="JDG 9:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JDG 10" />
  <para style="s">Tola andǝ Jayir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 10:1" />Anzǝm lú mala Abimelek ka, Tola muna-ɓwabura mala Puwa, mǝ'kà Dodo, a tàu mala Isaka, lo ace amsǝ amǝ Isǝrayila. Yì Tola ka, do a Shamir aɓa nzali múr-ankono mala Ifǝrem. <verse eid="JDG 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 10:2" />Yì ka, duk kasǝla amúr amǝ Isǝrayila apǝlǝa lumi-ɓari-nong-tàrú, sǝ yi wú. À tsǝì a Shamir.<verse eid="JDG 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 10:3" />Anzǝm Tola ka, Jayir ɓwa Gilǝyat lo, sǝ duk kasǝla amúr amǝ Isǝrayila apǝlǝa lumi-ɓari-nong-ɓari. <verse eid="JDG 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 10:4" />Jayir ndanǝ amuna-burana lumi-tàrú mǝnana à kǝ gya a nzǝm amǝdambǝriso lumi-tàrú ka, sǝ à yálmúr alá lumi-tàrú a Gilǝyat. À kǝ tunǝ amǝno yì alá ka ama Havot-Jayir<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Havot-Jayir </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko alá aɓata yálmúrû mala Jayir</char></note> bà yalung. <verse eid="JDG 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 10:5" />Jayir paklú sǝ à tsǝkbani a Kamon.<verse eid="JDG 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amǝ'Amon andǝ amǝ'Filisti par amǝ'Isǝrayila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 10:6" />Amǝ Isǝrayila pàk gìr mǝɓike ɗǝm, a sǝne mala Yahweh.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 2:11-13">Akas 2:11-13</ref></char>.</note> À peri aban aBa'al andǝ Ashtarot, aɓakuli mala amǝ'Suriya, andǝ aɓakuli mala amǝ'Sidon, andǝ aɓakuli mala amǝ'Mowap, andǝ aɓakuli mala amǝ'Amon, andǝ aɓakuli mala amǝ'Filisti. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 31:16">Nggur 31:16</ref></char>.</note>À vwakibuia arǝ Yahweh, sǝ à nying peri abani. <verse eid="JDG 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 10:7" />Nda bumlulla mala Yahweh earke amúr amǝ Isǝrayila, sǝ tasǝia a ɓabù amǝ'Filisti andǝ amǝ'Amon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 2:14">Akas 2:14</ref></char>.</note> ngga. <verse eid="JDG 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 10:8" />Amǝ'Filisti andǝ amǝ'Amon par amǝ Isǝrayila sǝ à betia aɓa pǝlǝa mǝno. À par amǝ Isǝrayila ba apǝlǝa lum-bwamdǝ-tongno-nong-tàrú, yià amǝ Isǝrayila mǝnana kat à ndanǝdo a takuli mala Jodan, a nzali mala amǝ'Amor, mǝnana nda aɓa Gilǝyat ka. <verse eid="JDG 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 10:9" />Pǝlǝa amǝ'Amon gbal ka à yàlî Nggeasala Jodan ace kánǝ munǝo arǝ amǝ'tàu mala Yahuda, andǝ amǝ'tàu mala Benjami, sǝ arǝ ɓala-kàu mala Ifǝrem. Amǝ Isǝrayila tanni kǝ̀rkǝ́r.<verse eid="JDG 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 10:10" />Nda amǝ Isǝrayila ɓua aban Yahweh ama: &lt;&lt;Sǝm pàngŋǝ́nò cauɓikea. Sǝm pǝlǝna nzǝm sǝm arǝò, we Ɓakuli ma'sǝm, sǝ sǝm kpanata aBa'al.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 10:11" />Sǝ Yahweh earî amǝ Isǝrayila ama, &lt;&lt;Ən amsǝ wun a ɓabù amǝ'Masar, andǝ amǝ'Amor, andǝ amǝ'Amon, andǝ amǝ'Filisti re? <verse eid="JDG 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 10:12" />Ɗǝm ngga lang amǝ'Sidon, andǝ amǝ'Amalek, andǝ amǝ'Mawon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">amǝ'Mawon </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko &lt;&lt;amǝ'Midiyan&gt;&gt;</char></note> par wun aɓata tanni, sǝ wu ɓua abanam ngga, ǝn amsǝ wun a ɓabuia. <verse eid="JDG 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 10:13" />Sǝ kat andǝ mǝno ka, wu pǝlǝ nzǝm wun arǝàm, wu kpata aɓea aɓakuli. Acemani ka, pà Mǝ nǝ amsǝ wun ɗǝm ɗàng. <verse eid="JDG 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 10:14" />Wu kyane, wu kya ɓua aban aɓakuli mǝnana wu twal ka; ɓǝà amsǝ wun a pwari mǝnana wu kùtí aɓa tanni ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 10:15" />Sǝ amǝ Isǝrayila zǝmbî Yahweh ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝm pàngŋǝ̀nà cauɓikea. Pàk gìr mǝnana kat a kǝ sǝni nda pepè awu nǝ pangnǝ sǝm ngga, sǝama, ida amsǝ sǝm yalung.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 10:16" />Nda amǝ Isǝrayila pusǝki abǝri ɓakuli mǝnana aɓalǝia ka, à sukkia, sǝ à peri aban Yahweh ka. A masǝlǝate ka, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 2:18">Akas 2:18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:9">Isha 63:9</ref></char>.</note>Yahweh yi aulǝ nǝ sǝn tanni mǝɓike mǝnana amǝ Isǝrayila kǝ nu ka.<verse eid="JDG 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 10:17" />Amǝ'lwa mala amǝ'Amon ram rǝia abanɓwáná, sǝ à kya tsǝk kàttì malea aɓa Gilǝyat; amǝ Isǝrayila gbal ka, à ram rǝia abanɓwáná sǝ à kya tsǝk kàttì malea a Mizpa aɓa Gilǝyat. <verse eid="JDG 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 10:18" />Aɓwana-mǝgule amur Gilǝyat<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Gilǝyat </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko &lt;&lt;amǝ Isǝrayila mǝnana a bù-nzali Gilǝyat ka&gt;&gt;</char></note> ne arǝarǝia ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwa mana nǝ̀ tita kánǝ munǝo arǝ amǝ'Amon ngga, ɓwê na nǝ̀ duk múrû amúr aɓwana puppup mǝnana ndanǝdo a Gilǝyat ka.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 11:5-6">Akas 11:5-6</ref>,<ref loc="JDG 11:8">8</ref>,<ref loc="JDG 11:11">11</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="JDG 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JDG 11" />
  <para style="s">Jefta duk Kasǝla mala Isǝrayila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 11:1" />A bàkú mǝno ka, Jefta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jefta </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 12:11">1Sam 12:11</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:32">Ib 11:32</ref></char>.</note> ɓwa Gilǝyat ka, nggea kanggǝrang mǝ'lwa na, sǝama yi ka, muna mala mā-gyatarǝu na. Gilǝyat nda tár Jefta. <verse eid="JDG 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 11:2" />Mālá Gilǝyat ɓǝlî Gilǝyat amuna-burana. Sǝ lang amuna-burana mala māmí gulkina ka, à pǝ̀r Jefta, sǝ à banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;A pà wunǝ kum liɓala aɓa ɓala mala tár sǝm ɗàng, acemǝnana a nda muna mala ɓè ɓwama ɗàng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 11:3" />Pǝlǝa Jefta ɓanggi amǝ'eambi, sǝ kya do a nzali Top,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Top </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 10:6">2Sam 10:6</ref>,<ref loc="2SA 10:8">8</ref></char>.</note> sǝ aɓwana-mǝɓane na mǝnana à ram rǝia à kǝ pur gya andǝi ka.<verse eid="JDG 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 11:4" />Ɓè pwari yiu mǝnana amǝ'Amon yinǝ munǝo arǝ Isǝrayila ka. <verse eid="JDG 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 11:5" />Sǝ lang amǝ'Amon soa munǝo arǝ Isǝrayila ka, aɓwana-mǝgule mala Gilǝyat wari a nzali Top ace yinǝ Jefta. <verse eid="JDG 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 11:6" />À banggi Jefta ama, &lt;&lt;Yiu yi duk múr sǝm, ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ sǝm munǝ arǝ amǝ'Amon ngga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 11:7" />Sǝ Jefta ne aɓwana-mǝgule mala Gilǝyat ama, &lt;&lt;Wun nda mǝnana wu lǝmdǝam ɓinǝmǝsǝu, sǝ wu pǝram ǝn purì ɓala mala tárrám ngga re? Palang sǝ wu yiu abanam ado mǝnana wu kutina aɓa tanni ka?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 11:8" />Pǝlǝa aɓwana-mǝgule mala Gilǝyat earî Jefta ama, &lt;&lt;Nda gìr mǝnana tsǝa sǝ sǝm nyar a bano ado ka. Yiu atà sǝm ace munǝo arǝ amǝ'Amon, sǝ awu nǝ duk múr sǝm, sǝm kat a Gilǝyat.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 11:9" />Pǝlǝa Jefta banggi aɓwana-mǝgule mala Gilǝyat ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ wu nyesǝam ace munǝo arǝ amǝ'Amon, sǝ Yahweh tsǝa à kpa a ɓabuam ngga, mǝ nǝ duk múr wun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 11:10" />Sǝ aɓwana-mǝgule mala Gilǝyat earî Jefta ama, &lt;&lt;Yahweh ɓǝ̀ duk mǝ'nakún anre sǝm, ɓǝ̀ sǝm pak kǝla mǝnana a na raka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 11:11" />Anggo sǝ Jefta o andǝ aɓwana-mǝgule mala Gilǝyat, sǝ à kya tsǝi duk múrû, sǝ mǝ'sàrǝ̀ban amúrià. Sǝ Jefta ɓǝsǝlǝ bang acau male kat<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">acau male kat </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mala eare mǝnia ka</char></note> aɓadǝm Yahweh a Mizpa.<verse eid="JDG 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 11:12" />Pǝlǝa Jefta tasǝ amǝ'na-túrbân aban murǝm mala amǝ'Amon nǝ cau ama, &lt;&lt;Mana ǝn pakko, sǝ a yiu ama a nǝ munǝ arǝ nzali mem?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 11:13" />Sǝ murǝm mala amǝ'Amon earî amǝ'na-túrbân mala Jefta ama, &lt;&lt;Nda acemǝnana lang Isǝrayila purî Masar aban yiu ka, ak nzali mem, twal a Nggeasala Arnon, kya bik Nggeasala Jabok, sǝ sárǝ́ aban ká a Nggeasala Jodan; acemani ka, nyesǝi aɓa do-jam.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 11:14" />Jefta pǝlǝa tasǝ amǝ'na-túrbân ɗǝm aban murǝm mala amǝ'Amon, <verse eid="JDG 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 11:15" />sǝ à kya ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Jefta bang ama: Isǝrayila ak nzali mala amǝ'Mowap ko nzali mala amǝ'Amon ɗàng. <verse eid="JDG 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 11:16" />Lang Isǝrayila purî Masar ka, kútí nǝɓa pǝɗanban, aban ká a Nggeamùr Nzuno, sǝ yiu a Kadesh. <verse eid="JDG 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 11:17" />Isǝrayila pǝlǝa tasǝ amǝ'na-túrbân aban murǝm mala amǝ'Edom, ama &lt;Ida, eara sǝm ɓǝ̀ sǝm kùtí nǝɓa nzali mô.&gt; Sǝ murǝm Edom ngga kwakikiri ɗàng. Ɗǝm ngga, à tasǝ cau aban murǝm mala amǝ'Mowap, sǝ yi gbal ka wakí cê. Nda Isǝrayila ueo a Kadesh ka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kadesh </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 20:14-21">Ɓal 20:14-21</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="JDG 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 11:18" />Pǝlǝa à twal gya nǝɓa pǝɗanban, sǝ à kàrìban arǝ nkanggari nzong-nzali mala amǝ'Edom andǝ mala amǝ'Mowap. À kya bik bù takuli mala nzali mala amǝ'Mowap, sǝ à yi duk kàttì a nkaring Nggeasala Arnon; à kùtí aɓa bu-nzali mala amǝ'Mowap ɗàng, acemǝnana myalmur Arnon ngga, nda nzong-nzali mala amǝ'Mowap. <verse eid="JDG 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 11:19" />Isǝrayila pǝlǝa tasǝ amǝ'na-túrbân aban Sihon, murǝm mala amǝ'Amor, murǝm mala Heshbon, nǝ cau ɓǝà banggi wi ama, &lt;Ida, eara sǝm ɓǝ̀ sǝm kùtí nǝɓa nzali mô aban ká a là ma'sǝm.&gt; <verse eid="JDG 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 11:20" />Sǝ Sihon ngga, earnǝ Isǝrayila ama ɓǝ̀ kùtí nǝɓa nzong-nzali male ɗàng; nda Sihon ramba aɓwana male kat abanɓwáná, à yi tsǝk kàttì a Jahaz, sǝ warinǝ munǝo arǝ Isǝrayila ka.<verse eid="JDG 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 11:21" />&lt;&lt;Pǝlǝa Yahweh, Ɓakuli mala Isǝrayila pà Sihon andǝ amǝ'lwa male puppup a ɓabu Isǝrayila, sǝ Isǝrayila gandǝia. Anggo sǝ Isǝrayila ak nzali Amor kat, arǝ aɓwana mǝnana à dukam ɗiɗyal ka. <verse eid="JDG 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 11:22" />Isǝrayila ak nzalinì twal a Nggeasala Arnon kya bik Nggeasala Jabok, sǝ twal aɓa Pǝɗanban, kya bik Nggeasala Jodan.<verse eid="JDG 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 11:23" />&lt;&lt;Ado mǝnana Yahweh, Ɓakuli mala Isǝrayila angŋǝna nzali arǝ amǝ'Amor sǝ pǝrnia à purni ɓadǝmba amǝ Isǝrayila, aɓwana male ka, a ndarǝ ɓariki awu nǝ ak nzalinì arǝia le? <verse eid="JDG 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 11:24" />Ɓǝ̀ Kemosh ɓakuli ma'wun, pà wun gìr ka, pà nǝ̀ duk girkuma ma'wun re? Anggo gbal gìr mǝnana kat Yahweh, Ɓakuli ma'sǝm pǝr aɓwana sǝ pà sǝmi ka, dumǝna ma'sǝm. <verse eid="JDG 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 11:25" />Nggeari ka, a kútì <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni aɓa: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:2">Ɓal 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:9">Jes 24:9</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 6:5">Mik 6:5</ref></char></note>Balak muna-ɓwabura mala Zippor, murǝm mala amǝ'Mowap le? Yi ka, kutia ɓekǝ makgir andǝ Isǝrayila a kǝ fara le? Sǝ wari nǝ lwa arǝia a kǝ fara le? <verse eid="JDG 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 11:26" />Twalna Isǝrayila apǝlǝa gbǝman tàrú (300) nda ban do a Heshbon andǝ amuna-là male, sǝ a Aruwa andǝ amuna-là male, sǝ arǝ anggea-là mǝnana kat à nda a kún Nggeasala Arnon ngga. Ɓǝ̀ mbak-kàngkàng nzalinì ka ma'wun na, wun amǝ'Amon ngga, palang sǝ wu ak anggea-lê aɓalǝ apǝlǝkia mǝno ka ɗàng? <verse eid="JDG 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 11:27" />Acemani ka, mim ngga, ǝn pakko cauɓikea ɗàng; a nda mǝnana a kǝ pàkkam mǝɓane nǝ yiu mô arǝàm nǝ munǝo ka. Ado ka, ɓǝ̀ Yahweh, mǝɓashi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mǝɓashi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 18:25">Tite 18:25</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 9:15">Ayu 9:15</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 23:7">23:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 7:11">Ang 7:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 50:6">50:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 75:7">75:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 33:2">Isha 33:2</ref></char>.</note> kasǝ-ɓashi yalung anre ka amǝ Isǝrayila andǝ amǝ'Amon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 11:28" />Kat andǝ mani anggo ka, murǝm mala amǝ'Amon tsǝkiri arǝ acau mǝnana Jefta túrìbani ka ɗàng.<verse eid="JDG 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pàcau mala Jefta mǝnana yinǝì wi nǝ bumkiɗikea ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 11:29" />A bàkú mǝno ka, Bangŋo mala Yahweh yiu amur Jefta, sǝ twal gya kútí nǝɓa Gilǝyat andǝ Manasa, sǝ kya kútí aban ká a Mizpa mala Gilǝyat, sǝ purî Mizpa mala Gilǝyat ka, kútí aban ká aban amǝ'Amon. <verse eid="JDG 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 11:30" />Pǝlǝa Jefta pàcau nǝ-shambum<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">pàcau nǝ-shambum </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 28:20">Tite 28:20</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 30:2">Ɓal 30:2</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 1:11">1Sam 1:11</ref></char>.</note> aban Yahweh, bang ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ mbak-kàngkàng awu nǝ pà amǝ'Amon a ɓabuam ngga, <verse eid="JDG 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 11:31" />ɓǝ̀-mana pur a kún ɓala mem aban yiu a kulliǎm, lang ǝn nyarǝnì ban amǝ'Amon aɓa limurǝm ngga, nǝ̀ duk mala Yahweh, sǝ mǝ nǝ pana gir'nkila mala pisǝe kǝring nǝi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 11:32" />Nda Jefta yàl a nkaring aban o a munǝo arǝ amǝ'Amon ngga, sǝ Yahweh tsǝa à kpa a ɓabui. <verse eid="JDG 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 11:33" />Sǝ kiɗiki anggea-là lumi-ɓari nǝ kiɗikiban mǝgule, twal a Aruwa aban ká ɗār arǝ abân mǝnana à kàrì nggea-là Minit, sǝ kya bwal ɗār a ban nggea-là Abel-keramim ngga. Anggo sǝ amǝ Isǝrayila ɓùn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 3:30">Akas 3:30</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 8:28">8:28</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 7:13">1Sam 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 20:4">1Acau 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 13:18">2Acau 13:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:42">Ang 106:42</ref></char>.</note> amǝ'Amon aɓatea.<verse eid="JDG 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 11:34" />Pǝlǝa Jefta nyar a ɓala male, a Mizpa, sǝ mǝnia ka nda gìr mǝnana sǝn ngga: ɓoarnsarile puro aban ká a kúllè nǝ wal karata-bu andǝ ta'nggwam. Yì nda kǝ muni ɓǝ̀rɓǝ̀r; ɓǝ̀ yì na raka, panǝ ɓekǝ muna-ɓwabura, ko muna-ɓwama ɗàng. <verse eid="JDG 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 11:35" />Sǝ lang sǝni ka, kara bwal daura male sannì,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:35 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kara bwal daura male sannì </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko &lt;&lt;kara bumkiɗikea bwali kǝ̀rkǝ́r&gt;&gt;</char></note> sǝ bang ama, &lt;&lt;Oi ɓoarnsarilem! A ɓunǝnam a nzali amúr ankūnǝam, sǝ a dumǝna tǝ́r bumkiɗikea mǝgule abanam. Acemǝnana ǝn panacau aban Yahweh, sǝ pà mǝ nǝ nggaɗi kunam ɗàng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 11:36" />Sǝ earî wi ama, &lt;&lt;Dâ, ɓǝ̀ a angŋa-dǝmba a panacau aban Yahweh, sǝ ado mǝnana Yahweh pano limurǝm amur aɓio-amǝbura, amǝ'Amon ngga, pàngnǝ mim kǝla mǝnana a pacau ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 11:37" />Pǝlǝa banggi tárrí ama, &lt;&lt;Pakkam mǝnia yì gìr ka: ɗekiam ace mǝnana mǝ o a ɓua do-nsari mem sǝnǝ aɓiam, amur ankono, ba azongŋo ɓari.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 11:38" />Sǝ tarrí earî wi ama, &lt;&lt;Kyane.&gt;&gt;Pǝlǝa tasǝi ɓǝ̀ o, yì andǝ aɓî, sǝ à kya ɓua do-nsari male amur ankono ba azongŋo ɓari. <verse eid="JDG 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 11:39" />Sǝ a masǝlǝata azongŋo ɓari ka, nyar aban tárrí, sǝ tárrí pàngnǝi kǝla mana pàcau nǝ-shambum ngga; sǝ yì muna-ɓwame ka súrǝ̀ kǝ ɓwabura ɗang. Pǝlǝa cê duk kuncau a Isǝrayila <verse eid="JDG 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 11:40" />ama koya pǝlǝa ka amuna-mamǝna mala amǝ Isǝrayila nǝ̀ twal anonggio ine ace o a ɓua ace muna-ɓwama mala Jefta, ɓwa Gilǝyat.<verse eid="JDG 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JDG 12" />
  <para style="s">Amǝ Ifǝrem munǝo arǝ aburana mala Jefta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 12:1" />Amǝ Ifǝrem tunǝ amǝ'lwa malea abanɓwáná, sǝ à yàlî nkaring. À wari a Zafon ace je andǝ Jefta. À ɗì Jefta ama, &lt;&lt;Palang sǝ a wari a lwa arǝ amǝ'Amon, sǝ a tunǝ sǝm, ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ sǝm kyan sǝnǝa wun ngga ɗàng? Ado ka, sǝm ndo sǝm nǝ̀ pisǝo wunǝ ɓala mò kat.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 12:2" />Pǝlǝa Jefta pa eare ama, &lt;&lt;Mim sǝnǝ aɓwana mem ngga, sǝm kùtí aɓa makgir mǝgule sǝnǝ amǝ'Amon. Ən tunǝ wun ɓǝ̀ wu yiu ace amsǝam a ɓabuia, sǝ wu yiu ɗang. <verse eid="JDG 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 12:3" />Sǝ lang ǝn sǝni ama, pà wu nǝ̀ pàkkam gbasha raka, ǝn twal yilǝmem a kún buam, sǝ ǝn yàl nkaring aban ká arǝ amǝ'Amon, sǝ Yahweh túrmuria a ɓabuam. Sǝ mana tsǝa ado, sǝ wu yiu yalung nǝ munǝo arǝàm?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 12:4" />Sǝ amǝ Ifǝrem bang ama, &lt;&lt;Wun amǝ Gilǝyat aɓa Ifǝrem ngga, wun nda ka yan? Wun nda ka kǝ aɓwana mana wu ɓangŋa, sǝ wu yiu ace kum-àwá aɓa bù-nzali Ifǝrem andǝ Manasa ka!&gt;&gt; Nda Jefta ramba aburana mala amǝ Gilǝyat, sǝ à soa munǝo arǝ amǝ Ifǝrem. Sǝ aburana mala Gilǝyat gandǝ amǝ Ifǝrem.<verse eid="JDG 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 12:5" />Aburana mala Gilǝyat ak ban yálì nkaring mùr mala Nggeasala Jodan arǝ amǝ Ifǝrem. Sǝ lang ɓwa Ifǝrem mana auna, sǝ yi bang ama, &lt;&lt;Wu ɗekiam, ɓǝn yàl a nkaring ngga,&gt;&gt; aburana mala amǝ Gilǝyat nǝ̀ ɗì ama, &lt;&lt;A nda ɓwa Ifǝrem le?&gt;&gt; Sǝ ɓǝ̀ pa eare ama, &lt;&lt;Awo ka,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 12:6" />pǝlǝa à nǝ̀ bang ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ nda anggo ka, ida, bang ama, &lt;Shibbolet.&gt; &gt;&gt; Sǝ yì ka nǝ̀ bang ama, &lt;&lt;Sibbolet,&gt;&gt; acemǝnana pà nǝ̀ gandǝ pusǝ cau mǝno ka pepè ɗàng. Pǝlǝa à nǝ̀ gbami, à nǝ̀ wal-luí a mǝno yì ban yálì nkaring mùr Jodan ngga. Anggo, sǝ à wal-lú ka amǝ Ifǝrem, á-lumi-ine-nong-ɓari (42,000), a mǝno yì pwari ka.<verse eid="JDG 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 12:7" />Jefta ka duk kasǝla mala amǝ Isǝrayila, mala apǝlǝa tongno-nong-mwashat. Pǝlǝa Jefta, ɓwa Gilǝyat paklú sǝ à tsǝì a ɓembe, a la male aɓa Gilǝyat.<verse eid="JDG 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibzan, andǝ Elon, andǝ Abdon duk akasǝla mala amǝ Isǝrayila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 12:8" />Anzǝm Jefta ka, Ibzan, ɓwa Betalami, duk kasǝla mala Isǝrayila. <verse eid="JDG 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 12:9" />Yi ka, ndanǝ amuna-burana lumi-tàrú, andǝ amuna-mamǝna lumi-tàrú. Yi pǎ amuna-mamǝna male à alki aburana mǝnana à pa a tàu male raka. Sǝ amuna-burana male ka, alkia wia amamǝna mǝnana à pà a tàu male raka. Ibzan duk kasǝla amúr Isǝrayila apǝlǝa tongno-nong-ɓari. <verse eid="JDG 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 12:10" />Pǝlǝa Ibzan paklú, sǝ à tsǝì a ɓembe a Betalami.<verse eid="JDG 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 12:11" />Anzǝm Ibzan ngga, Elon a tàu mala Zebulu, duk kasǝla amur Isǝrayila apǝlǝa lum. <verse eid="JDG 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 12:12" />Pǝlǝa Elon ɓwa tàu Zebulu paklú, sǝ à tsǝì a ɓembe a Aijalon, a bù-nzali Zebulu.<verse eid="JDG 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 12:13" />Anzǝmi ka, Abdon muna-ɓwabura mala Hilel, ɓwa Piraton, duk kasǝla a Isǝrayila. <verse eid="JDG 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 12:14" />Ndanǝ amuna-burana lumi-ine, andǝ amǝkau-amuna-burana lumi-tàrú, mana à kǝ kok amǝdambǝriso lumi-tongno-nong-ɓari ka. Abdon duk kasǝla a Isǝrayila apǝlǝa tongno-nong-tàrú. <verse eid="JDG 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 12:15" />Pǝlǝa Abdon, muna-ɓwabura mala Hilel ɓwa Piraton paklú, sǝ à tsǝì a ɓembe a Piraton, a bù-nzali Ifǝrem, aɓa nzali múr-ankono mala amǝ'Amalek.<verse eid="JDG 12:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JDG 13" />
  <para style="s">Ɓǝlban mala Samsǝn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 13:1" />Ɗǝm ngga, amǝ Isǝrayila pàk gìr mǝnana mǝɓike na a mǝsǝ Yahweh ka, nda Yahweh tasǝia a ɓabù amǝ'Filisti apǝlǝa lumi-ine ka.<verse eid="JDG 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 13:2" />A bàkú mǝno ka, ɓè ɓwabura nakam lùllǝì ama Manuwa, ɓwa Zora a tàu mala Dan. Māmí ka ɓǝl muna ɗàng, acemǝnana nkombi na. <verse eid="JDG 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 13:3" />Mǝturonjar mala Yahweh pusǝrǝi aban ɓwame, sǝ banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝni, a nda nkombi, sǝ a ɓǝl kǝ muna ɗang, sǝama awu nǝ kum muna a bumo, awu nǝ ɓǝl muna-ɓwabura. <verse eid="JDG 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 13:4" />Adyan ngga, tsǝkiro! A pà wunǝ nu mùr-anap ko mba ɗàng, sǝ a pà wunǝ lì kǝ gìr'ɓeami ɗàng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 6:2-5">Ɓal 6:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:15">Luk 1:15</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="JDG 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 13:5" />Sǝni, awu nǝ kum muna a bumo sǝ awu nǝ ɓǝl muna-ɓwabura. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 16:17">Akas 16:17</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 1:11">1Sam 1:11</ref></char>.</note>Kǝ nkembu pa nǝ̀ je múrí ɗàng, acemǝnana twal a bum ngga, munê nǝ̀ duk ɓwa-Nazir aban Ɓakuli. Sǝ munê ka nǝ̀ tita amsǝ amǝ Isǝrayila a ɓabù amǝ'Filisti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 13:6" />Pǝlǝa mālá Manuwa wario kya ne burí ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓè ɓwa mala Ɓakuli yiu abanam, sǝ ɓamǝsǝi ka ndanǝ ɓoarɓwa kǝ̀rkǝ́r kǝla ɓamǝsǝ mǝturonjar mala Ɓakuli. Ən ɗî ban mǝnana pur kàm ngga ɗàng, sǝ banggam lùllǝì ɗàng. <verse eid="JDG 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 13:7" />Banggam ama, &lt;Sǝni, awu nǝ̀ kum muna a bumo, sǝ awu nǝ̀ ɓǝl muna-ɓwabura. Adyan ngga, a pà wunǝ nu mùr-anap ko mba ɗàng, sǝ a pà wunǝ li ɓekǝ gìr'ɓeami ɗàng, acemǝnana twal a bum ngga, munê nǝ̀ duk ɓwa-Nazir ba lú male.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 13:8" />Pǝlǝa Manuwa pakhiwi aban Yahweh ama, &lt;&lt;Ida, Mǝtalem, nying ɓwa mala Ɓakuli mana a tasǝi ka ɓǝ̀ nyare ɓǝ̀ yiu ɗǝm aban sǝm, ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ yi kania sǝm lang sǝ sǝm nǝ̀ lǝsǝ muna mana à nǝ̀ ɓǝli ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 13:9" />Sǝ Ɓakuli ok hiwi mala Manuwa; mǝturonjar mala Ɓakuli nyare yiu aban mālá Manuwa lang ndaban do a patal ka. Sǝama burí Manuwa ka pa a baní ɗàng. <verse eid="JDG 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 13:10" />Pǝlǝa ɓang akaurǝa kya ne burí ama, &lt;&lt;Yiu akaurǝa! Ɓwabura mana yiu abanam a ɓè pwari ka, yi pusǝnarǝi ɗǝm abanam!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 13:11" />Manuwa lo, sǝ o atà māmí. Lang yi kum ɓwabure ka ɗì ama, &lt;&lt;A nda ɓwabura mana a nacau nǝ māmám ngga le?&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa ɓwabure eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;È, mǝ nda.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 13:12" />Manuwa ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Adyan ngga, ɓǝ̀ cau mò yi lúmsǝ̀nà ka, lang sǝ sǝm nǝ̀ lǝsǝ munê, sǝ ya túró na munê nǝ̀ yia pa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 13:13" />Mǝturonjar mala Yahweh ne Manuwa ama, &lt;&lt;Māmó ɓǝ̀ tsǝkiri arǝ agir mǝnana kat ǝn banggi wi ka. <verse eid="JDG 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 13:14" />Māmó pà nǝ̀ li kǝgir mana pur arǝ nggun-anap ka ɗàng. Pà nǝ̀ nu mùr-anap ko mba ɗàng, sǝ pà nǝ̀ li kǝ gìr'ɓeami ɗàng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni gbal a mǝsǝi 4 andǝ 7 mala kùré mǝnia.</char></note> Yì ka, ɓǝ̀ kpata agir mǝnana kat ǝn banggi wi ɓǝ̀ pàk ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 13:15" />Manuwa ne mǝturonjar mala Yahweh ama, &lt;&lt;Ida, kundǝ bǝti, ace mana ɓǝ̀ sǝm lambo muna-mbul ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 13:16" />Mǝturonjar mala Yahweh banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ko ɓǝ̀ a tsǝem ǝn kúndǝ ka, pà mǝ nǝ lì girlina mô ɗàng. Sǝama ɓǝ̀ a ndanǝ gìr mǝnana awu nǝ pana ɓoro mala pisǝe kǝring nǝi ka, pà aban Yahweh.&gt;&gt; (Manuwa ka sǝlǝ ama mǝturonjar mala Yahweh na ɗàng.) <verse eid="JDG 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 13:17" />Sǝ Manuwa ɗì mǝturonjar mala Yahweh ama, &lt;&lt;Mana nda lullǝo, ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ sǝm gusǝlǝo lang cau mò yi lúmsǝ̀nà ka?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 13:18" />Mǝturonjar mala Yahweh banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Palang sǝ a ɗiem lullǝam? Lullǝam ngga gìr'ndali na, a pà wu nǝ̀ bwalte ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 13:19" />Nda Manuwa twal muna-mbul sǝ ɗàrǝ́ mǝsǝsa ace pàgir mala mǝsǝsa, sǝ pana ɓoro nǝia amúr tali aban Yahweh. Mǝturonjar mala Yahweh pàk gìr'ndali, lang Manuwa andǝ māmí na ban sǝnban ngga. <verse eid="JDG 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 13:20" />Lang lasǝ-bǝsa lo amúr gyangŋan aban o a kuli ka, kara à sǝn mǝturonjar mala Yahweh mǝno eau aban o a kuli aɓa lasǝ-bǝshe. Lang Manuwa andǝ māmí sǝni anggo ka, à sarǝa a nzali nǝ ɓamǝsǝia. <verse eid="JDG 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 13:21" />Mǝturonjar mala Yahweh pusǝrǝi aban Manuwa andǝ māmí ɗǝm ɗàng. Nda Manuwa yi sǝlǝ ama ɓwê ka, mǝturonjar mala Yahweh na. <verse eid="JDG 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 13:22" />Manuwa ne māmí ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓafo, sǝm nda sǝm nǝ̀ wù ka, acemǝnana sǝm sǝnǝna Ɓakuli.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 13:23" />Sǝama māmí banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ Yahweh earce ama nǝ̀ wal-lú sǝm ngga, pà nǝ̀ ak pàgir mala pisǝe kǝring, andǝ pagìr mala mǝsǝsa a bù sǝm ɗàng. Ɗǝm ngga, pà nǝ̀ lǝmdǝa sǝm amǝnia yì agir kat, ko nǝ̀ hamba sǝm agir kǝla amǝnia ka ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 13:24" />Mālá Manuwa ɓǝl muna-ɓwabura, sǝ tsǝki wi lullǝu ama Samsǝn. Mune gulo sǝ Yahweh tsǝki wi bù. <verse eid="JDG 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 13:25" />Bangŋo mala Yahweh tita pàktúró nǝ Samsǝn a Mahane-Dan, anre <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 18:11">Akas 18:11</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 15:33">Jes 15:33</ref></char>.</note>Zora andǝ Eshtawol.<verse eid="JDG 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JDG 14" />
  <para style="s">Doɓala mala Samsǝn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 14:1" />Samsǝn wari a Timna,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 38:12-13">Tite 38:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 15:10">Jes 15:10</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 19:43">19:43</ref></char>.</note> sǝ kya sǝn ɓè muna-ɓwama mala amǝ'Filisti a ban mǝno. <verse eid="JDG 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 14:2" />Lang nyar a là ka, yi ne tárrí andǝ nggè ama, &lt;&lt;Ən sǝn ɓè muna-ɓwama mala amǝ'Filisti a Timna. Ən nggǝ earce nǝma wu alami ɓǝ̀ duk māmám.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 14:3" />Sǝ tárrí andǝ nggè banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Kǝ muna-ɓwama pà kàm atà amuna-mamǝna mala amǝ'eambo, ko aɓalǝ aɓwana ma'sǝm kat re, mǝnana nǝ̀ tsǝa sǝ awu nǝ nggá al ɓwama aɓalǝ amǝ'Filisti, yià amǝ ɗwanyi kasǝ-ɓatau ka?&gt;&gt; Sǝama Samsǝn ngga banggi tárrí ama, &lt;&lt;Alami, acemǝnana nda ɓwama mǝnana ǝn sǝni ɓoaram a mǝsǝàm ngga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 14:4" />(Tárrí andǝ nggè ka, à sǝlǝ ama Yahweh na mǝnana kǝ pàk mǝnia yì gìr ka ɗàng, acemǝnana Yahweh naban alta njar mala munǝo arǝ amǝ'Filisti. A bàkú mǝno ka, amǝ'Filisti na mǝnana à kǝ yálmúr amǝ Isǝrayila ka.)<verse eid="JDG 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 14:5" />Samsǝn wari a Timna atarǝia andǝ tárrí andǝ nggè. Pǝlǝa wari a ban aɓaban mala anggun-anap mala amǝ Timna, kara ɓè muna-im lo arkwar aban yiu arǝì. <verse eid="JDG 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 14:6" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 14:19">Akas 14:19</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 15:14">15:14</ref></char></note>Bangŋo mala Yahweh sulǝ amurí nǝ rǝcandǝa, sǝ kat andǝ amani ama pànǝ kǝ girbura a buì raka, bwal muna-imnì sàngi, kǝla mǝnana ɓwa nǝ̀ sàngi muna-mbul ka. Sǝama ne tárrí andǝ nggè gìr mǝnana pàk ka ɗàng.<verse eid="JDG 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 14:7" />Pǝlǝa wario kya nacau nǝ muna-ɓwame, sǝ ceɓoarî Samsǝn. <verse eid="JDG 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 14:8" />Anzǝm anonggio bǝti ka, Samsǝn nyare wario nǝ̀ nggá al muna-ɓwame. Amur njar ka, kyangye ace sǝn lú muna-im mana wal-luí ka; sǝ sǝni ka, mǝsǝnyi ramǝna arǝì mbǝl-mbǝl sǝ mur-nyi na kam aɓa lú imnì. <verse eid="JDG 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 14:9" />Samsǝn pǝlǝa ɗàrǝ́ mur-nyi a ɓabui, sǝ kǝ nui aban o. Lang yina aban tárrí andǝ nggè ka, pea wia aɓa mur-nyinî, sǝ à nu. Sǝama banggia wia ama ɗàrǝ́ mǝno yì mur-nyi ka aɓa lú imnì ɗang.<verse eid="JDG 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 14:10" />Pǝlǝa tárrí wari a Timna a ɓala mala muna-ɓwame. Samsǝn pàk girlina ace lìli-isǝban, kǝla mǝnana abura-māfela pàkkiyi ka. <verse eid="JDG 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 14:11" />Lang amǝ'Filisti sǝni Samsǝn panǝ aɓwana atè raka, pǝlǝa à yinǝ alaggana lumi-tàrú ace mǝnana ɓǝà pà kǝla aɓimǝdo ka. <verse eid="JDG 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 14:12" />Samsǝn banggia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ nǝ na wun ɓekǝ cauɓaɓe. Ɓǝ̀ wun nǝ̀ gandǝ súrǝ̀ mǝnia yì cauɓaɓe aɓa nongŋo tongno-nong-ɓari mala lìli-isǝban man, sǝ wun nǝ̀ banggam ɓālǝi ka, mǝ nǝ pà wun adaura linǝn lumi-tàrú andǝ anggea-daura lumi-tàrú. <verse eid="JDG 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 14:13" />Sǝama ɓǝ̀ wu gandǝnǝ nam raka, wun nǝ̀ pam adaura linǝn lumi-tàrú andǝ anggea-daura lumi-tàrú.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:13">Amǝ'Filisti ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Na sǝm cauɓaɓenî ɓǝ̀ sǝm oè.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 14:14" />Pǝlǝa nea wia ama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:14">&lt;&lt;Aɓa mǝligìr, girlina puro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 14:14">Aɓa mǝ'rǝcandǝa, gìr pǝlpǝl puro.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JDG 14:14">Nongŋo tàrú yi kutio, à gandǝnǝ na ɓá cauɓaɓe man ɗang.<verse eid="JDG 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 14:15" />A inea nongŋo ka, à banggi mālá Samsǝn ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓorikitakun burio ɓǝ̀ na sǝm ɓá cauɓaɓenî, ɓǝ̀ ana raka, sǝm nǝ̀ pisǝo wunǝ ɓala mala tárró. Wu tunǝ sǝm kani, ace mǝnana wun nǝ̀ tsǝk sǝm ɓǝ̀ sǝm pǝlǝ amǝ'tǝ̀r ka le?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 14:16" />Nda mālá Samsǝn ɓua a ɓadǝmbi, sǝ ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;A kǝ ɓinǝmǝsǝàm; a earcem ɗàng. A nongsǝì alaggana mala aɓwana mem cauɓaɓe, sǝ a nam ɓālǝi ɗàng.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:16">Samsǝn ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝni, nggearǝ tárrám andǝ nggem ngga, ǝn malaká nea wia ɗàng, sǝ palang sǝ a kǝ earce ama mǝ banggo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 14:17" />Mālá Samsǝn ɓua aɓadǝm Samsǝn aɓalǝ anongŋo tongno-nong-ɓari mala lìli-isǝban mǝnia ka, sǝ a tongno-nong-ɓaria pwari ka, Samsǝn ne wi ɓá cauɓaɓenî acemǝnana kùrrî mwacang ngga. Mālá Samsǝn pǝlǝa wario kya ne aɓwana male ɓá cauɓaɓenî.<verse eid="JDG 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 14:18" />A tongno-nong-ɓaria pwari, kaniama pwari nǝ̀ kpa ka, aburana mala nggea-lê ne Samsǝn ama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">Mana pàk-pǝlpǝl kútì mur-nyi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">Mana pàk-rǝcandǝa kútì im?</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JDG 14:18">Pǝlǝa Samsǝn nea wia ama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">Ɓǝ̀ wu rikma-rya nǝ mamǝna muna-ndǎ mem raka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 14:18">wun pà wun nǝ̀ súrǝ̀ ɓá cauɓaɓe mem ɗàng.<verse eid="JDG 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 14:19" />Bangŋo mala Yahweh sulǝ amúr Samsǝn nǝ rǝcandǝa, pǝlǝa wari a Ashkelon kya wal-lú aburana lumi-tàrú, swárki agir-nggūrǝu malea, sǝ pè aburana mana à na ɓá cauɓaɓe male ka. Bumilul kǝ̀rkǝ́r, sǝ nyare o a ɓala aban tárrí. <verse eid="JDG 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 14:20" />Nda à twal mālá Samsǝn à pè mwashat atà aɓimǝdo, mǝnana pàk murǝm-gyajam male. a ban lìli-isǝban ngga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 15:2">Akas 15:2</ref>,<ref loc="JDG 15:6">6</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="JDG 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JDG 15" />
  <para style="s">Mbweban-akúnì mala Samsǝn amur amǝ'Filisti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 15:1" />Anzǝm anonggio bǝti, a kúnì mala pwan-mǝssa alkama ka, Samsǝn warinǝ muna-mbul a buì nǝ̀ nggá sǝn māmí. Ne nkili-mǝɓwabure ama, &lt;&lt;Ən nggǝ earce mǝ nǝ kútí atà māmám aɓa kurǝm male.&gt;&gt; Sǝ nkili-mǝɓwabure ka eari wi ɓǝ̀ kùtí ɗang.<verse eid="JDG 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 15:2" />Nkili-mǝɓwabure ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ən twali nǝma a ɓǝsǝki, a ɓinǝmǝsǝi, nda ǝn twali ǝn pê murǝm-gyajam mô ka. Mǝ'kyauwa māmó ka ɓoarnsari kútì māmó re?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 14:20">Akas 14:20</ref></char>.</note> Ida, twali ɓǝ̀ duk māmó a kúnì.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 15:3" />Samsǝn bang ama, &lt;&lt;Man yalung ngga, mǝ nǝ duk mǝ'ɗwanyicau-arǝu, ɓǝ̀ ǝn pakki amǝ'Filisti gìr mǝɓane ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 15:4" />Nda Samsǝn wario kya bwal amǝ'nzǝgban gbǝman-tàrú, sǝ kurkia ɓari-ɓari arǝ anggilatea, sǝ ɗúrkia wia ɓukan, a tsùrú mala nggilatea mana kurkia ɓari-ɓari ka. <verse eid="JDG 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 15:5" />Pǝlǝa tsǝk bǝsa arǝ aɓukanì, sǝ nying amǝ'nzǝgbanî à kutiki aɓa mǝssa mǝnana nda ban came aɓalǝ aɓaban mala amǝ'Filisti ka. Sǝ kutio soa bǝsa, pisǝ akūno mǝssa mala amǝ'Filisti mǝnana à rambi ka, andǝ mǝssa mǝnana à malaká cani raka. Ɗǝm ngga pisǝ aɓaban-anap andǝ aɓaban mala anggun-olif malea. <verse eid="JDG 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 15:6" />Pǝlǝa amǝ'Filisti ɗiban ama, &lt;&lt;Yana ɓwê pàk mǝnia yì gìr ka?&gt;&gt; À banggia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Samsǝn, nkil ɓwa'Timna na. Samsǝn pàk mǝno acemǝnana nkili-mǝɓwabure twal māfela mala Samsǝn, sǝ pè murǝm-gyajam mala Samsǝn.&gt;&gt; Nda amǝ'Filisti wario à kya pisǝ ɓwame andǝ tárrí nǝ bǝsa ka. <verse eid="JDG 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 15:7" />Samsǝn nea wia ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ anggo sǝ wu kǝ pak ka, ǝn kána mǝ nǝ mbwe wun akúnì, anzǝm mǝno ka, sǝ mǝ nǝ came.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 15:8" />Nda wal-luia pas, sǝn mǝsǝswatǝr pà kàm ɗàng, nǝ kaɓa walban. Pǝlǝa wario kya do aɓa sà-tali mala Etam.<verse eid="JDG 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 15:9" />Pǝlǝa amǝ'lwa mala amǝ'Filisti yiu nǝ rǝcandǝa mala lwa aɓa bù-nzali Yahuda, à bwal-kàttì anzǝm la mǝnana à tunǝi ama Lehi ka, sǝ à warinǝ munǝo arǝì. <verse eid="JDG 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 15:10" />Aburana mala tàu mala Yahuda ɗia ama, &lt;&lt;Palang sǝ wu yiua munǝo arǝ sǝm?&gt;&gt; Amǝ'Filisti earia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝm yiu ace bwal Samsǝn, ace mǝnana sǝm nǝ̀ pàkki wi kǝla mǝnana pàkka sǝm ngga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 15:11" />Aburana á-tàrú (3,000) mala Yahuda wari a sà-tali mala Etam, sǝ à ne Samsǝn ama, &lt;&lt;A sǝlǝ mbak ama amǝ'Filisti na à yálkiyimúr sǝm ngga? Palang sǝ a pàkka sǝm mǝnia yì gìr ka?&gt;&gt; Samsǝn pǝlǝa earia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Kǝ gìr mǝnana à pàkkam ngga, nda gbal ǝn pàkkia wia ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 15:12" />À banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝm yiu a kùrro, sǝm nǝ̀ túrrǒ a ɓabù amǝ'Filisti.&gt;&gt; Samsǝn bang ama, &lt;&lt;Wu kánbàm ama pà wun nǝ̀ wal-luem nǝnggearǝ wun ɗàng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 15:13" />À banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Awo, kǝ kùrban na nǝmurǝi sǝm nǝ̀ kùrro, sǝ sǝm nǝ̀ túrrǒ a ɓabuia ka.&gt;&gt; Nda à kùrrì nǝ aɓǝsa anggur ɓari, sǝ à pur nǝi aɓa tali mǝno ka, à umnǝi.<verse eid="JDG 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 15:14" />Lang Samsǝn yi bingŋǝna Lehi ka, amǝ'Filisti lo aban yiu a baní nǝ gāwàn. Sǝ Bangŋo mala Yahweh sulǝ amurí nǝ rǝcandǝa. Anggur mana à kùrkina agarabui nǝia ka, à pǝlǝ kǝla záng mana à pisǝì a bǝsa ka, à panzǝkya à nying abui. <verse eid="JDG 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 15:15" />Kum mu-garakún mǝdambǝriso mǝnana malaká ìm raka, pǝlǝa lǝmdǝ buì twali sǝ wal-lú aburana á-mwashat nǝi. <verse eid="JDG 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 15:16" />Samsǝn pǝlǝa bang ama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 15:16">&lt;&lt;Nǝ́ mu-garakún mǝdambǝriso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 15:16">ǝn ramgia amur rǝarǝia gum-gum.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 15:16">Nǝ́ mu-garakún mǝdambǝriso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 15:16">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">15:16 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LEV 26:8">Pǝris 26:8</ref>
      </char>.</note>ǝn wal-lú aburana á-mwashat.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 15:17" />Lang malna nacau ka, pǝlǝa nyesǝ mu-garakún mǝdambǝrisonî mǝnana a buì ka túrí, sǝ tsǝkî banì lullǝu ama Ramat Lehi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ramat Lehi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ka ɓālǝi nda &lt;&lt;mgbang-ban mala mu-garakún.&gt;&gt;</char></note><verse eid="JDG 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 15:18" />Mǝsamùr wali kǝ̀rkǝ́r, nda ɓua aban Yahweh ama, &lt;&lt;A pana mǝnia yì kaɓa amsǝban ngga nǝ bu guro mò. Sǝ adyan ngga, mǝ nǝ wù nǝ mǝsamùr, mǝ nǝ kpa a ɓabù amǝ'Filisti, amǝ ɗwanyi kasǝ-ɓatau le?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 15:19" />Pǝlǝa Ɓakuli mǝn ɓè tūliban a nzali a Lehi, sǝ mùr pur kàm aɓalǝi. Lang nuna ka, kara nyare kum bǝsa rǝcandǝa, sǝ yilǝmi nyar arǝì. Ace mǝno ka, Samsǝn tsǝkî tūli-mùrnî lullǝu ama En Hakkore.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">En Hakkore</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ka ɓālǝi nda &lt;&lt;tūli-mùr mala ɓwa mǝnana ɓua ka.&gt;&gt;</char></note> Mǝno yì tūli-mùr ka, ndakam a Lehi bà yalung.<verse eid="JDG 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 15:20" />Samsǝn duk kasǝla amúr amǝ Isǝrayila ba apǝlǝa lumi-ɓari, a bàkú mǝnana amǝ'Filisti kǝ yálmúr amǝ Isǝrayila ka.<verse eid="JDG 15:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JDG 16" />
  <para style="s">Samsǝn andǝ Delila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 16:1" />Samsǝn wari a Gaza, sǝ kya sǝn ɓè mā-gung abanì, pǝlǝa kútí a baní. <verse eid="JDG 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 16:2" />Cau mesǝ aban amǝ Gaza ama, &lt;&lt;Samsǝn yina kani!&gt;&gt; Nda à kàrì banì, sǝ à kùmsǝi wi, à nǝ̀ kundǝi aɓa dù kat, a kún nggea-là. Sǝama nǝ du ka à nea rǝia ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ sǝm ɗeki sheɓǝ̀ bankwarna nǝ dǝmbari ka; pǝlǝa sǝm nǝ̀ wal-lui.&gt;&gt; Nda à duk ɗǝong aɓa dù kat. <verse eid="JDG 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 16:3" />Sǝ Samsǝn ngga nongŋo ba gakkya mala ɓadu. Sǝ lang ɓadu gakkina ka, pǝlǝa lo sǝ kya gbami agirkún bankutio mala nggea-lê, atarǝia andǝ anggunkúni ɓari, sǝ uia, kat andǝ nggun-gangndea mala múr bankutionì andǝ koman kat, sǝ imsǝia a kwàrì, pǝlǝa umnǝia a ɓong mgbang-ban mana a dǝm Hebǝron ngga.<verse eid="JDG 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 16:4" />Anzǝm mǝno ka, Samsǝn yi earce ɓè ɓwama a Ɓangŋaban Sorek. Lullǝ ɓwame ama Delila. <verse eid="JDG 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 16:5" />Aɓwana-mǝgule mala amǝ'Filisti wari aban Delila sǝ à ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Swárí ɓǝ̀ lǝmdǝo ban mǝnana kaɓa rǝcandǝa male pàk kàm ngga, sǝ lang sǝ sǝm nǝ̀ gandǝì, ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ sǝm kùrrì, sǝ sǝm nǝ̀ ɓunni ka; sǝ koyana atà sǝm ngga nǝ̀ po mǝsǝ bolo-azǝrfa á-mwashat nǝ gbǝman-mwashat [1,100.]&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 16:6" />Nda Delila ne Samsǝn ama, &lt;&lt;Ida, banggam ban mǝnana kaɓa rǝcandǝa mò pàk kàm, sǝ lang sǝ ɓwa nǝ̀ gandǝ kurkio ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ ɓùn rǝcandǝa mô ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 16:7" />Samsǝn ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ ɓwa kùrram nǝ bǝsa amazo tongno-nong-ɓari mǝnana à malaká ìm raka, mǝ nǝ yauwiki, mǝ nǝ pa kǝla koya ɓwa ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 16:8" />Pǝlǝa aɓwana-mǝgule mala amǝ'Filisti yinǝì Delila bǝsa amazo tongno-nong-ɓari, mǝnana à malaká ìm raka, sǝ kùrki Samsǝn nǝia. <verse eid="JDG 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 16:9" />Delila ka angŋa-dǝmba yinanǝ aɓea aburana à ndaban kùmsǝó aɓa ɓè kurǝm-ɓaɓalǝu. Pǝlǝa Delila loasǝ gì na ama, &lt;&lt;Samsǝn! Amǝ'Filisti na amuro!&gt;&gt; Samsǝn kasǝki amazo mǝno kǝla kasǝa mala nkonggúr lang bǝsa je ka. Acemani ka, fe mala rǝcandǝa male ka à súrǝì ɗàng.<verse eid="JDG 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 16:10" />Pǝlǝa Delila ne Samsǝn ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝni, a swarkiam sǝ a nam nyir. Ida, nam lang sǝ ɓwa nǝ̀ gandǝ kùrro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 16:11" />Samsǝn banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ ɓwa kùrram nǝ bǝsa anggur mana à malaká pàktúró nǝia raka, mǝ nǝ yauwiki, mǝ nǝ pa kǝla koya ɓwa ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 16:12" />Aburana mǝno yina à ndaban kùmsǝó aɓa kurǝm-ɓaɓalǝu. Pǝlǝa Delila twal bǝsa anggur, kùrki Samsǝn nǝia, sǝ loasǝ gì na ama, &lt;&lt;Samsǝn! Amǝ'Filisti na amuro!&gt;&gt; Sǝ Samsǝn kara kasǝki anggur mana à kùrki nǝia arǝ agarabui ka kǝla mǝsǝ'nkonggúr.<verse eid="JDG 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 16:13" />Pǝlǝa Delila ne Samsǝn ama, &lt;&lt;Bà adyan a camarǝ swarkiam, andǝ nam nyir. Banggam lang sǝ ɓwa nǝ̀ gandǝ kùrro.&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa Samsǝn banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ a tâ nyang-muram mǝnana à bwalki arǝ abanì tongno-nong-ɓari aɓalǝarǝia andǝ nkonggúr-tàgìr mana nda arǝ nggun-tà'nggubyau, sǝ a kifi nǝ gara-tàgìr ka, mǝ nǝ yauwiki, mǝ nǝ pa kǝla koya ɓwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 16:14" />Sǝ lang Samsǝn na a ntulo ka, Delila tà nyang-múr Samsǝn mǝnana à bwalki arǝ abanì tongno-nong-ɓari ka aɓalǝarǝia andǝ nkonggúr-tàgìr mana nda arǝ nggun-tà'nggubyau ka, sǝ kifi nǝ gara-tàgìr. Pǝlǝa loasǝ gì na ama, &lt;&lt;Samsǝn! Amǝ'Filisti na amuro!&gt;&gt; Sǝ Samsǝn loapi ntulo, gwachi nyang-múrí arǝ gara-tàgìr, andǝ nggun-tà'nggubyau, andǝ nkonggúr-tàgìr.<verse eid="JDG 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 16:15" />Pǝlǝa Delila ne Samsǝn ama, &lt;&lt;Lang sǝ awu nǝ na ama, &lt;Ən nggǝ earceo,&gt; sǝ ɓabumo pà arǝàm ɗàng? A ɓangginanǝ mim kusǝ tàrú ado, sǝ a nam ban mǝnana kaɓa rǝcandǝa mò pàk kàm ngga ɗàng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 16:16" />Delila camarǝ pisǝta Samsǝn tùtù koya pwari nǝ acau male andǝ ɓuakiarǝu, gandǝa lulbum Samsǝn kǝla nǝ wǔ.<verse eid="JDG 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 16:17" />A masǝlǝate ka, Samsǝn ne wi ɓabumi kat. Banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Twal a pwari mǝnana à ɓǝlam ngga, nkembu je muram a kǝ pwari ɗàng, acemǝnana mǝ nda ɓwa-nazir<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ɓwa-nazir </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko &lt;&lt;ɓwa mǝnana à tàrrì aban Ɓakuli ka.&gt;&gt;</char></note> aban Ɓakuli twal a bum nggem. Ɓǝ̀ ɓwa mwa nyang ɓamuram ngga, rǝcandǝa mem nǝ̀ nyem, sǝ mǝ nǝ yauwiki, mǝ nǝ pa kǝla koya ɓwa ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 16:18" />Lang Delila sǝni ama Samsǝn nani wi ɓabumi kat ka, túrban ɓǝà tunǝ aɓwana-mǝgule mala amǝ'Filisti, nǝ cau ama, &lt;&lt;Wu yiu ɗǝm, acemǝnana bangŋǝnam ɓabumi kat.&gt;&gt; Nda aɓwana-mǝgule mala amǝ'Filisti yiu abani nǝ boalo a buia. <verse eid="JDG 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 16:19" />Delila pǝlǝa tsǝk Samsǝn koa ntulo a byali, sǝ tunǝ ɓè ɓwabura yi mwa nyang-múr Samsǝn mǝnana à bwalki wi arǝ abanì tongno-nong-ɓari ka. Anggo sǝ Delila tita kyauwiki Samsǝn, sǝ rǝcandǝa male nying rǝì. <verse eid="JDG 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 16:20" />Pǝlǝa loasǝ gì na ama, &lt;&lt;Samsǝn! Amǝ'Filisti na amuro!&gt;&gt; Sǝ Samsǝn loapi ntulo male, ne ɓamurǝi ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ nǝ puro kǝla mǝnana ǝn pakkiyi ɗiɗyal ka, sǝ mǝ nǝ dǝurǝ rǝàm ace panzǝ ɓamuràm.&gt;&gt; Sǝ yi ka sǝlǝ ama Yahweh nyingŋǝni ɗàng. <verse eid="JDG 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 16:21" />Amǝ'Filisti gbami, sǝ à ukki amǝsǝi à pusǝkia. À yinǝi a Gaza, sǝ à kùrri nǝ ansolo bolo-bángŋá. À tsǝi pǝlǝ mǝgogô a ndàkurban. <verse eid="JDG 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 16:22" />Sǝama nyang-múrí tita to ɗǝm anzǝm mana à mwani ka.<verse eid="JDG 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lú andǝ tsǝkban mala Samsǝn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 16:23" />Aɓwana-mǝgule mala amǝ'Filisti ramba abanɓwáná ace pa gìr'nkila mǝgule aban <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli amurí aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 10:10">1Acau 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 5:1-7">1Sam 5:1-7</ref></char>.</note>Dagon, ɓakuli malea, sǝ ace pàkkiɗire. À na ama, &lt;&lt;ɓakuli ma'sǝm pàna Samsǝn ɓisǝm mǝbura a ɓabù sǝm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 16:24" />Lang aɓwe sǝn Samsǝn ngga, à ɓwangsǝ ɓakuli malea. À kǝ na ama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 16:24">&lt;&lt;ɓakuli ma'sǝm pàna ɓisǝm mǝbura</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 16:24">a ɓabù sǝm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 16:24">yì ɓwa mana kiɗiki nzali ma'sǝm sǝ wal-lú sǝm pas ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 16:25" />Lang à nda aɓa banɓoarnado ka, à bang ama, &lt;&lt;Wu yinǝa sǝm nǝ Samsǝn ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ yi pakgìr ace pa sǝm oalo ka.&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa à pusǝ Samsǝn a ndàkurban, sǝ pàkkia wia gìr pà oalo. À tamsǝì a nre ka anggun-gbasha. <verse eid="JDG 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 16:26" />Samsǝn ne mǝlagga mǝnana bwalkiyi wi gara ka ama, &lt;&lt;Kyan nǝ mim a ban mǝnana mǝ nǝ gandǝ je anggun-gbasha mana à tamsǝ ndàmǝgule man ngga, ace mǝnana mǝ eangnǝ arǝia ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 16:27" />Ndàmǝgule mǝno lumsǝ nǝ aburana andǝ amamǝna, andǝ aɓwana-mǝgule mala amǝ'Filisti. Sǝ a múr-kurǝm ngga aburana andǝ amamǝna nakam á-tàrú aban sǝn Samsǝn kǝ pàk gìr pà'oalo. <verse eid="JDG 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 16:28" />Pǝlǝa Samsǝn pakhiwi aban Yahweh ama, &lt;&lt;We Mǝtalem, Yahweh, ida ɗenyinǝ mim! Ida, pam rǝcandǝa ɗǝm kusǝ mwashat ɓǝ̀rɓǝ̀r, We Ɓakuli, ace mǝnana mǝ mbweka amǝ'Filisti akúnì amǝsǝam ɓari mǝnana à pusǝkia ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 16:29" />Pǝlǝa Samsǝn tsǝk abui arǝ anggun-gbasha ɓari mǝnana a tsùrú, mana à tamsǝ ndàmǝgulenì ka, sǝ eangnǝ arǝia nǝ buì-mǝlì arǝ man mwashat ka, sǝ buì-mǝ'nggare arǝ ɓè. <verse eid="JDG 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 16:30" />Sǝ Samsǝn bang ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀n wú sǝnǝ amǝ'Filisti!&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa mǝn rǝì [ramta anggun-gbasha] nǝ rǝcandǝa male kat, kara ndàmǝgulenì bǝbbǝriki amúr aɓwana-mǝgule sǝ amur aɓwe kat mǝnana aɓalǝi ka. Aɓwana mana Samsǝn wal-luia a lú male ka, à kútì mana wal-luia a do-yilǝmu male ka.<verse eid="JDG 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 16:31" />Amǝ'eam Samsǝn andǝ aɓǝla male yi twal luí, à umnǝi à kya tsǝì anre <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 13:25">Akas 13:25</ref></char>.</note>Zora andǝ Eshtawol, a ɓembe-ɓa-tali mala tárrí Manuwa. Samsǝn duk kasǝla amúr amǝ Isǝrayila mala apǝlǝa lumi-ɓari.<verse eid="JDG 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JDG 17" />
  <para style="s">Mika pàk ankúl sǝ twal pǝris</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 17:1" />Ɓè ɓwabura nakam, ɓwa nzali múr-ankono mala Ifǝrem na, lùllǝì ama Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 17:2" />Banggi nggè ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝsǝ bolo-azǝrfa á-mwashat-nǝ-gbǝman-mwashat (1,100) mana à twalì arǝò, mǝnana ǝn oeo a sú ɓwa mana iu mǝsǝ boale ka, sǝni, mǝsǝ bolo-azǝrfe ka nda a buam; mǝ nda ǝn twali ka.&gt;&gt; Sǝ nggè ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ Yahweh tsǝko bù, munem!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 17:3" />Pǝlǝa nyesǝî nggè mǝsǝ bolo-azǝrfa á-mwashat-nǝ-gbǝman-mwashat mǝno. Sǝ nggè bang ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ ndya ǝn nggǝ tàr mǝnia yì mǝsǝ bolo-azǝrfa ka nǝ buam aban Yahweh ace munem, ace pàk <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:4">Pur 20:4</ref></char>.</note> nkúl mǝnana à shàrrì andǝ <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:4">Pǝris 19:4</ref></char>.</note> ɓǝ̀nzál mana à ɓè nǝ bolo-azǝrfa ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 17:4" />Lang nyesǝni nggè mǝsǝ bolo-azǝrfa ka, pǝlǝa nggè twal mǝsǝ bolo-azǝrfa gbǝman-ɓari (200), sǝ pè mǝ'ntùl. Sǝ mǝ'ntùl pàktúró nǝ mǝsǝ bolo-azǝrfa man sǝ pàk ɓǝ̀nzál mǝnana à shàrrì, andǝ ɓǝ̀nzál mala bolo-ntùl. Pǝlǝa à tsǝì a ɓala mala Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 17:5" />Ɓwabura man, yì Mika ka ndanǝ ndà-ankúl. Pàk <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 8:14">Akas 8:14</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 17">17</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 28:6-35">Pur 28:6-35</ref></char>.</note>efot andǝ ankúl ace amǝɓala, sǝ tàr mwashat atà amuna-burana male ɓǝ̀ duk pǝris male. <verse eid="JDG 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 17:6" />A bàkú mǝno ka, amǝ'Isǝrayila pànǝ murǝm ɗàng. Koyana le ka pàk gìr mǝnana ɓoari wi a mǝsǝi ka.<verse eid="JDG 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 17:7" />Ɓè lagga nakam mǝnana ndanǝdo a Betalami, a bu-nzali Yahuda ka. Yì ka, ɓwa'Lawi na sǝ yi do kǝla bǝri aɓalǝ amǝ'tàu mala Yahuda. <verse eid="JDG 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 17:8" />Mǝnia yì ɓwabura ka, nying Betalami a bu-nzali Yahuda, sǝ o ace alta ɓè ban mana nǝ̀ duk kam ngga. Aɓa gya male ka, yiu a nzali múr-ankono mala Ifǝrem, a ɓala mala Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 17:9" />Mika ɗì ama, &lt;&lt;A pùr nǝ kǝshe?&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ nda ɓwa'Lawi, sǝ ǝn pùr a Betalami a bu-nzali Yahuda. Mǝ nda aban alta ban mǝnana mǝ nǝ duk kam ngga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 17:10" />Mika ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Do atàm. Duk tárrû andǝ pǝris abanam. Mǝ nǝ nggǝ mbweo mǝsǝ bolo-azǝrfa lum koya pǝlǝa ka, andǝ agir-nggūrǝu sǝ girlina.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 17:11" />Nda ɓwa'Lawi man eare do atà Mika, sǝ yì laggè ka pǝlǝì Mika kǝla mwashat atà amuna-burana male. <verse eid="JDG 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 17:12" />Pǝlǝa Mika kùrî ɓwa'Lawi man pǝris, sǝ yì laggè ka pǝlǝ pǝris male, sǝ do a ɓala mala Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 17:13" />Sǝ Mika bang ama, &lt;&lt;Adyan ngga, ǝn sǝlǝna ama Yahweh nǝ̀ pàkkam mǝɓoarne, atàcau mala ɓwa'Lawi mǝnia mǝnana duk pǝris mem ngga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JDG 18" />
  <para style="s">Amǝ'tàu mala Dan alta nzali liɓala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 18:1" />A bàkú mǝno ka, amǝ'Isǝrayila pànǝ murǝm ɗàng. Sǝ a kǝ bákuì ka, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 1:34">Akas 1:34</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 19:47-48">Jes 19:47-48</ref></char>.</note>amǝ'tàu mala Dan naban alta nzali liɓala mǝnana à nǝ̀ duk kam ngga, acemǝnana yi pur a bàkú mǝno ka, à malaká kum nzali liɓala malea aɓalǝ atau mala amǝ'Isǝrayila ɗàng. <verse eid="JDG 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 18:2" />Nda amǝ'tàu mala Dan tàrki akanggǝrang aburana tongno, aɓa tàu malea puppup a Zora andǝ Eshtawol, sǝ à tasǝia ace shenzǝ nzali mǝnana à nǝ̀ duk kam ngga, ɓǝà gya aɓalǝi ace súrǝè pepè. À banggi aburane ama, &lt;&lt;Wu kyane, wu gya aɓa nzali pacauni wu pelǝki pepè.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 18:2">Sǝ à yiu a nzali múr-ankono mala Ifǝrem, a ɓala mala Mika, sǝ à sulǝ kam. <verse eid="JDG 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 18:3" />Lang à yi bik ban ɓala mala Mika ka, à súrǝ̀ gi mǝlagga ɓwa'Lawi mǝno. Nda à wari abani sǝ à ɗì ama, &lt;&lt;Yana yinǝ we kani? Mana a pakkiyi a ban mǝnia? Mana yinǝ we kani?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 18:4" />Pǝlǝa banggia wia gìr mǝnana Mika pàkki wi ka, ama, &lt;&lt;Mika twalama-túró, sǝ ǝn duk pǝris male.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 17:10">Akas 17:10</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="JDG 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 18:5" />Pǝlǝa à ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ida, ɗìbancau aban Ɓakuli, ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ sǝm sǝlǝa ko gya ma'sǝm mǝnia ka, sǝm nǝ̀ kum puro aɓalǝi ko pà sǝm nǝ̀ kum ɗang.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 18:6" />Pǝris banggia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Wu kyane aɓa rǝpwala. Yahweh na atà wun aɓa gya ma'wun mǝnia.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 18:7" />Pǝlǝa aburana man tongno ka à lo, sǝ à yiu a Layish. À sǝn aɓwana mǝnana à ndanǝdo kano ka, à nda aɓa do-jam kǝla do mala amǝ'Sidon, aɓa rǝpwala andǝ ɗwanyi-tsǝk'mǝsǝu; yià ɗǝm ngga amǝ'kume na acemǝnana à ɗwanyi kǝgìr aɓa nzali malea ɗàng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">yià ɗǝm ngga amǝ'kume na acemǝnana à ɗwanyi kǝgìr aɓa nzali malea ɗàng </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko &lt;&lt;à pà aɓata kǝɓwa mana limurǝm-nǝ-lwa ko duk-murǝm amúrià sǝ kǝ paria aɓa kyauwikiban nǝ rǝcandǝa ka ɗàng.&gt;&gt;</char></note> À nda kuko nǝ amǝ'Sidon, sǝ à pà aɓa kpapimúrû andǝ ɓekǝ nzali ace kum gbasha ɗàng.<verse eid="JDG 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 18:8" />Sǝ lang aburana man nyarna aban amǝ'eambia, a Zora andǝ Eshtawol ka, amǝ'eambia ɗia ama, &lt;&lt;Mana nda kún-bǝri ma'wun?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 18:9" />À banggia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Wu lo, ɓǝ̀ sǝm kya arǝia nǝ munǝo, acemǝnana sǝm pelǝna ɓá nzalinì, sǝ sǝm sǝni ka, ndanǝ ɓoaro kǝ̀rkǝ́r. Sǝ pà wun nǝ̀ pàk kǝgir re? Wu kǝa dǝndi arǝ ká ak nzalinì ɓǝ̀ pǝlǝ ma'wun ɗàng. <verse eid="JDG 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 18:10" />Lang wu bingŋǝna nzalinì ka, wun nǝ̀ kum aɓwana mana à nda ɓá do ɗwanyi-tsǝk'mǝsǝu; andǝ nzali mǝtangŋe mǝnana Ɓakuli pana wuni a ɓabù wun ngga; nzali mǝnana ɗwanyi kǝgir mana nda a ɓanza ka ɗàng!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 18:11" />Aburana gbǝman-tongno-nong-mwashat a tàu mala Dan kùr rǝia nǝ agirbura mala lwa, sǝ à pur a Zora andǝ Eshtawol. <verse eid="JDG 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 18:12" />Pǝlǝa à eauwe à kya tsǝk kàttì malea a Kiriat-Jarim a bu-nzali Yahuda. Nda gìr mǝnana tsǝa sǝ ban mǝno a njar-nzali mala Kiriat-Jarim ngga, à tunǝi ama Mahane Dan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mahane Dan </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ngga nda &lt;&lt;Kàttì mala Dan.&gt;&gt;</char></note> bà yalung ngga. <verse eid="JDG 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 18:13" />À lo kano ka, à gya aɓa nzali múr-ankono mala Ifǝrem, sǝ à yiu a ɓala mala Mika.<verse eid="JDG 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 18:14" />Pǝlǝa aburana tongno mana à wari a shenzǝ nzali Layish ka, à banggi amǝ'eambǝia ama, &lt;&lt;Wu sǝlǝ ama atà <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 17:4">Akas 17:4</ref>,<ref loc="JDG 17:5">5</ref></char>.</note>aɓala mǝnia ka, efot, andǝ ankúl ace ɓala, andǝ ɓǝ̀nzál mǝnana à shàrrì, andǝ ɓǝ̀nzál mala bolo-ntul ka à ndakam? Wu ɓalkiɓabum wun amúr mana ɓoaro ɓǝ̀ wu pa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 18:15" />Pǝlǝa à kàr kano, sǝ à wari a bando mala mǝlagga ɓwa'Lawi mǝno a ɓala mala Mika ka, sǝ à makki-wi-kûn. <verse eid="JDG 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 18:16" />Aɓa mǝno anggo ka, aburana mala amǝ'tàu mala Dan mǝno à kùrna rǝia nǝ agirbura ace lwa ka, à cam a bankutio a kúnɓala. <verse eid="JDG 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 18:17" />Pǝlǝa aburana tongno mǝnana à yina atadǝmbe à shenzǝna nzalinì ka, à wario sǝ à kutio sǝ à twal ɓǝ̀nzál mǝnana à shàrrì ka, andǝ efot, andǝ ankúl mala ɓala, andǝ ɓǝ̀nzál mala bolo-ntul, sǝ pǝris ka ndaban came a bankutio a kúnɓala atà aburana gbǝman-tongno-nong-mwashat mana à kùrna rǝia nǝ agirbura ace lwa ka. <verse eid="JDG 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 18:18" />Lang aburana man kútí a ɓala mala Mika sǝ à twal ɓǝ̀nzál mǝnana à shàrrì, andǝ efot, andǝ ankúl mala ɓala, andǝ ɓǝ̀nzál mala bolo-ntul ka, pǝris ɗia ama, &lt;&lt;Mana mǝna wu pàkkiyi ka?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 18:19" />À earî wi ama, &lt;&lt;Duk kúnó piu! Kǝa na kǝ cau ɗàng. We ka, yiu atà sǝm, sǝ wu duk tárrû andǝ pǝris amur sǝm. Pà nǝ̀ ɓoaribani wu duk pǝris amur ɓè nggurkwar, andǝ pǝris amur ɓè tàu mala Isǝrayila puppup, amúr-mana wu duk pǝris amúr ɓala mala ɓwa mwashat ka re?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 18:20" />Kara banɓoari pǝris mǝno. Nda twal ɓǝ̀nzál mǝnana à shàrrì, andǝ efot, andǝ ankúl mala ɓala, andǝ ɓǝ̀nzál mala bolo-ntul, sǝ o ateà.<verse eid="JDG 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 18:21" />Pǝlǝa à wulio, sǝ à bwal njar aban o, sǝama à tsǝk amuna-mǝkeke, andǝ agirkusǝu, andǝ agirkuma malea a dǝmba sǝ à kǝ gya anzǝmia. <verse eid="JDG 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 18:22" />Lang à umǝna ɗār nǝ ɓala mala Mika ka, amǝ'murkala mala Mika ramba abanɓwáná, sǝ à o pǝrta aɓwana mala Dan. <verse eid="JDG 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 18:23" />Lang à loasǝ gia à tunǝia ka, aɓwana mala Dan pǝlǝ ɓamǝsǝia sǝ à ɗì Mika ama, &lt;&lt;Marǝò sǝ wu ram rǝ wun anggo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 18:24" />Mika earia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Wu twalna aɓakuli mem mǝnana ǝn pea ka, andǝ pǝris, sǝ wu umǝna nǝia. Mana uekàm ɗǝm? Palang sǝ wun nǝ̀ ɗiem ama, &lt;Marǝò?&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 18:25" />Aɓwana mala Dan banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Kǝa eare ɓǝà ok gio aɓalǝ sǝm ɗàng, ɓǝ̀ ana raka, aɓea aburana mǝ'lulle aɓalǝ sǝm nǝ̀ kpa amuro, sǝ awu nǝ ɗwanyi yilǝmo andǝ ayilǝmi amǝ'ɓala mò.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 18:26" />Pǝlǝa aɓwana mala Dan ukia'o malea. Sǝ lang Mika sǝni ama à kútì nǝ rǝcandǝa ka, kara nyare o a ɓala male.<verse eid="JDG 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 18:27" />Aɓwana mala Dan twal agir mǝnana Mika pea ka, andǝ pǝris male, sǝ à yiu a Layish, aban aɓwana mana à nda ɓá do rǝpwala andǝ ɗwanyi-tsǝk'mǝsǝu ka. À wal-luia nǝ kún nggeabyau, sǝ à soaki nggea-lê bǝsa. <verse eid="JDG 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 18:28" />Sǝ kǝɓwa yiu ace amsǝia ɗàng, acemǝnana nggea-lê ka nda kuko nǝ Sidon, sǝ ɗǝm ngga, à pà aɓa kpapimúrû andǝ ɓekǝ nzali ace kum gbasha ɗang. Nggea-lê ka, nda aɓa ɓangŋaban mala Bet-Rehop. Pǝlǝa aɓwana mala Dan ɓǝsǝlǝ-ɓak nggea-lê, sǝ à duk kam. <verse eid="JDG 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 18:29" />À tsǝkî nggea-lê lullǝu ama Dan, mǝnana nda lullǝu keâ, yì Dan mana à ɓǝlî Isǝrayila ka; sǝama ɗiɗyal ka, lullǝu nggea-lê nda Layish. <verse eid="JDG 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 18:30" />Sǝ tàu mala Dan tamsǝî ɓamuria mǝno yì ɓǝ̀nzál mana à shàrrì ka; sǝ Jonatan, muna-ɓwabura mala Gashom, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 2:22">Pur 2:22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 18:3">18:3</ref></char>.</note>muna-ɓwabura mala <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Musa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko Manasa</char></note>Musa andǝ amǝ'ke ka, à nda ka apǝris mala tàu mala Dan bà bàkú mala bwalban-aguro andǝ umnǝia a bǝri-nzali. <verse eid="JDG 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 18:31" />Nda tàu mala Dan tamsǝî ɓamuria ɓǝ̀nzál mala Mika mana à shàrrì, mǝnana pè ka, sǝ uekam arǝ abákú mǝnana kat Taragula mala Ɓakuli nakam a Shilo ka.<verse eid="JDG 18:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JDG 19" />
  <para style="s">Ɓwa'Lawi andǝ mā-twala male</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 19:1" />A bàkú mǝnana murǝm pà kàm a Isǝrayila raka,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 17:6">Akas 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 18:1">18:1</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 21:25">21:25</ref></char>.</note> ɓè ɓwa'Lawi nakam mǝnana ndanǝdo kuko a nkanggariban mala nzali múr-ankono mala Ifǝrem ngga. Yì ka twalî ɓamurì mā-twala a Betalami, a bu-nzali Yahuda. <verse eid="JDG 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 19:2" />Sǝ mā-twala mǝnia ka bumi-lullo arǝ burí, pǝlǝa ɗeki, o a ɓala mala tárrí a Betalami, a bu-nzali Yahuda. Lang pàngŋǝ́nà azongŋo ine a ɓala mala tárrí ka, <verse eid="JDG 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 19:3" />pǝlǝa burí lo wari ace bǝ́lè; nǝ̀ nggá bangcau nǝi, nǝ tsǝkɓalǝu ama nǝ̀ nun ɓabumi nǝ̀ nyesǝi. Wari andǝ guro male atè andǝ amǝdambǝriso ɓari. Lang bingŋǝ́nà ka, mā-twala male kútí nǝi a ɓala mala tárrí, sǝ lang nkili sǝni ka, gingsǝi nǝ banɓoarnado. <verse eid="JDG 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 19:4" />Sǝ nkili, yì tár mā-twala male ka, tsǝì duk kano, sǝ ue kano atè anonggio tàrú. Aɓalǝ anonggio mǝno ka, à lǐ, à nǔ, sǝ nong kano atè.<verse eid="JDG 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 19:5" />A inea nongŋo ka, à lo nǝ dǝmbari nǝ ban'mbul-mbul, sǝ ɓwa'Lawi gilǝrǝi nǝ̀ o. Sǝama nkili ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Kundǝ bǝti, wu lî girlina ace mǝnana wu kum rǝcandǝa ka, sǝ wu o.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 19:6" />Nda à do yià kǝm, sǝ à lì girlina sǝ à nǔ atārǝia; pǝlǝa tár muna-ɓwame banggi ɓwabure, yì ɓwa'Lawi ama, &lt;&lt;Ida, eare nong ɗǝm, sǝ ɓǝ̀ banɓoaro.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 19:7" />Sǝ lang ɓwabure, yì ɓwa'Lawi lo nǝ̀ u ka, nkili ɓuakiarǝi gandǝa nong ɗǝm. <verse eid="JDG 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 19:8" />A tongnoia pwari, lo nǝ dǝmbari ɗiɗyal ace mǝnana nǝ̀ o, sǝ nkili ka ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ida, kúndǝô wu lî girlina ace kum rǝcandǝa, sheɓǝ̀ rǝ pwari wuna ka!&gt;&gt; Nda à lìli yià kǝm ngga. <verse eid="JDG 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 19:9" />Sǝ lang ɓwabure andǝ mā-twala male andǝ guro male longŋǝ́nà à nǝ̀ u ka, nkili, yì tár muna-ɓwame banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝni! Pwari malanǝ̀ kpa! Ida, nongŋo. Ado mǝnana pwari wulina ka, nong kani sǝ ɓǝ̀ ɓabumo kum banɓoarnado. Lí ka, awu nǝ lo nǝ dǝmbari ɗiɗyal ace gya mô, sǝ wu oa là.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 19:10" />Sǝama ɓwabure ka, ear ama nǝ̀ nong ɗǝm ɗàng. Nda tsǝk agir-do a nzǝm amǝdambǝriso male ɓari. Sǝ yì andǝ mā-twala male andǝ guro male à bwal-njar, sǝ à gya à yi bik <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOS 15:8">Jes 15:8</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 15:63">15:63</ref></char>.</note>Jebus (mǝnana yalung à tunǝi ama Urǝshalima ka).<verse eid="JDG 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 19:11" />Lang à gbàshìban Jebus ka, pwari umǝna ɗār. Sǝ guro ne mǝtala-ɓala male ama, &lt;&lt;Ida, ɓǝ̀ sǝm kàr a nggea-là mala amǝ'Jebus mǝnia ka, ɓǝ̀ sǝm nong kam.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 19:12" />Sǝama mǝtala-ɓala male banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Pà sǝm nǝ̀ kàr aɓa nggea-là mala amǝ'kúnɗàngna, mǝnana amǝ'Isǝrayila na raka ɗàng. Sǝm nǝ̀ lidǝmba nǝ gya aban ká Gibiya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 19:13" />Pǝlǝa ne guro male ama, &lt;&lt;Fa, ɓǝ̀ sǝm ɓariki ɓǝ̀ sǝm bik Gibiya ko Rama, sǝ sǝm nǝ̀ nong aɓa mwashat atà abân mǝnia ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 19:14" />Nda à lidǝmba nǝ gya, sǝ pwari yi kpa lang à gbàshìban Gibiya a bu-nzali mala amǝ'tàu mala Benjami ka. <verse eid="JDG 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 19:15" />Pǝlǝa à kàr a banì ace mǝnana à nǝ̀ kùtí ace nongŋo aɓa Gibiya ka. À yiu aɓa nggea-lê sǝ à do a patal mala nggea-lê, acemǝnana kǝɓwa ea a ɓala male ɓǝà kya nong kam ɗàng.<verse eid="JDG 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 19:16" />Zuku ka, ɓè jamgula nia loapi túró a ɓaban male kǝ yiu nǝ pwarikpǝra mǝno ka. Ɓwabure ka ɓwa nzali múr-ankono mala Ifǝrem na; sǝ yì ka ndanǝdo a Gibiya kǝla bǝri-ɓwa. (Aɓwana mǝnana à ndanǝdo a là mǝno ka, amǝ'tàu mala Benjami na.) <verse eid="JDG 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 19:17" />Lang jamgula man loasǝ mǝsǝi sǝ sǝn bǝri a patal mala nggea-lê ka, pǝlǝa ɗì ama, &lt;&lt;A pùr nǝ kǝshe? Sǝ aya ban sǝ awu nǝ̀ ká?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 19:18" />Ɓwa'Lawi eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝm pùr a Betalami a bu-nzali Yahuda; sǝm nggǝ umnǝ o kuko a nkanggariban mala nzali múr-ankono mala Ifǝrem, ban mǝnana ǝn pur kàm ngga. Ən wari a Betalami a bu-nzali Yahuda, sǝ adyan ngga mǝ ndaban nyare mǝ nǝ o a là mem, sǝ kǝɓwa pà kàm em a ɓala male ɗàng. <verse eid="JDG 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 19:19" />Sǝm ndanǝ mǝsǝkuri andǝ dǝmo ace amǝdambǝriso ma'sǝm, sǝ sǝm ndanǝ girlina andǝ mùr-anap ace ɓamur rǝ sǝm, sǝm aguro mò, mim, sǝ ɓwama man andǝ lagga mana atà sǝm ngga. Sǝm ɗwanyi kǝgir ɗàng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 19:20" />Sǝ jamgule bang ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ rǝ wun pwalo! Mǝ nǝ pa wun gìr mǝnana kat wu earce ka. Sǝama wu kǝa nongŋo a patal ɗàng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 19:21" />Nda yinǝia a ɓala male, sǝ pe amǝdambǝriso dǝmo. Sǝ à lakkia wia akusǝia, à lǐ sǝ à nu.<verse eid="JDG 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 19:22" />Lang bân na rǝ ɓoaria wia ka, kara aɓea aburana amǝɓealɓike mala nggea-lê yi gumbǝli ɓalae, sǝ à camarǝ walki kúnɓala. À banggi jamgula, mǝtala ɓalae ama, &lt;&lt;Pusǝa sǝm ɓwabura mana yiu a ɓala mò ka, ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ sǝm súrǝì.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 19:23" />Pǝlǝa mǝtala ɓalae puro abania a nza sǝ nea wia ama, &lt;&lt;Awo, wun amǝ'eambǝam! Wu kǝa pàk gìr ɓealɓikea man ɗàng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 19:17">Tite 19:17</ref></char>.</note> Acemǝnana mǝnia yì ɓwabura ka bǝri na a ɓala mem ngga, wu kǝa pàk gìr ɓeakǝno man ɗàng! <verse eid="JDG 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 19:24" />Wu sǝni, muna-ɓwama mem mǝnana nsari na ka, andǝ mā-twala mala ɓwabure ka, à ndya ka. Mǝ nǝ pusǝia ado; wu gbária sǝ wu pàk gìr mǝnana wu earkiyice pangnǝia ka. Sǝama wu kǝa pàk mǝnia yì gìr kǝsǝkya ka arǝ ɓwabura man ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 34:2">Tite 34:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 21:14">Nggur 21:14</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="JDG 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 19:25" />Sǝ aburane ka à ɓinǝ kwakikiria arǝì. Nda ɓwa'Lawi gbami mā-twala male sǝ wari nǝi abania a nza. Sǝ à nongnǝi, à kìɗikì aɓa du kat bà kwaro mala bân. Sǝ lang bân tita pàk mbul-mbul ka, à ɗeki o. <verse eid="JDG 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 19:26" />Nǝ ban'mbul-mbul ka ɓwame yiu yi kpa a kún ɓala mala ɓwabura mǝnana mǝtala-ɓala male nakam ngga bà kwaro mala bân. <verse eid="JDG 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 19:27" />Lang mǝtala-ɓala male lo nǝ dǝmbari, mǝn kún ɓala sǝ pur a nza ace mǝnana nǝ̀ lidǝmba nǝ gya male ka, kara sǝn mā-twala male aban nongŋo a kún ɓala nǝ abui amur bankutio mala kún ɓala. <verse eid="JDG 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 19:28" />Pǝlǝa ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Lo, ɓǝ̀ sǝm o!&gt;&gt; Sǝama okban ɗǝong. Nda twali, tsǝì a nzǝm mǝdambǝriso, sǝ bwal njar aban oa là ka. <verse eid="JDG 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 19:29" />Lang bingŋǝna là ka, twal byau sǝ kasǝki abare lú mā-twala male arǝ abanì lum-nong-ɓari, sǝ túrban nǝ koya bare mwashat ka arǝ abu-nzali kat mala amǝ Isǝrayila. <verse eid="JDG 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 19:30" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 9:9">Hos 9:9</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 10:9">10:9</ref></char>.</note>Sǝ koyan mǝnana sǝni ka, bang ama, &lt;&lt;Gìr kǝla mǝnia ka kumban, ko à sǝni a kǝ fara ɗàng, twal a pwari mǝnana amǝ Isǝrayila purî ɓá nzali Masar ka, she yalung! Wu pàk ɗenyicau amurí, wu sǝngi, sǝ wu bang gìr mǝnana ɓoaro ɓǝà pàk ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JDG 20" />
  <para style="s">Lwa mala Isǝrayila arǝ tàu mala Benjami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 20:1" />Pǝlǝa amǝ Isǝrayila puppup puro, twal a bu-nzali Dan aban ká Biya-Sheba, kat andǝ <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nzali Gilǝyat </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ka nda bu takuli mala Nggeasala Jodan.</char></note>nzali Gilǝyat. Ɓwabundǝa yi ramba kǝla ɓwa mwashat aban Yahweh a Mizpa. <verse eid="JDG 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 20:2" />Aɓwana-mǝgule mala aɓwe kat, andǝ atau mala Isǝrayila kat, à yi twal bancame malea a ban ramba mala aɓwana mala Ɓakuli, mǝnana làkkì malea ka amǝ'lwa á-gbǝman-ine (400,000) na, mǝnana à nda aɓa kùrrǝu nǝ anggeabyau ka. <verse eid="JDG 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 20:3" />Amǝ'tàu mala Benjami ok ama Isǝrayila umǝna a Mizpa. Sǝ amǝ'Isǝrayila bang ama, &lt;&lt;Wu bǝla sǝm lang sǝ gìr mǝɓike man kumban?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 20:4" />Pǝlǝa Ɓwa'Lawi, bura ɓwame mǝnana à wal-lui ka, ear ama, &lt;&lt;Mim sǝnǝ mā-twala mem sǝm yiu a Gibiya a bu-nzali Benjami, ace mǝnana sǝm nǝ̀ nongŋo abanì ka. <verse eid="JDG 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 20:5" />Aɓa bu-dù mǝno ka, aburana mala Gibiya lo arǝàm, à gumbǝli ɓala mana sǝm sulǝ kam ngga. À earce ama à nǝ̀ wal-luem, sǝama a kún mani ka, à gbárí mā-twala mem, gandǝa wǔ. <verse eid="JDG 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 20:6" />Ən twal lú mā-twala mem sǝ ǝn kasǝki arǝ abare mwashat-mwashat, sǝ ǝn túrban nǝ abare arǝ abân aɓa nzali liɓala kat mala Isǝrayila, acemǝnana à pàngŋǝ̀nà ɓealɓikea andǝ ɓwaɓana mala pa-kǝsǝkya a Isǝrayila. <verse eid="JDG 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 20:7" />Ado ka, wun amǝ Isǝrayila kat, wu na mana nda kwarkiru ma'wun andǝ gìr mǝnana ɓoaro ɓǝà pè amúr cau man ngga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 20:8" />Pǝlǝa aɓwana kat lo gǝu kǝla ɓwa mwashat ama, &lt;&lt;Kǝɓwa atà sǝm pà nǝ̀ o a ɓala male ɗàng, sǝ kǝɓwa atà sǝm pà nǝ̀ nyar a là male ɗàng! <verse eid="JDG 20:8" /><verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="JDG 20:9-10" />Mǝnia ka, nda gìr mǝnana sǝm nǝ̀ pàkkî Gibiya ka: aɓa koya tàu mala Isǝrayila ka, sǝm nǝ̀ twal aburana lum aɓa gbǝman, gbǝman-mwashat aɓa á-mwashat, sǝ á-mwashat aɓa á-gbǝman-mwashat, ɓǝà yinǝ girlina ace amǝ'lwa. Sǝ sǝm nǝ̀ bwal-shishar ace tàr aburana mǝnana à nǝ̀ ká arǝ Gibiya a bu-nzali Benjami nǝ lwa ka. Sǝ lang à warina ka, ɓǝà mbwe ka amǝ Gibiya a kúnì ɓwaɓana mala pa-kǝsǝkya mǝnana à pè a Isǝrayila ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 20:9-10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 20:11" />Nda aburana mala Isǝrayila kat ram rǝia ace kánǝ lwa arǝ nggea-lê, sǝ à kpapimúrià kǝla ɓwa mwashat ka.<verse eid="JDG 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 20:12" />Atau mala Isǝrayila túr aburana arǝ abân aɓa bu-nzali mala tàu mala Benjami puppup nǝ cau ama, &lt;&lt;Mana nda man yì ɓealɓikea mǝnana kumban aɓalǝ wun ngga?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 13:14-15">Nggur 13:14-15</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="JDG 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 20:13" />Adyan ngga, wu pusǝki amǝ'ɓealɓana mǝnana aɓalǝ wun a Gibiya ka, ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ sǝm wal-luia, sǝ ɓǝ̀ sǝm esǝki ɓealɓikea a Isǝrayila.&gt;&gt; Sǝama amǝ'tàu mala Benjami ɓinǝ kwakikiria arǝ gi ka amǝ'eambia, amǝ Isǝrayila. <verse eid="JDG 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 20:14" />Pǝlǝa amǝ'tàu mala Benjami purki arǝ anggea-là, sǝ à yi ram rǝia abanɓwáná a Gibiya ace oa munǝo arǝ amǝ Isǝrayila. <verse eid="JDG 20:14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="JDG 20:15-16" />A pwari mǝno ka, amǝ'tàu mala Benjami ramba amǝ'lwa á-lumi-ɓari nǝ á-tongno-nong-mwashat (26,000) mǝnana à purki arǝ anggea-là malea, sǝ à kùrna rǝia nǝ anggeabyau ka. Tsǝa amur amǝnia ka, amǝ'do aɓa Gibiya tàrki aburana gbǝman-tongno-nong-ɓari (700) mana anggaro na ka; koyan atea ka nǝ̀ gandǝ túr tali nǝ ntamso arǝ mǝsǝ nyang mwashat sǝ pà nǝ̀ pǝ́tì ɗàng. <verse eid="JDG 20:15-16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 20:17" />Pǝlǝa cili aburana mala Isǝrayila (mana tàu mala Benjami pà aɓalǝia raka) ram rǝia, amǝ'lwa á-gbǝman-ine (400,000) mǝnana à kùrna rǝia nǝ anggeabyau ka; yià kat ka akanggǝrang amǝ'lwa na.<verse eid="JDG 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 20:18" />Aburana mala Isǝrayila lo sǝ à wari a Betel, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 27:21">Ɓal 27:21</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 18:5">Akas 18:5</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 14:37">1Sam 14:37</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 14:10">1Acau 14:10</ref></char></note>sǝ à ɗì Ɓakuli ama, &lt;&lt;Ya tàu nani nǝ̀ aka sǝm dǝmba kánǝ munǝo arǝ amǝ'tàu mala Benjami?&gt;&gt; Sǝ Yahweh earia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Tàu mala Yahuda na nǝ̀ tita ká ka.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 1:1">Akas 1:1</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="JDG 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 20:19" />Pǝlǝa amǝ Isǝrayila lo nǝ dǝmbari sǝ à kya tsǝk kàttì malea a nkanggari Gibiya. <verse eid="JDG 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 20:20" />Sǝ à pur ace soa munǝo arǝ amǝ'tàu mala Benjami; à tsǝk amǝ'lwa malea à cam a nzong ban-je munǝo a Gibiya. <verse eid="JDG 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 20:21" />Amǝ'tàu mala Benjami purî ɓá Gibiya, sǝ à yi wal-lú aburana mala amǝ'Isǝrayila á-lumi-ɓari nǝ á-ɓari (22,000) a kun-munǝo a pwari mǝno.<verse eid="JDG 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="JDG 20:22-23" />Amǝ'Isǝrayila wario à kya ɓua aɓadǝm Yahweh bà pwarikpǝra. Pǝlǝa à ɗì Yahweh ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ sǝm kyan ɗǝm nǝ munǝo arǝ amǝ'eam sǝm amǝ'tàu mala Benjami le?&gt;&gt; Yahweh earia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Wu kya arǝia ɗǝm.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:22-23">Aburana, amǝ'lwa mala amǝ'Isǝrayila kum ɓabumcandǝa, sǝ à kya cam a nzong ban-je munǝo, a kǝ̀ ban mǝnana à cam kam a dǝmbe ka.<verse eid="JDG 20:22-23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 20:24" />Anggo sǝ amǝ'Isǝrayila wari arǝ amǝ'tàu mala Benjami a ɓaria nongŋo. <verse eid="JDG 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 20:25" />Lang amǝ'lwa mala tàu mala Benjami purî ɓá Gibiya sǝ à soa munǝ arǝ amǝ'Isǝrayila, a ɓaria pwari ka, à wal-lú aburana á-lum-bwamdǝ-tongno-nong-tàrú (18,000) mala amǝ'Isǝrayila. Yia mǝno kat ka, aburana amǝ'lwa nǝ nggeabyau na.<verse eid="JDG 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 20:26" />Pǝlǝa amǝ'Isǝrayila kat, yì amǝ'lwa malea puppup, à eauwe sǝ à yiu a Betel, sǝ à ɓua. À do abanì aɓadǝm Yahweh, sǝ à gilmùr a pwari mǝno ka, bà pwarikpǝra. À pàgir mala pisǝe kǝring andǝ pàgir mala dotarǝu aɓadǝm Yahweh. <verse eid="JDG 20:26" /><verse number="27-28" style="v" sid="JDG 20:27-28" />(A bàkú mǝno ka, Akwati Kùrcau mala Ɓakuli na kanó, sǝ Finehas muna-ɓwabura mala Eleaza, mǝ'kà Haruna ka, nda mǝnana pàkkiyi túró-pǝris aɓadǝmbi ka.) Amǝ Isǝrayila ɗì Yahweh ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ sǝm kyan nǝ munǝo ɗǝm arǝ amǝ'eam sǝm amǝ'tàu mala Benjami le, ko ɓǝ̀ sǝm tamsǝ munǝo?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:27-28">Yahweh nea wia ama, &lt;&lt;Wu kyane, acemǝnana liwi ka, Mǝ nǝ̀ pà wunia a ɓabù wun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 20:27-28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 20:29" />Nda Isǝrayila tsǝk aburana à kùmsǝó, à kàrì Gibiya. <verse eid="JDG 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 20:30" />Pǝlǝa Isǝrayila wari arǝ amǝ'tàu mala Benjami a tàruia pwari, sǝ à twal bancame malea ace soa munǝo kǝla mana à pè aɓalǝ anonggio mana à kutiki ka. <verse eid="JDG 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 20:31" />Pǝlǝa aburana mala tàu mala Benjami puro ace je-munǝo andǝia, sǝ Isǝrayila nunia à upi nggea-là. Sǝ kǝla mǝnana à pè arǝ aɓea apwari ka, amǝ'tàu mala Benjami tita walkia sǝ à wal-lú aɓea aɓwana ateà amur anjargula: mana umnǝ Betel ka andǝ mana umnǝ Gibiya ka, sǝ aɓa ɓawan. À wal-lú amǝ'Isǝrayila kǝla aɓwana lumi-tàrú. <verse eid="JDG 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 20:32" />Nda amǝ'tàu mala Benjami bang ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝm ndarǝ gandǝia kǝla mana atadǝmbe ka.&gt;&gt; Sǝ amǝ'Isǝrayila ka, à na ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ sǝm ɓangŋa sǝ ɓǝà pǝrta sǝm ɓǝ̀ sǝm nunia ɓǝà upi nggea-là ɗār amúr anjargula.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 20:33" />Sǝ koya ɓwabura mala Isǝrayila ka loapi ban male sǝ dǝshi Ba'al-Tamar, ban mǝnana à kya ram rǝia kàm ngga. Sǝ aburana mala Isǝrayila mana à kumsǝ ka, à purki pat arǝ abân kumsǝó malea a ɓawan mana kàrì Gibiya ka. <verse eid="JDG 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 20:34" />Nda amǝ'lwa á-lum, aburana mana à kwar aɓa lwa ka, purî ɓá Isǝrayila kat, sǝ à dǝshi Gibiya, sǝ munǝo yi candǝ kǝ̀rkǝ́r. Sǝ amǝ'tàu mala Benjami ka, à sǝlǝ ama gir'murmwana naban yiu amúrià ɗàng. <verse eid="JDG 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 20:35" />Sǝ Yahweh gandǝ amǝ'tàu mala Benjami aɓadǝm Isǝrayila, mǝnana tsǝa amǝ'Isǝrayila wal-lú amǝ'lwa mala tàu mala Benjami, aɓwana á-lumi-ɓari-bwamdǝ-tongno nǝ gbǝman-mwashat (25,100), a pwari mǝno, sǝ yià mǝno kat ka amǝ'lwa nǝ nggeabyau na.<verse eid="JDG 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 20:36" />Nda amǝ'tàu mala Benjami sǝni ka amǝ'Isǝrayila gandǝnia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:36">Amǝ'Isǝrayila nyar nǝtea arǝ ká arǝ amǝ'tàu mala Benjami, acemǝnana à gūlì arǝ aburana malea mana à tsǝ̀ngŋǝ̀nia à kùmsǝ̀nà a nkanggari Gibiya ka. <verse eid="JDG 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 20:37" />Pǝlǝa aburana mana à kumsǝ ka, à latti arǝ nggea-là Gibiya, sǝ à mesǝ amurí; à pàktúró nǝ kún anggeabyau malea sǝ à wal-lú koyan mǝnana aɓalǝi ka. <verse eid="JDG 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 20:38" />Gir'lǝmdǝa mǝnana à earna amurí anre ka aburana mala Isǝrayila andǝ aburana mana à kumsǝ ka, nda mǝnana ama à nǝ̀ loasǝ nggea yele aɓa nggea-là aban o a kuli. <verse eid="JDG 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 20:39" />Sǝ lang mǝno pángŋǝ̀nà ka, aburana mala Isǝrayila nǝ̀ wulio arǝ amǝ'lwa mala tàu mala Benjami nǝ munǝo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:39">Sǝama kaniama mǝno yi kumban ngga, amǝ'lwa mala tàu mala Benjami walna-lú atà aburana mala Isǝrayila kǝla lumi-tàrú. Sǝ à nani arǝarǝia ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓafo, sǝm ndarǝ gandǝia kǝla mana aɓa munǝo mǝdǝmbe ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 20:40" />Sǝ lang gupi mala yele tita lo aɓa nggea-là aban o a kuli ka, amǝ'lwa mala tàu mala Benjami pǝlǝ mǝsǝia anzǝmia sǝ à sǝni ka, yele angŋa nggea-lê puppup aban o a kuli. <verse eid="JDG 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 20:41" />Pǝlǝa aburana mala Isǝrayila wulio, sǝ amǝ'lwa mala tàu mala Benjami ka, ɓangciu bwalia sǝ à gǝggǝli kǝ̀rkǝ́r acemǝnana à sǝni ka, gir'murmwana sulǝna amúrià. <verse eid="JDG 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 20:42" />Acemani ka, à pǝlǝ nzǝmia arǝ aburana mala Isǝrayila sǝ à tsǝkmuria nǝ njargula ɓabondo, sǝ kat andǝ amani ka, à apî munǝo ɗang. Amǝ Isǝrayila mǝnana à purki aɓalǝ anggea-là ka, à kùtí a wal-luia aɓalǝia. <verse eid="JDG 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 20:43" />À gumbǝli amǝ'tàu mala Benjami aɓalǝu, sǝ à pǝrtea, twal a Noha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:43 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">twal a Noha </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko &lt;&lt;usǝlǝo pa kàm ɗàng&gt;&gt;</char></note> sǝ à yi ɓākia aban ká ɗār a nkāɓe Gibiya a bù takuli. <verse eid="JDG 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 20:44" />Amǝ'lwa á-lum-bwamdǝ-tongno-nong-tàrú (18,000) mala amǝ'tàu mala Benjami kpa, sǝ yià mǝno kat ka, akanggǝrang amǝ'lwa na. <verse eid="JDG 20:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 20:45" />Acilia wulio sǝ à ɓangŋa aban o nǝ ɓabondo, à tsǝkmuria aban ká tali mala Rimon. Sǝama amǝ'Isǝrayila wal-lú aɓwana atea á-tongno (5,000) amúr anjargula. À pìtea aban ká Gidom, sǝ à kya wal-lú aɓea aburana kàm á-ɓari. <verse eid="JDG 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 20:46" />A pwari mǝno ka, tàu mala Benjami ɗwanyi akanggǝrang amǝ'lwa á-lumi-ɓari-bwamdǝ-tongno (25,000) a munǝo; sǝ yià mǝno kat ka amǝ'lwa nǝ nggeabyau na. <verse eid="JDG 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 20:47" />Sǝama aburana gbǝman-tongno-nong-mwashat (600) auwa sǝ à ɓangŋa à umnǝ ɓabondo aban ká a tali mala Rimon, sǝ à ue kano a tali mala Rimon zongŋo ine. <verse eid="JDG 20:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 20:48" />Pǝlǝa aburana mala Isǝrayila nyar arǝ aɓwana mala tàu mala Benjami, sǝ à wal-lú koya ɓwa andǝ girkusǝu mǝnana à kumi nǝyilǝmu aɓa nggea-lê ka puppup. Sǝ koya là na à kumi ka, à soaki wi bǝsa.<verse eid="JDG 20:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JDG 21" />
  <para style="s">Amamǝna ace aburana mala tàu mala Benjami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 21:1" />Aburana mala Isǝrayila kánagìr a Mizpa ama, &lt;&lt;Kǝɓwa pà atà sǝm nǝ̀ pà muna-ɓwama male ɓǝ̀ al ɓwabura a tàu mala Benjami ɗàng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 21:2" />Nda amǝ Isǝrayila yiu a Betel, sǝ à dumnǝdo abanì a ɓadǝm Ɓakuli bà kpa mala pwari, sǝ à loasǝ già à ɓua, ɓua mǝkwanbanì. <verse eid="JDG 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 21:3" />À bang ama, &lt;&lt;We Yahweh Ɓakuli mala Isǝrayila, palang sǝ mǝnia yì gìr ka kumban a Isǝrayila, ama yalung ngga à nǝ̀ ɗwanyi tàu mwashat a Isǝrayila?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JDG 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 21:4" />Lang ban fana ka, à lo nǝ dǝmbari ɗiɗyal, sǝ à ɓak gyangŋan abanì. À pàgir mala pisǝe kǝring andǝ pàgir mala dotarǝu. <verse eid="JDG 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 21:5" />Sǝ à bang ama, &lt;&lt;Ya tàu na atà atau mala Isǝrayila yiu a ramba-banɓwáná aɓadǝm Yahweh ɗàng?&gt;&gt; Acemǝnana à kanǝna nggea kángìr amúr ɓwa mana yiu a ramba-banɓwáná aɓadǝm Yahweh a Mizpa raka, ama, &lt;&lt;Mbak-kàngkàng à nǝ̀ wal-lui.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 21:6" />Amǝ Isǝrayila pàk bumkiɗikea nǝ gìr mǝnana kum amǝ'tàu mala mǝ'eambia, Benjami ka, sǝ à bang ama, &lt;&lt;Yalung ngga sǝm ɗwanyini tàu mwashat aɓalǝ atau ma'sǝm. <verse eid="JDG 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 21:7" />Lang sǝ sǝm nǝ̀ kum amamǝna ace aburana mana à ueo nǝyilǝmu a tàu mala Benjami ngga? Sǝm kánagìr aɓa lullǝu Yahweh ama, pà sǝm nǝ̀ pea wia amuna-mamǝna ma'sǝm ɓǝà alia ɗàng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 21:8" />Nda à ɗìban ama, &lt;&lt;Ya tàu na aɓalǝ atau mala Isǝrayila mǝnana yiu a ramba-banɓwáná aɓadǝm Yahweh a Mizpa raka?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni a: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 21:5">Akas 21:5</ref></char>.</note> Sǝ à yi sǝni ka, kǝɓwa pà kàm a <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 11:1">1Sam 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 31:11-13">31:11-13</ref></char>.</note>Jabesh-Gilǝyat mǝnana yiu a kàttì mala ramba-banɓwáná ka ɗàng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 21:9" />Lang à ɓalkiban ngga, à yi sǝni ka, kǝ ɓwa pà kàm atà amǝ'do a Jabesh-Gilǝyat a banì ɗàng. <verse eid="JDG 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 21:10" />Nda ɓwabundǝa tasǝ akanggǝrang amǝ'lwa malea á-lum-nong-ɓari (12,000) sǝ à sà'arǝia ama, &lt;&lt;Wu kyane wu wal-lú aɓwana mǝnana à ndanǝdo a Jabesh-Gilǝyat ka nǝ kún nggeabyau, kat andǝ amamǝna andǝ amuna-mǝkeke. <verse eid="JDG 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 21:11" />Wu pàk mǝnia ka: koya ɓwabura, andǝ koya ɓwama mana súrǝ́nà ɓwabura ka, wu twaltea kat-kat.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 21:12" />Sǝ à yi kum atà aɓwana mana à ndanǝdo a Jabesh-Gilǝyat ka, alo-ɓwa ansarina gbǝman-ine, mǝnana à malaká súrǝ̀ ɓwabura raka; sǝ à yinǝia a kàttì a Shilo, mǝnana nda aɓa nzali Kan'ana ka.<verse eid="JDG 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 21:13" />Pǝlǝa ɓwabundǝa puppup túrban nǝ cau aban amǝ'tàu mala Benjami mǝnana à nda a <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 20:47">Akas 20:47</ref></char>.</note>tali mala Rimon ngga, sǝ à hambia wia dorǝpwala. <verse eid="JDG 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 21:14" />Nda aburana mala tàu mala Benjami nyare a bákú mǝno, sǝ à pea wia amamǝna mǝnana à amsǝia nǝyilǝmu aɓalǝ amamǝna mala Jabesh-Gilǝyat ka. Sǝama amamǝne karǝa amúrià ɗàng.<verse eid="JDG 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 21:15" />Aɓwana mala Isǝrayila pàk bumkiɗikea ace gìr mǝnana kum amǝ'tàu mala Benjami ka; acemǝnana Yahweh gbakǝrina atau mala Isǝrayila. <verse eid="JDG 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 21:16" />Nda aɓwana-mǝgule amur ɓwabundǝa bang ama, &lt;&lt;Amamǝna mala tàu mala Benjami ka, à twalnatea. Mana ado sǝm nǝ̀ pa ace kum amamǝna ace acili aburana mana à ue ka?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 21:17" />À na ama, &lt;&lt;Dumǝna púp ama acili aɓwana mala Benjami mana à au ka, ɓǝà kum malea amǝ'liɓala, ace mana ɓekǝ tàu a Isǝrayila ɓǝ̀ kǝa ɓwar raka. <verse eid="JDG 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 21:18" />Sǝama pà sǝm nǝ̀ gandǝ pea wia amamǝna atà aɓoarnsarile sǝm ɗang, acemǝnana amǝ Isǝrayila kánagìr ama, &lt;Ɓwa mǝnana kat pè ɓwa'Benjami ɓwama ka, ɓǝ̀ suban sulǝo amur ɓwe!&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 21:19" />Nda à bang ama, &lt;&lt;Wu sǝni, lamsan mala Yahweh mǝnana à kǝ pê koya pǝlǝa a Shilo ka malanǝ̀ yiu.&gt;&gt; (Shilo ka nda a njar-nza mala Betel, a njar-kunmur mala Lebona, sǝ a takuli mala njargula mǝnana anre Betel andǝ Shekem ngga.) <verse eid="JDG 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 21:20" />À ne amǝ'tàu mala Benjami ama, &lt;&lt;Wu kyane wu kùmsǝ aɓalǝ aɓaban-anap, <verse eid="JDG 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 21:21" />sǝ wun nǝ̀ tsǝk mǝsǝ wun. Ɓǝ̀ wu sǝni ansarina mala Shilo purna ace tàki-anggwam ngga, pǝlǝa wun nǝ̀ purî ɓalǝ aɓaban-anap, sǝ koya ɓwa atà wun ngga ɓǝ̀ gbami male yì ɓwama ace ɓamurì aɓalǝ ansarina mala Shilo, sǝ wu o a nzali Benjami. <verse eid="JDG 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 21:22" />Sǝ nǝ̀ ya do ama atárrià ko amǝ'eambǝia nǝ̀ yiu ace lǝmdǝ ɓua malea aban sǝm, sǝ sǝm nǝ̀ banggia wia ama, &lt;Wu ɓwamur sǝm acea, acemǝnana sǝm gandǝnǝ kúmbi koyan atea ka male yì ɓwama a kun-munǝo ɗàng. Sǝ wun gbal ka, wu pea wia ɗàng, ɓǝ̀ ana raka ado ka wun nǝ̀ duk amǝ'kumcau.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="JDG 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 21:23" />Aburana mala tàu mala Benjami pè kǝla mǝnana à banggia wia ka. À twalki amamǝna kǝla mana làkkì malea pàk ka, aɓalǝ amǝ'tà-nggwam sǝ à umnǝia. Pǝlǝa à nyare à o a nzali liɓala malea, sǝ à kya ɓǝsǝlǝ-ɓakki alá, sǝ à do aɓalǝia. <verse eid="JDG 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 21:24" />Nda amǝ'Isǝrayila mesǝì ban mǝno a pwari mǝno; à o arǝ atau andǝ anggurkwar malea, sǝ koya ɓwa ka nyar a nzali liɓala male.<verse eid="JDG 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 21:25" />A bàkú mǝno ka, murǝm pà kàm a Isǝrayila ɗàng. Koyan ngga pàk gìr mǝnana sǝni ɓoari wi a mǝsǝi ka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 17:6">Akas 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 18:1">18:1</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 19:1">19:1</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="JDG 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 21" />
</usx>